rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If Treasure Map leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, you can\'t put a landmark counter on it. However, if it somehow already had three landmark counters on it before it left the battlefield, you\'ll get three Treasures."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a third landmark counter is put on Treasure Map by something other than the resolution of its first ability (as modified by any applicable replacement effects), you won\'t remove those counters, transform Treasure Map, or get Treasures yet. You\'ll have to wait until you activate its first ability again."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Ixalan mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/ixalan-mechanics).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If you have fewer cards in your library than the amount of damage Gishath deals, you reveal the cards you have. Because you\'re not drawing cards, you don\'t lose the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'If you control a creature that will be removed from the battlefield "at the beginning of the next end step," you can resolve the ability of Growing Rites of Itlimoc before that creature leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'If you gain control of a creature "until end of turn," or if a noncreature permanent you control becomes a creature "until end of turn," it\\\'ll be a creature under your control through the entire end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "The last ability of Growing Rites of Itlimoc doesn\'t trigger if you don\'t control four or more creatures as your end step begins. If you don\'t control four or more creatures as it resolves, it does nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Ixalan mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/ixalan-mechanics).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you didn\'t gain life during the turn before the end step begins, Resplendent Angel\'s triggered ability won\'t trigger at all. Gaining life during the end step won\'t cause the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t satisfy Resplendent Angel\'s triggered ability, even though it caused your team\'s life total to increase."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Resplendent Angel\'s triggered ability checks if you gained 5 or more life total during the turn. It doesn\'t matter if you also lost life or whether your life total is greater than it was at the beginning of the turn. It also doesn\'t matter whether Resplendent Angel was on the battlefield when any of the life gain happened."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'You create only one Angel token, no matter how many times you gained 5 or more life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You don\'t need to have gained 5 life all at once to satisfy Resplendent Angel\'s triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'The spell can\\\'t be countered if the mana produced by Cavern of Souls is spent to cover any cost of the spell, even an additional cost such as a kicker cost. This is true even if you use the mana to pay an additional cost while casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Warrior. Card types such as artifact can\'t be chosen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with "when," "whenever," or "at") are unaffected by the last ability of Sorcerous Spyglass.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Sorcerous Spyglass affects cards regardless of what zone they\'re in. This includes cards in hand, cards in the graveyard, and exiled cards."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can choose any card name, even if that card doesn\'t normally have an activated ability. You\'re not limited to the names of cards you saw in the opponent\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose the name of a token unless that token has the same name as a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A creature attacks alone if it\'s the only creature declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step. For example, the triggered ability of Grasping Shadows won\'t trigger if you attack with multiple creatures and all but one of them are removed from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Grasping Shadows keeps its dread counters as it transforms into Shadows\' Lair."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the ability of Grasping Shadows has triggered, creatures entering the battlefield attacking won\'t affect that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A permanent card is an artifact, battle, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card. Tokens are not cards, and while tokens are put into the graveyard before ceasing to exist, that action doesn\'t count as a player having descended."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn" will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many times you descended this turn. However, if you haven\\\'t descended this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\\\'t trigger at all. It\\\'s not possible to put a permanent card into your graveyard during the end step in time to have the ability trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "An opponent with zero cards in hand can\'t choose to discard a card. Similarly, an opponent with no permanents can\'t choose to sacrifice a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In either case, it doesn\'t matter if those cards are still in that player\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple cards have abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn." These cards don\\\'t need to have been under your control at the time you descended. For example, if a permanent card is put into your graveyard during your first main phase and you cast Stalactite Stalker your second main phase, its ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to a player who has "descended this turn." This means that a permanent card has been put into that player\\\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some cards refer to the number of times a player descended this turn. Those cards care about the number of permanent cards put into that player\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A permanent card is an artifact, battle, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card. Tokens are not cards, and while tokens are put into the graveyard before ceasing to exist, that action doesn\'t count as a player having descended."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn" will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many times you descended this turn. However, if you haven\\\'t descended this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\\\'t trigger at all. It\\\'s not possible to put a permanent card into your graveyard during the end step in time to have the ability trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you control a creature that is both a Fungus and a Saproling, it counts only once for The Mycotyrant\'s middle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In either case, it doesn\'t matter if those cards are still in that player\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple cards have abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn." These cards don\\\'t need to have been under your control at the time you descended. For example, if a permanent card is put into your graveyard during your first main phase and you cast Stalactite Stalker your second main phase, its ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to a player who has "descended this turn." This means that a permanent card has been put into that player\\\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some cards refer to the number of times a player descended this turn. Those cards care about the number of permanent cards put into that player\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The ability that defines The Mycotyrant\'s power and toughness works in all zones. As long as The Mycotyrant is on the battlefield (and still a Fungus, or somehow a Saproling), that ability will count The Mycotyrant itself."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A permanent card is an artifact, battle, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card. Tokens are not cards, and while tokens are put into the graveyard before ceasing to exist, that action doesn\'t count as a player having descended."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn" will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many times you descended this turn. However, if you haven\\\'t descended this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\\\'t trigger at all. It\\\'s not possible to put a permanent card into your graveyard during the end step in time to have the ability trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In either case, it doesn\'t matter if those cards are still in that player\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple cards have abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn." These cards don\\\'t need to have been under your control at the time you descended. For example, if a permanent card is put into your graveyard during your first main phase and you cast Stalactite Stalker your second main phase, its ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to a player who has "descended this turn." This means that a permanent card has been put into that player\\\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some cards refer to the number of times a player descended this turn. Those cards care about the number of permanent cards put into that player\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You decide to pay 1 life as the last ability is resolving. If you decide to pay 1 life and Corpses of the Lost is still on the battlefield, it will immediately return to its owner\'s hand. No player may take any actions in between you deciding to pay life and it returning this way."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A permanent card is an artifact, battle, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card. Tokens are not cards, and while tokens are put into the graveyard before ceasing to exist, that action doesn\'t count as a player having descended."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn" will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many times you descended this turn. However, if you haven\\\'t descended this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\\\'t trigger at all. It\\\'s not possible to put a permanent card into your graveyard during the end step in time to have the ability trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In either case, it doesn\'t matter if those cards are still in that player\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple cards have abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn." These cards don\\\'t need to have been under your control at the time you descended. For example, if a permanent card is put into your graveyard during your first main phase and you cast Stalactite Stalker your second main phase, its ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to a player who has "descended this turn." This means that a permanent card has been put into that player\\\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some cards refer to the number of times a player descended this turn. Those cards care about the number of permanent cards put into that player\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Stalactites are the ones that hang from the ceilings of caves. You might be thinking of stalagmites.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Use Stalactite Stalker\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the value of X."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A permanent card is an artifact, battle, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card. Tokens are not cards, and while tokens are put into the graveyard before ceasing to exist, that action doesn\'t count as a player having descended."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn" will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many times you descended this turn. However, if you haven\\\'t descended this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\\\'t trigger at all. It\\\'s not possible to put a permanent card into your graveyard during the end step in time to have the ability trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In either case, it doesn\'t matter if those cards are still in that player\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple cards have abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn." These cards don\\\'t need to have been under your control at the time you descended. For example, if a permanent card is put into your graveyard during your first main phase and you cast Stalactite Stalker your second main phase, its ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to a player who has "descended this turn." This means that a permanent card has been put into that player\\\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some cards refer to the number of times a player descended this turn. Those cards care about the number of permanent cards put into that player\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Activating Cavern Stomper\'s last ability after it has been blocked by one or more creatures with power 2 or less won\'t change or undo those blocks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Reducing a creature\'s power after it has blocked Cavern Stomper will not remove that blocking creature from combat or make Cavern Stomper unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "After drawing cards for Braided Quipu\'s ability, if you have two or fewer cards in your library, you\'ll put Braided Quipu on the bottom of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Braided Net\'s activated ability can target another nonland permanent that\'s already tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "No activated abilities of the target nonland permanent can be activated for as long as it remains tapped, even if those activated abilities\' costs involve untapping that permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once Braided Quipu is back in your library, Braided Net will be the face that\'s up again."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Although the Gnome tokens enter the battlefield as attacking creatures, they were never declared as attacking creatures. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger when they enter the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Anim Pakal, Thousandth Moon doesn\'t have to be one of the non-Gnome creatures you attack with in order for its ability to trigger, but it can be."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Anim Pakal is no longer on the battlefield when the triggered ability resolves, you\'ll still create Gnomes. Use the number of +1/+1 counters that were on it when it was last on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You choose which player, planeswalker, or battle the Gnome tokens are attacking. Each Gnome token can enter attacking a different player, planeswalker, or battle, and they don\'t need to be the same ones that the non-Gnome creatures are attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Although the creature card you put onto the battlefield is an attacking creature, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The Dinosaur, Merfolk, Pirate, and Vampire exiled to pay Throne of the Grim Captain\'s craft cost need to be separate objects. One creature with changeling is not enough."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You choose which player, planeswalker, or battle the creature you put onto the battlefield is attacking as it enters the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be the same player, planeswalker, or battle that The Grim Captain is attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Amalia Benavides Aguirre\'s power is checked only once, as the triggered ability resolves. If it is no longer on the battlefield at that point, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Amalia Benavides Aguirre\'s power must be exactly 20 during the resolution of its last ability after it finishes exploring in order to destroy all other creatures. If it\'s more or less than 20, nothing is destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to explore but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still explores. If you reveal a nonland card this way, you won\\\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you may put the revealed card into your graveyard. Effects that trigger "whenever a creature explores" trigger as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an ability instructs a creature to explore, its controller reveals the top card of their library. If it\'s a land card, they\'ll put it into their hand. Otherwise, they\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature, then choose to either leave that card on top of their library or put it into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If multiple creatures with lifelink you control deal combat damage at the same time, the damage dealt by each of those creatures is a separate life-gaining event and Amalia Benavides Aguirre\'s ability will trigger that many times."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no card is revealed, most likely because that player\'s library is empty, the exploring creature receives a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, noncreature permanents may explore. For example, if the creature card returned by Defossilize is somehow not a creature once it\'s on the battlefield, it can still explore. You\'ll take all the same actions, and you may end up putting a +1/+1 counter on the permanent. (Note that some effects target a creature, and those effects would still require a legal target to have it explore.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to explore begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the exploring creature after you reveal a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells or abilities might cause a creature to explore multiple times in a row. If you reveal a nonland card when a creature explores and leave it on top of your library, then the creature explores again immediately afterwards, you\'ll reveal the same card again."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The instruction for Amalia Benavides Aguirre to explore and the effect that occurs if Amalia Benavides Aguirre\'s power is exactly 20 are all part of the same ability. Players do not get to chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the explore."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "An Equipment that\'s also a creature can\'t be attached to anything. You can activate its equip ability, but it won\'t become attached."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'An artifact creature card or enchantment creature card returned this way will have base power and toughness 1/1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a double-faced card is exiled this way, it will return with its front face up, no matter which face was up when it left the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it ceases to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If another effect causes one of the returned permanents to become a creature and sets its base power and toughness as it does so, that creature will have that power and toughness; it won\'t be 1/1. Notably, crewing a Vehicle does not set its power and toughness, so a Vehicle will remain a 1/1 if you crew it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The exiled card will return to the battlefield at the beginning of the next end step even if Abuelo, Ancestral Echo is no longer on the battlefield at that time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Kellan, Daring Traveler is a white creature card whose mana value is 2. While there, it can\'t be the target of a spell or ability that targets only instant or sorcery cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library") and Kellan, Daring Traveler is on top of your library, you can cast Journey On, but not Kellan, Daring Traveler.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t put the card you reveal due to Kellan\'s triggered ability into your hand and you choose not to put it into your graveyard, it stays on top of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Journey On counts the number of opponents who control at least one artifact, not the number of artifacts opponents control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Map tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one is a colorless artifact with the artifact subtype Map and the ability "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Target creature you control explores. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some cards in other sets refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "An artifact creature you control counts only once towards the Gnome Soldier\'s power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Barracks of the Thousand\'s triggered ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The Gnome Soldier\'s ability will count the Gnome Soldier itself, so it will be at least 1/1."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The power and toughness of the Gnome Soldier token will change as the number of artifacts and/or creatures you control changes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Dusk Rose Reliquary leaves the battlefield before its last ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a double-faced card is exiled this way, it will return with its front face up, no matter which face was up when it left the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Because you choose the target of Soulcoil Viper\'s ability before you pay the cost of sacrificing it, Soulcoil Viper can\'t be the target of its own ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Finality counters aren\'t keyword counters, and a finality counter doesn\'t give any abilities to the permanent it\'s on. If that permanent loses its abilities and then would go to a graveyard, it will still be exiled instead."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Finality counters don\'t stop permanents from going to zones other than the graveyard from the battlefield. For example, if a permanent with a finality counter on it would be put into its owner\'s hand from the battlefield, it does so normally."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Finality counters work on any permanent, not only creatures. If a permanent with a finality counter on it would go to a graveyard from the battlefield, exile it instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple finality counters on a single permanent are redundant.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Belligerent Yearling\'s ability overwrites any previous effects that set its power, including previous instances of that ability. Other effects that set its power to specific values that start to apply after the ability resolves, including future instances of the ability, will overwrite that effect."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Effects that modify the power of Belligerent Yearling without setting it to a specific value will apply to the new base power no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Bloodletter of Aclazotz\'s last ability doesn\'t change the amount of damage dealt to opponents. For example, if a 1/1 creature with lifelink deals combat damage to an opponent on your turn, they would lose 2 life, but you\'d still gain only 1 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Bringer of the Last Gift\'s last ability triggers if you cast it from any zone. It doesn\'t trigger if you put Bringer of the Last Gift onto the battlefield without casting it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Casting the card again due to rebound\'s delayed triggered ability is optional. If you choose not to cast the card, or if you can\'t because an effect prohibits it, the card will stay exiled. You won\'t get another chance to cast it on a future turn. If you do cast the card, it\'s put into its owner\'s graveyard as normal once it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card is a copy of Ojer Pakpatiq, Deepest Epoch, it won\'t return to the battlefield when it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn\'t resolve for any reason, including being countered, that spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen, including rebound. The spell will be put into its owner\'s graveyard and you won\'t get to cast it again on your next turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Contested Game Ball\'s triggered ability triggers only once whenever you\'re dealt combat damage, no matter how many creatures deal combat damage to you at the same time."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If point counters are put on Contested Game Ball some way other than its last ability, you won\'t sacrifice it or create a Treasure token. The check for five or more point counters happens only as the activated ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, each player on the attacking team is an attacking player. When Contested Game Ball\'s first ability resolves, you\'ll choose which member of the attacking team gains control of it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Dauntless Dismantler\'s last ability destroys only artifacts whose mana values are exactly X."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an artifact an opponent controls enters the battlefield at the same time that Dauntless Dismantler enters the battlefield, Dauntless Dismantler\'s effect won\'t apply to that artifact."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Deepfathom Echo copies exactly what is printed on the chosen creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Deepfathom Echo becomes a copy of a creature that is copying something else, it becomes a copy of whatever that creature is a copy of.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to explore but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still explores. If you reveal a nonland card this way, you won\\\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you may put the revealed card into your graveyard. Effects that trigger "whenever a creature explores" trigger as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an ability instructs a creature to explore, its controller reveals the top card of their library. If it\'s a land card, they\'ll put it into their hand. Otherwise, they\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature, then choose to either leave that card on top of their library or put it into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no card is revealed, most likely because that player\'s library is empty, the exploring creature receives a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, Deepfathom Echo copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token. Deepfathom Echo doesn\'t become a token (although it might already be one)."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, noncreature permanents may explore. For example, if the creature card returned by Defossilize is somehow not a creature once it\'s on the battlefield, it can still explore. You\'ll take all the same actions, and you may end up putting a +1/+1 counter on the permanent. (Note that some effects target a creature, and those effects would still require a legal target to have it explore.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Non-copy effects that have already applied to Deepfathom Echo will continue to apply to it. For example, +1/+1 counters on it will still affect it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Once Deepfathom Echo becomes a copy of another creature, it no longer has its triggered ability until end of turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to explore begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the exploring creature after you reveal a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells or abilities might cause a creature to explore multiple times in a row. If you reveal a nonland card when a creature explores and leave it on top of your library, then the creature explores again immediately afterwards, you\'ll reveal the same card again."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Eaten by Piranhas overwrites all previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply afterward will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Effects that modify the creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Staggering Size, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the enchanted creature had any subtypes other than creature types, such as Equipment, Vehicle, or Cave, it loses those as well.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Finality counters aren\'t keyword counters, and a finality counter doesn\'t give any abilities to the permanent it\'s on. If that permanent loses its abilities and then would go to a graveyard, it will still be exiled instead."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Finality counters don\'t stop permanents from going to zones other than the graveyard from the battlefield. For example, if a permanent with a finality counter on it would be put into its owner\'s hand from the battlefield, it does so normally."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Finality counters work on any permanent, not only creatures. If a permanent with a finality counter on it would go to a graveyard from the battlefield, exile it instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you somehow activate The Tome of Aclazotz\'s ability more than once during a turn, you can cast a creature spell for each ability\'s permission. Similarly, if another effect allows you to cast a creature spell from your graveyard, you may use that permission and later use The Tomb of Aclazotz\'s ability to cast another creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple finality counters on a single permanent are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The creature spell you cast will be a Vampire in addition to its other types while on the stack. The resulting creature will be a Vampire in addition to its other types.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can discard your hand even if you hand has zero cards in it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose which creature spell you\'re casting while activating or resolving The Tomb of Aclazotz\'s last ability. The ability creates a permission for you to cast a creature spell from your graveyard later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for creature spells you cast with the permission granted by The Tomb of Aclazotz\'s last ability. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast them only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Finality counters aren\'t keyword counters, and a finality counter doesn\'t give any abilities to the permanent it\'s on. If that permanent loses its abilities and then would go to a graveyard, it will still be exiled instead."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Finality counters don\'t stop permanents from going to zones other than the graveyard from the battlefield. For example, if a permanent with a finality counter on it would be put into its owner\'s hand from the battlefield, it does so normally."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Finality counters work on any permanent, not only creatures. If a permanent with a finality counter on it would go to a graveyard from the battlefield, exile it instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Intrepid Paleontologist must be under your control in order to start casting a Dinosaur creature spell using its last ability, but it doesn\'t need to stay under your control throughout that process or be under your control as the spell resolves. If, for example, you sacrifice Intrepid Paleontologist to pay an additional cost of the spell or it\'s destroyed in response, the spell will still resolve normally."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple finality counters on a single permanent are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You must still pay all costs and follow any timing restrictions and permissions for Dinosaur creature spells you cast from exile this way. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast them only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Finality counters aren\'t keyword counters, and a finality counter doesn\'t give any abilities to the permanent it\'s on. If that permanent loses its abilities and then would go to a graveyard, it will still be exiled instead."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Finality counters don\'t stop permanents from going to zones other than the graveyard from the battlefield. For example, if a permanent with a finality counter on it would be put into its owner\'s hand from the battlefield, it does so normally."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Finality counters work on any permanent, not only creatures. If a permanent with a finality counter on it would go to a graveyard from the battlefield, exile it instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple finality counters on a single permanent are redundant.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "For the purpose of Temple of Power\'s last ability, you need to have controlled the red source that dealt noncombat damage only at the time that the damage was dealt. If it dies or changes control after that point, that damage will still count toward Temple of Power\'s activation restriction."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Ojer Axonil\'s second ability and additional replacement effects would modify how damage would be dealt, the player being dealt damage chooses the order in which to apply those effects."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card is a copy of Ojer Axonil, Deepest Might, it won\'t return to the battlefield when it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The 4 or more noncombat damage may be dealt by multiple red sources you controlled. For example, if you cast a red spell that dealt 3 damage to a creature and then a red artifact you controlled dealt 1 noncombat damage to a creature, you could activate Temple of Power\'s last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The comparison between the amount of noncombat damage being dealt and Ojer Axonil\'s power occurs only once, when the damage would be dealt. Reducing Ojer Axonil\'s power before noncombat damage is dealt may cause its replacement effect not to apply to that damage."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "While you control Ojer Axonil, Deepest Might, if an effect such as that of Chandra\'s Pyrohelix asks you to divide damage among targets, you must divide the unmodified damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Deconstruction Hammer somehow ends up attached to a creature controlled by a different player, that player won\'t be able to activate the granted ability, as they can\'t pay the cost of sacrificing Deconstruction Hammer, a permanent they don\'t control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Deep-Cavern Bat leaves the battlefield before its last ability resolves, you\'ll still look at the target opponent\'s hand, but you won\'t exile any cards from it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Explorer\'s Cache isn\'t on the battlefield as its activated ability resolves, you can\'t remove a +1/+1 counter from it, so you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'To move a counter from one permanent to another, the counter is removed from the first permanent and put on the second. Any abilities that care about a counter being removed from or put onto a permanent will apply.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Glowcap Lantern isn\'t attached to a creature you control, you can\'t look at the top card of your library. The lantern isn\'t that bright."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to explore but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still explores. If you reveal a nonland card this way, you won\\\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you may put the revealed card into your graveyard. Effects that trigger "whenever a creature explores" trigger as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an ability instructs a creature to explore, its controller reveals the top card of their library. If it\'s a land card, they\'ll put it into their hand. Otherwise, they\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature, then choose to either leave that card on top of their library or put it into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no card is revealed, most likely because that player\'s library is empty, the exploring creature receives a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast the top card of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, noncreature permanents may explore. For example, if the creature card returned by Defossilize is somehow not a creature once it\'s on the battlefield, it can still explore. You\'ll take all the same actions, and you may end up putting a +1/+1 counter on the permanent. (Note that some effects target a creature, and those effects would still require a legal target to have it explore.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to explore begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the exploring creature after you reveal a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells or abilities might cause a creature to explore multiple times in a row. If you reveal a nonland card when a creature explores and leave it on top of your library, then the creature explores again immediately afterwards, you\'ll reveal the same card again."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The ability granted by Glowcap Lantern lets you look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction—see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Jadelight Spelunker enters the battlefield without being cast, or if it was cast with X equal to 0, the enters-the-battlefield ability will still trigger, but Jadelight Spelunker won\'t explore at all."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to explore but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still explores. If you reveal a nonland card this way, you won\\\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you may put the revealed card into your graveyard. Effects that trigger "whenever a creature explores" trigger as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an ability instructs a creature to explore, its controller reveals the top card of their library. If it\'s a land card, they\'ll put it into their hand. Otherwise, they\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature, then choose to either leave that card on top of their library or put it into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no card is revealed, most likely because that player\'s library is empty, the exploring creature receives a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, noncreature permanents may explore. For example, if the creature card returned by Defossilize is somehow not a creature once it\'s on the battlefield, it can still explore. You\'ll take all the same actions, and you may end up putting a +1/+1 counter on the permanent. (Note that some effects target a creature, and those effects would still require a legal target to have it explore.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to explore begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the exploring creature after you reveal a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells or abilities might cause a creature to explore multiple times in a row. If you reveal a nonland card when a creature explores and leave it on top of your library, then the creature explores again immediately afterwards, you\'ll reveal the same card again."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Kitesail Larcenist leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, that ability will have no effect. The target permanents won\'t become Treasures at all."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If some of the targets, but not all, are illegal as the ability resolves, the illegal targets will be unaffected. Only the remaining legal targets will become Treasures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The targets of Kitesail Larcenist\'s enters-the-battlefield ability will lose any other subtypes and card types they previously had and will be only Treasure artifacts as long as Kitesail Larcenist remains on the battlefield. They will retain any supertypes they had."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Malcolm, Alluring Scoundrel isn\'t on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves, you won\'t put a chorus counter on it, but you\'ll still draw a card and discard a card. You may still cast the discarded card without paying its mana cost if Malcolm had four or more chorus counters on it when it was last on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell using Malcolm, Alluring Scoundrel\'s last ability, you do so as part of the resolution of the ability. You can\'t wait to cast the spell later in the turn. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You may not play land cards discarded with Malcolm, Alluring Scoundrel\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If The Millenium Calendar\'s last ability is countered or otherwise removed from the stack, it will just trigger again immediately if The Millenium Calendar still has 1,000 or more time counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The Millenium Calendar\\\'s first ability triggers during the untap step. However, since no player gets priority during the untap step, the ability waits to be put on the stack until the upkeep starts. At that time, any "beginning of upkeep" triggers will also trigger. Those abilities and The Millenium Calendar\\\'s ability are put onto the stack at that time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Tishana\'s Tidebinder leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target activated or triggered ability will still be countered, but the source of the ability won\'t lose its abilities at all."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the affected permanent gains an ability after Tishana\'s Tidebinder\'s effect begins to apply to it, it will keep that ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Tishana\'s Tidebinder\'s triggered ability checks to see if the source of the ability is an artifact, creature, or planeswalker as it resolves. If it isn\'t, it won\'t lose all abilities, even if it was an artifact, creature, or planeswalker when the ability was activated or when it triggered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If Volatile Fault\'s ability resolves, the target nonbasic land\'s controller gets to search for a basic land card even if the land wasn\'t destroyed by Volatile Fault\'s ability. This may happen because the land has indestructible. In this case, you\'ll still create a Treasure token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target of Volatile Fault\'s last ability is illegal as the ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t create a Treasure token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If X is 1, you\'ll look at the top card of your library and put it into your hand. If X is 0, you won\'t look at any cards from the top of your library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a Confluence is copied, the effect that creates the copy will usually allow you to choose new targets, but you can\'t choose new modes."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a mode requires a target, you can select that mode only if there\'s a legal target available. Ignore the targeting requirements for modes you don\'t choose. Each time you select that mode, you can choose a different target, or you can choose the same target."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If all targets for the chosen modes become illegal before a Confluence resolves, the spell will be countered and none of its effects will happen. If at least one target is still legal, the spell will resolve but will have no effect on any illegal targets.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the same mode is chosen more than once, you choose their relative order as you cast the spell. For example, if you choose the last mode of Cosmium Confluence more than once, you choose the relative order to destroy the target enchantments.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'No matter which combination of modes you choose, you always follow the instructions in the order they are written.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "No player can cast spells or activate abilities in between the modes of a resolving spell. Any abilities that trigger won\'t be put onto the stack until a spell is done resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Notably, the second mode doesn\'t require any targets. You choose the Cave you control that will be affected as Cosmium Confluence is resolving. You may choose a Cave you just put onto the battlefield with the first mode, if applicable."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You choose the modes as you cast the spell. Once modes are chosen, they can\'t be changed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card is a copy of Aclazotz, Deepest Betrayal, it won\'t return to the battlefield when it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The last ability of Temple of the Dead will resolve even if you have two or more cards in hand at that time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card is a copy of Ojer Kaslem, Deepest Growth, it won\'t return to the battlefield when it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "While resolving Ojer Kaslem, Deepest Growth\'s middle ability, you could put no cards, a creature card, a land card, or a creature card and a land card onto the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a creature leaves the battlefield before an effect instructs it to explore, it still explores. Abilities like Merfolk Cave-Diver\'s that trigger whenever a creature you control explores will still trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to explore but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still explores. If you reveal a nonland card this way, you won\\\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you may put the revealed card into your graveyard. Effects that trigger "whenever a creature explores" trigger as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an ability instructs a creature to explore, its controller reveals the top card of their library. If it\'s a land card, they\'ll put it into their hand. Otherwise, they\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature, then choose to either leave that card on top of their library or put it into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no card is revealed, most likely because that player\'s library is empty, the exploring creature receives a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, noncreature permanents may explore. For example, if the creature card returned by Defossilize is somehow not a creature once it\'s on the battlefield, it can still explore. You\'ll take all the same actions, and you may end up putting a +1/+1 counter on the permanent. (Note that some effects target a creature, and those effects would still require a legal target to have it explore.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to explore begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the exploring creature after you reveal a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells or abilities might cause a creature to explore multiple times in a row. If you reveal a nonland card when a creature explores and leave it on top of your library, then the creature explores again immediately afterwards, you\'ll reveal the same card again."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a creature leaves the battlefield before an effect instructs it to explore, it still explores. Abilities like Nicanzil\'s that trigger whenever a creature you control explores will still trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to explore but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still explores. If you reveal a nonland card this way, you won\\\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you may put the revealed card into your graveyard. Effects that trigger "whenever a creature explores" trigger as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an ability instructs a creature to explore, its controller reveals the top card of their library. If it\'s a land card, they\'ll put it into their hand. Otherwise, they\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature, then choose to either leave that card on top of their library or put it into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no card is revealed, most likely because that player\'s library is empty, the exploring creature receives a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, noncreature permanents may explore. For example, if the creature card returned by Defossilize is somehow not a creature once it\'s on the battlefield, it can still explore. You\'ll take all the same actions, and you may end up putting a +1/+1 counter on the permanent. (Note that some effects target a creature, and those effects would still require a legal target to have it explore.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Nicanzil\'s first ability won\'t resolve until after you\'re done exploring. You may put any land card from your hand onto the battlefield, including the land card you explored (if it\'s still in your hand) or one that was already in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Nicanzil, Current Conductor\'s triggered abilities care about the characteristics of the card as it was revealed while a creature explored. It doesn\'t matter what happened to the card after that."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to explore begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the exploring creature after you reveal a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells or abilities might cause a creature to explore multiple times in a row. If you reveal a nonland card when a creature explores and leave it on top of your library, then the creature explores again immediately afterwards, you\'ll reveal the same card again."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an effect states that Thousand Moons Infantry doesn\'t untap during your untap step, that effect won\'t apply during another player\'s untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Thousand Moons Infantry still untaps during your untap step as normal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Thousand Moons Infantry untaps at the same time as the active player\'s permanents. You can\'t choose not to untap it at that time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If more than one nontoken Merfolk you control becomes tapped at the same time (for example, to pay the cost of Adaptive Gemguard\'s activated ability), Deeproot Pilgrimage\'s ability will trigger only once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no cards are exiled with Pit of Offerings, its last ability can\'t add mana."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The five colors are white, blue, black, red, and green. The last ability of Pit of Offerings can\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature you control entered the battlefield this turn and is still a legal target as Malamet Battle Glyph resolves but the target creature you don\'t control isn\'t, you will still put a +1/+1 counter on the creature you control. The creatures will not fight each other."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target of Ancestors\' Aid is illegal as the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t create a Treasure token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast a spell from the top of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the top card of your library has an Adventure, you can cast the Adventure spell this way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once The Belligerent\'s triggered ability resolves, you can look at the top card of your library whenever you want until end of turn (with one restriction; see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You must pay all costs and follow all timing rules for spells cast and lands played from the top of your library this way.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t legally choose a mode because all three have been chosen that turn, that instance of the ability is removed from the stack with no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you somehow control two or more Breeches, Eager Pillager, track which modes have been chosen each turn for each one\'s ability separately."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played this way. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you controlled a Dinosaur when you declared Burning Sun Cavalry as an attacker or blocker, it doesn\'t matter whether you still control one as its ability resolves. Burning Sun Cavalry will still get +1/+1 until end of turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you controlled at least two artifacts when you declared Brazen Blademaster as an attacker, it doesn\'t matter how many you control as its ability resolves. Brazen Blademaster will still get +2/+1 until end of turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you didn\'t control another Dinosaur when you declared Pugnacious Hammerskull as an attacker, it doesn\'t matter whether or not you control one as its ability resolves. You\'ll still put a stun counter on Pugnacious Hammerskull."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have at least two cards in your library, you can\'t choose to mill two cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The creature cards you return to your hand don\'t have to be any of the cards you milled. They can be cards that were already in your graveyard before you milled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have at least two cards in your library, you can\'t choose to mill two cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you exile a land card and a nonland card, you\'ll create a Dinosaur token, then a Treasure token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you exile two land cards, you\'ll create only one Dinosaur token. Similarly, if you exile two nonland cards, you\'ll create only one Treasure token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played this way. For example, if one of the exiled cards is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice Vito at the same time you sacrifice other permanents, Vito\'s ability will trigger for each of those other permanents."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Vito\'s triggered ability has no effect each time beyond the third it resolves in a turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Market Gnome\'s last ability will go onto the stack above the craft ability that caused it to trigger. This means you\'ll gain 1 life and draw a card before the transformed card returns to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Most of the time, Market Gnome\'s last ability will trigger because it was exiled as one of the components used in the craft ability. However, in some uncommon cases, the ability will also trigger if Market Gnome is exiled while you\'re activating mana abilities as part of paying for that craft ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once Goblin Tomb Raider has been declared as an attacker, causing it to lose haste by removing all of your artifacts won\'t cause it to stop attacking, even if it entered the battlefield or came under your control that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an artifact enters the battlefield under your control, Shipwreck Sentry can attack that turn as though it didn\'t have defender. It doesn\'t matter if that artifact stays an artifact or stays under your control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Palani\'s Hatcher\'s last ability counts any creature you control with the creature type Egg, not just the tokens Palani\'s Hatcher creates."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Poetic Ingenuity\'s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. You create a Dinosaur token even if the artifact spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Relic\'s Roar overwrites all previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply afterward will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The artifact or creature retains its abilities and colors, if any.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Roar of the Fifth People\'s second chapter ability doesn\'t have a duration. It will continue to apply as long as Roar of the Fifth People remains on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Tendril of the Mycotyrant\'s ability doesn\'t have a duration. The land remains a creature until it leaves the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The amount of damage Triumphant Chomp deals is determined as it resolves. If you don\'t control any Dinosaurs at that time, or if the Dinosaurs you control are unusually small, Triumphant Chomp will deal 2 damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The enters-the-battlefield ability can target an artifact or creature that\'s already tapped. If so, you\'ll just put a stun counter on that artifact or creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The permanent\'s owner chooses whether to put it on the top or bottom of their library. If multiple cards are put into the library this way (such as when the spell targets a melded permanent), that permanent\'s owner puts all the cards on top or all the cards on the bottom. They put them in whatever order they wish, and do not need to reveal the order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The value of X for Geode Grotto\'s last ability is determined only as it resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won\'t change later in the turn even if the number of artifacts you control changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Whether or not you control another Dinosaur is checked only as Armored Kincaller\'s ability is resolving. It doesn\'t matter if you still control Armored Kincaller at the time, or if it\'s still a Dinosaur."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You can tap any four untapped artifacts, creatures, and/or lands you control, including creatures you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the additional cost to cast Guardian of the Great Door."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You can tap any three untapped artifacts and/or creatures you control, including Warden of the Inner Sky itself and other creatures you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Warden of the Inner Sky\'s activated ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You can tap any two untapped artifacts and/or creatures you control, including Adaptive Gemguard itself and other creatures you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Adaptive Gemguard\'s activated ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You can tap any two untapped artifacts and/or creatures you control, including Goldfury Strider and other creatures you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Goldfury Strider\'s activated ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You can tap any two untapped artifacts and/or creatures you control, including creatures you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Sunshot Militia\'s activated ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A permanent card is an artifact, battle, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card. Tokens are not cards, and while tokens are put into the graveyard before ceasing to exist, that action doesn\'t count as a player having descended."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn" will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many times you descended this turn. However, if you haven\\\'t descended this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\\\'t trigger at all. It\\\'s not possible to put a permanent card into your graveyard during the end step in time to have the ability trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a permanent spell cast using mana produced by Tecutlan, the Searing Rift has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for X when calculating that spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In either case, it doesn\'t matter if those cards are still in that player\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple cards have abilities that begin with "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn." These cards don\\\'t need to have been under your control at the time you descended. For example, if a permanent card is put into your graveyard during your first main phase and you cast Stalactite Stalker your second main phase, its ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to a player who has "descended this turn." This means that a permanent card has been put into that player\\\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some cards refer to the number of times a player descended this turn. Those cards care about the number of permanent cards put into that player\'s graveyard from anywhere this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Tecutlan, the Searing Rift\'s triggered ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You choose how many cards to discard as the first ability of Brass\'s Tunnel-Grinder resolves. You may choose to discard no cards and just draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target spells that can\'t be countered. When that spell or ability resolves, the uncounterable spell won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Chimil, the Inner Sun\'s first ability applies only while it\'s on the battlefield. While it\'s a spell, it can be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Digsite Conservator\'s triggered ability will trigger if it dies for any reason, not only because you sacrificed it due to its activated ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the ones created by Giant Growth, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the artifact was already a creature, its base power and toughness will become 5/4. This overwrites any previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Zoetic Glyph becomes attached to the artifact will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the creature Zoetic Glyph would enchant is an illegal target as Zoetic Glyph tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. It\'s put into your graveyard from the stack, not the battlefield, so its last ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The artifact retains any types, subtypes, or supertypes it has. Notably, an Equipment that becomes an artifact creature usually can\'t be attached to another creature. If it was attached to a creature, it becomes unattached."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The resulting artifact creature will be able to attack on your turn if it\'s been under your control continuously since the turn began. That is, it doesn\'t matter how long it\'s been a creature, just how long it\'s been on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Geological Appraiser\'s triggered ability triggers if you cast it from any zone. It doesn\'t trigger if you put Geological Appraiser onto the battlefield without casting it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Caparocti Sunborn is untapped as its ability is resolving (for example, if it has vigilance), it can be tapped for its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You can tap any two untapped artifacts and/or creatures you control, including creatures you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, for Caparocti Sunborn\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target spell has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for X when calculating that spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You can cast Daring Discovery with no targets and just discover 4. However, if you choose any targets, and all of those targets are illegal by the time Daring Discovery tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t discover 4. As long as one target remains legal, any legal targets won\'t be able to block this turn, any illegal targets won\'t be affected, and you\'ll discover 4."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You "discover" when you finish the process of revealing cards, exiling an appropriate nonland card, casting that card or putting it into your hand, and putting the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order, even if one or more of those actions were impossible for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "You must follow all normal timing rules for a card you play with Quintorius Kand\'s last ability and, if it\'s a spell, you must pay its costs to cast it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You won\\\'t create any Treasure tokens until you finish discovering. For example, if the card you discover has "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact," you can\\\'t sacrifice one of the Treasures from Hit the Mother Lode to pay that additional cost.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Discover N" means "Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value N or less. That card is the "discovered" card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell\\\'s mana value is less than or equal to N. If you don\\\'t cast it, put that card into your hand. Put the remaining exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the target artifact or creature has X in its mana cost, that X is 0 when determining its mana value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect\'s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause you to discover may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and you won\'t discover."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect\'s discover value) but not both halves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'"Land sources" include any objects with the card type land. This means you could spend the mana to activate an ability of a land you control or a land card in your hand or graveyard, for example.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may spend the two mana added by the last ability on the same ability or on two different abilities.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'A "Dinosaur source" is any object with the creature type Dinosaur. This means you could spend the mana to activate an ability of a Dinosaur you control or a Dinosaur card in your hand or graveyard, for example.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Any choices made when the ability resolves won\'t have been made yet when it\'s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Craft abilities are activated abilities. You can spend mana from The Enigma Jewel\'s activated ability to activate its own craft ability, for example."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an activated ability of an exiled card used to craft Locus of Enlightenment references the card it\'s printed on by name, treat Locus of Enlightenment\'s version of that ability as though it referenced Locus of Enlightenment instead."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the ability has damage divided as it was put onto the stack, the division can\'t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of abilities that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the ability that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the ability that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Locus of Enlightenment has only the activated abilities of the exiled cards used to craft it. It doesn\'t gain keyword abilities (unless those keyword abilities are activated), triggered abilities, or static abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The "only once each turn" restriction applies to each ability individually, even if multiples of the same card were exiled to craft Locus of Enlightenment. For example, if two of the same card were exiled to craft Locus of Enlightenment, it will have two instances of each of that card\\\'s activated abilities. Each of those abilities may be activated once each turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "activated." Abilities that trigger when a player activates an ability (such as Locus of Enlightenment\\\'s own triggered ability) won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The copy of the activated ability created by Locus of Enlightenment\'s triggered ability resolves before the original ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the ability it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'An "artifact source" is any object with the card type artifact. This means you could spend the mana to activate an ability of an artifact you control or an artifact card in your hand or graveyard, for example.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the target creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, the new token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, power and toughness, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied land card will trigger when Echoing Deeps enters the battlefield. Any "as [this land] enters the battlefield" or "[this land] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen land card will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Echoing Deeps copies exactly what was printed on the original land card, with the noted exception.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you choose to have Echoing Deeps not copy anything, it enters the battlefield untapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "as [this permanent] enters the battlefield" or "[this permanent] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the target permanent will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the copied permanent is a token, the new token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token (with the listed exceptions)."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that permanent copied (with the listed exceptions).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent, with the listed exceptions (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, power and toughness, and so on."}]', "[{'date': '2023-11-10', 'text': 'As the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses which two creatures they are going to sacrifice, then each other player in turn order does the same. Players will know the choices of previous players when making their choices. Then all creatures are sacrificed by their controllers simultaneously.'}, {'date': '2023-11-10', 'text': 'If a player controls only one creature as the ability resolves, they must sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2023-11-10', 'text': 'You may sacrifice Abyssal Gorestalker to its own ability. If it is the only creature you control or one of two creatures you control, you must sacrifice it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Because the target permanent isn\\\'t entering the battlefield when it becomes a copy of a permanent spell, any "When [this permanent] enters the battlefield" or "[This permanent] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the copied spell won\\\'t apply for the target permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "descend N" have abilities that care if you have at least N permanent cards in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the copied spell has {X} in its mana cost, X is still 0 for the purposes of determining the mana value of the permanent on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Non-copy effects that have already applied to the target permanent will continue to apply to it. For example, if it\'s a creature, +1/+1 counters on it will still affect it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The target permanent copies what is printed on the original card, plus any choices that were made when casting the spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability of The Myriad Pools will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Bedrock Tortoise\\\'s ability doesn\\\'t actually change any creature\\\'s power. It changes only the amount of combat damage the creature assigns. All other rules and effects that check power or toughness use the real values, even if they cause damage "equal to a creature\\\'s power" to be dealt.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "descend N" have abilities that care if you have at least N permanent cards in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Finality counters aren\'t keyword counters, and a finality counter doesn\'t give any abilities to the permanent it\'s on. If that permanent loses its abilities and then would go to a graveyard, it will still be exiled instead."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Finality counters don\'t stop permanents from going to zones other than the graveyard from the battlefield. For example, if a permanent with a finality counter on it would be put into its owner\'s hand from the battlefield, it does so normally."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Finality counters work on any permanent, not only creatures. If a permanent with a finality counter on it would go to a graveyard from the battlefield, exile it instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Multiple finality counters on a single permanent are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "descend N" have abilities that care if you have at least N permanent cards in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once The Ancient One has legally attacked or blocked, removing permanent cards from your graveyard so the descend 8 ability no longer applies won\'t remove The Ancient One from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for The Ancient One\\\'s activated ability at the time you activate it. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you discard a card this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "descend N" have abilities that care if you have at least N permanent cards in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "descend N" have abilities that care if you have at least N permanent cards in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Except in some unusual cases, the cards you put on top of your library while surveilling will be the cards you draw.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "For Starving Revenant\'s enters-the-battlefield ability, you put cards into your graveyard for surveil (if any) before drawing cards. If there are eight or more permanent cards in your graveyard by the time you draw cards, those draws will cause the descend 8 ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "descend N" have abilities that care if you have at least N permanent cards in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If all targets for the chosen modes become illegal before Wail of the Forgotten resolves, the spell will be countered and none of its effects will happen. If at least one target is still legal, the spell will resolve but will have no effect on any illegal targets.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "descend N" have abilities that care if you have at least N permanent cards in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "fathomless descent" have abilities that care how many permanent cards are in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have at least two cards in your library, you can\'t choose to mill two cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The value of X will change as the number of permanent cards in your graveyard changes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "fathomless descent" have abilities that care how many permanent cards are in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Like all spells that require targets, Squirming Emergence will check to make sure its target is still legal as it tries to resolve. Use the number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, even though it may be a different number than the number that were there as you cast the spell. If the permanent card\'s mana value is greater than the number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, Squirming Emergence won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The target nonland permanent card still counts toward the number of permanent cards in your graveyard for the purposes of Squirming Emergence.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "fathomless descent" have abilities that care how many permanent cards are in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The Core\'s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Transforming Matzalantli doesn\'t cause it to leave the battlefield. It also doesn\'t cause it to become untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "fathomless descent" have abilities that care how many permanent cards are in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Souls of the Lost\'s power and toughness works in all zones. As long as Souls of the Lost is in your graveyard, that ability will count Souls of the Lost itself."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "fathomless descent" have abilities that care how many permanent cards are in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The value of X is checked only once, as Terror Tide resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards with the ability word "fathomless descent" have abilities that care how many permanent cards are in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Some descend triggered abilities include intervening "if" clauses (i.e. "if you have [four or eight] permanent cards in your graveyard" in the middle of the ability). Each of these abilities checks your graveyard at the moment it would trigger to see if it does. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability doesn\\\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don\\\'t have the required number of permanent cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won\\\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If any of the exiled cards has a characteristic-defining ability that defines its power, that ability will apply. For example, if you somehow used Souls of the Lost to craft Mastercraft Raptor (perhaps because it became a copy of a Dinosaur), its power while in exile is equal to the number of permanent cards in your graveyard, and Mastercraft Raptor\'s power will change as the number of permanent cards in your graveyard changes. If the characteristic-defining ability can\'t be applied, then use 0."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If some of the creatures are illegal targets as the first ability of Jade Seedstones tries to resolve, the original distribution of counters still applies and the counters that would have been put on the illegal targets are lost. They won\'t be put instead on a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, multiple cards may be exiled to craft Jadeheart Attendant. For example, if an effect makes Jade Seedstones a copy of a permanent with a craft ability that requires multiple components, the copy effect will expire as Jade Seedstones leaves the battlefield and it will return as Jadeheart Attendant. The enters-the-battlefield ability will count all the exiled cards, and you\'ll gain life equal to their total mana values."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You choose how many targets the first ability of Jade Seedstones has and how the counters will be distributed as that ability is put on the stack. Each target must receive at least one counter.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the equipped creature isn\'t on the battlefield as the reflexive triggered ability granted by Dire Blunderbuss resolves but it had lifelink when it left the battlefield, you will gain life."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Use the equipped creature\'s power as the reflexive triggered ability granted by Dire Blunderbuss resolves to determine how much damage is dealt. If the equipped creature is no longer on the battlefield at that time, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for the triggered ability granted by Dire Blunderbuss at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you sacrifice another artifact this way. You choose targets for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have at least two cards in your library, you can\'t choose to mill two cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The ability of Master\'s Manufactory can be activated no matter what happened to the artifact after it entered under your control. It may have left the battlefield, stopped being an artifact, or another player may have gained control of it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The five colors are white, blue, black, red, and green, and as such, Sunbird Effigy\'s characteristic-defining ability can\'t set its power and toughness higher than 5/5. Similarly, Sunbird Effigy\'s last ability can produce at most five mana (one of each of color)."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to explore but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still explores. If you reveal a nonland card this way, you won\\\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you may put the revealed card into your graveyard. Effects that trigger "whenever a creature explores" trigger as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an ability instructs a creature to explore, its controller reveals the top card of their library. If it\'s a land card, they\'ll put it into their hand. Otherwise, they\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature, then choose to either leave that card on top of their library or put it into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no card is revealed, most likely because that player\'s library is empty, the exploring creature receives a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, noncreature permanents may explore. For example, if the creature card returned by Defossilize is somehow not a creature once it\'s on the battlefield, it can still explore. You\'ll take all the same actions, and you may end up putting a +1/+1 counter on the permanent. (Note that some effects target a creature, and those effects would still require a legal target to have it explore.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Lodestone Needle\'s enters-the-battlefield ability can target an artifact or creature that\'s already tapped. If so, you\'ll just put two stun counters on that artifact or creature."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to explore begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the exploring creature after you reveal a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells or abilities might cause a creature to explore multiple times in a row. If you reveal a nonland card when a creature explores and leave it on top of your library, then the creature explores again immediately afterwards, you\'ll reveal the same card again."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are activated abilities with costs that have a mana component as well as an additional "materials" component.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Craft abilities are written "Craft with [materials] [mana]", which means "[Mana], Exile this permanent, Exile [materials] from among permanents you control and/or cards in your graveyard: Return this card to the battlefield transformed under its owner\\\'s control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'For each player, including yourself, you must choose a creature with power 2 or less to save if you can.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Sandswirl Wanderglyph leaves the battlefield on a turn in which an opponent attacked you or a planeswalker you control (perhaps because it died in combat or another player cast a spell that destroyed it), that opponent can cast spells.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with craft, it\'ll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If the materials required include multiple objects, you may exile some of them from among permanents you control and the rest from among cards in your graveyard. You don\'t have to choose all permanents or all cards from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In Two-Headed Giant, for each attacking creature, the attacking team announces which defending player, planeswalker, or battle that creature is attacking when it\'s declared as an attacker. Sandswirl Wanderglyph\'s abilities care only about creatures that attack you or planeswalkers you control, not creatures that attack your teammate or planeswalkers they control."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once Sandswirl Wanderglyph\'s middle ability resolves, that opponent won\'t be able to attack you or planeswalkers you control that turn, even if Sandswirl Wanderglyph is no longer on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Sandswirl Wanderglyph\'s abilities won\'t stop opponents from attacking battles you protect or casting spells after attacking battles you protect."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The back faces of some cards with craft refer to cards "used to craft" it. This refers to the cards exiled as part of the cost of the craft ability of the front face. Those cards are considered to be "used to craft" that permanent as long as they remain exiled and the permanent remains on the battlefield, even if the permanent\\\'s controller changes or some of its characteristics change (because of a copy effect, for example.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Unstable Glyphbridge\'s first ability triggers if you cast it from any zone. It doesn\'t trigger if you put Unstable Glyphbridge onto the battlefield without casting it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile tokens you control as part of the materials required. However, because they aren\\\'t cards and won\\\'t stay in exile, any abilities that refer to what you "used to craft" the back faces won\\\'t refer to anything.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-11-10', 'text': 'Creatures opponents control will be exiled if they would die for any reason that turn, not just if they die by being reduced to 0 or less toughness by Malicious Eclipse.'}, {'date': '2023-11-10', 'text': 'While the -2/-2 applies only to creatures that are on the battlefield as Malicious Eclipse resolves, the replacement effect applies to all creatures opponents control that turn, including ones that enter the battlefield after Malicious Eclipse resolves, noncreatures that become creatures after Malicious Eclipse resolves, and creatures that become controlled by opponents after Malicious Eclipse resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Everything that is specified by the effect creating the original token or tokens will also be true about the additional tokens created by Ojer Taq, Deepest Foundation\\\'s replacement effect. For example, if an effect tells you to create a token "tapped and attacking," the additional tokens will also be tapped and attacking. Similarly, if an effect creates a token and puts counters on it, the additional tokens will also get those counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card that isn\'t a transforming double-faced card is a copy of Ojer Taq, Deepest Foundation, it won\'t return to the battlefield when it dies."}]', "[{'date': '2023-11-10', 'text': 'Excess damage has been dealt to a creature if the damage dealt to it is greater than lethal damage. Usually, this means damage greater than its toughness, although damage already marked on the creature is taken into account.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Spelunking would enter the battlefield at the same time a land you control would enter the battlefield tapped, that land still enters the battlefield tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If a land has an ability that says it enters the battlefield tapped, you choose the order in which that ability\'s effect and Spelunking\'s effect apply. This means you can choose to have the land enter tapped or untapped. If a land you control is simply put onto the battlefield tapped without a replacement effect being applied, it always enters untapped if you control Spelunking."}]', "[{'date': '2023-11-10', 'text': 'If Threefold Thunderhulk leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how many Gnomes to create.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a creature has a characteristic-defining ability that sets its power and toughness, indicated with a */* or similar in the power and toughness box, that ability is taken into account when determining its base power and toughness.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Normally, a creature\'s base power and toughness are the power and toughness printed on the card or, for a token, the power and toughness set by the effect that created it. If another effect sets a creature\'s power and toughness to specific numbers or values, those become its base power and toughness. If an effect modifies a creature\'s power and/or toughness without setting them, that is not included when determining its base power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some creatures have base power and toughness 0/0 and an ability that gives them a bonus based on some criteria. Those are not characteristic-defining abilities, and that ability doesn\'t change its base power and toughness. Such a creature will have power greater than its base power if the ability is raising its power above 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a creature has a characteristic-defining ability that sets its power and toughness, indicated with a */* or similar in the power and toughness box, that ability is taken into account when determining its base power and toughness.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Normally, a creature\'s base power and toughness are the power and toughness printed on the card or, for a token, the power and toughness set by the effect that created it. If another effect sets a creature\'s power and toughness to specific numbers or values, those become its base power and toughness. If an effect modifies a creature\'s power and/or toughness without setting them, that is not included when determining its base power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some creatures have base power and toughness 0/0 and an ability that gives them a bonus based on some criteria. Those are not characteristic-defining abilities, and that ability doesn\'t change its base power and toughness."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to explore but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still explores. If you reveal a nonland card this way, you won\\\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you may put the revealed card into your graveyard. Effects that trigger "whenever a creature explores" trigger as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an ability instructs a creature to explore, its controller reveals the top card of their library. If it\'s a land card, they\'ll put it into their hand. Otherwise, they\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature, then choose to either leave that card on top of their library or put it into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no card is revealed, most likely because that player\'s library is empty, the exploring creature receives a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If you control two copies of Twists and Turns and a creature you control would explore, instead you scry 1, then scry 1 again, then that creature explores. If you control three copies of Twists and Turns, you\'d scry 1 an additional time before that creature explores, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, noncreature permanents may explore. For example, if the creature card returned by Defossilize is somehow not a creature once it\'s on the battlefield, it can still explore. You\'ll take all the same actions, and you may end up putting a +1/+1 counter on the permanent. (Note that some effects target a creature, and those effects would still require a legal target to have it explore.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to explore begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the exploring creature after you reveal a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells or abilities might cause a creature to explore multiple times in a row. If you reveal a nonland card when a creature explores and leave it on top of your library, then the creature explores again immediately afterwards, you\'ll reveal the same card again."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to explore but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still explores. If you reveal a nonland card this way, you won\\\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you may put the revealed card into your graveyard. Effects that trigger "whenever a creature explores" trigger as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an ability instructs a creature to explore, its controller reveals the top card of their library. If it\'s a land card, they\'ll put it into their hand. Otherwise, they\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature, then choose to either leave that card on top of their library or put it into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no card is revealed, most likely because that player\'s library is empty, the exploring creature receives a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, noncreature permanents may explore. For example, if the creature card returned by Defossilize is somehow not a creature once it\'s on the battlefield, it can still explore. You\'ll take all the same actions, and you may end up putting a +1/+1 counter on the permanent. (Note that some effects target a creature, and those effects would still require a legal target to have it explore.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to explore begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the exploring creature after you reveal a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells or abilities might cause a creature to explore multiple times in a row. If you reveal a nonland card when a creature explores and leave it on top of your library, then the creature explores again immediately afterwards, you\'ll reveal the same card again."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to explore but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still explores. If you reveal a nonland card this way, you won\\\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you may put the revealed card into your graveyard. Effects that trigger "whenever a creature explores" trigger as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If an ability instructs a creature to explore, its controller reveals the top card of their library. If it\'s a land card, they\'ll put it into their hand. Otherwise, they\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature, then choose to either leave that card on top of their library or put it into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If no card is revealed, most likely because that player\'s library is empty, the exploring creature receives a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, noncreature permanents may explore. For example, if the creature card returned by Defossilize is somehow not a creature once it\'s on the battlefield, it can still explore. You\'ll take all the same actions, and you may end up putting a +1/+1 counter on the permanent. (Note that some effects target a creature, and those effects would still require a legal target to have it explore.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Map tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one is a colorless artifact with the artifact subtype Map and the ability "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Target creature you control explores. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to explore begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the exploring creature after you reveal a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Some spells or abilities might cause a creature to explore multiple times in a row. If you reveal a nonland card when a creature explores and leave it on top of your library, then the creature explores again immediately afterwards, you\'ll reveal the same card again."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If there is only one card in your library, you put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger no matter what happened to the artifact after it entered. It may have left the battlefield, come under another player\'s control, or stopped being an artifact."}]', "[{'date': '2023-11-10', 'text': 'If there is only one card in your library, you put it into your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If this becomes a creature because of an effect other than its own ability, its last ability will still trigger whenever it attacks.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If this becomes a creature but you haven\'t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won\'t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Map tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one is a colorless artifact with the artifact subtype Map and the ability "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Target creature you control explores. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If this becomes a creature because of an effect other than its own ability, its last ability will still trigger whenever it attacks.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "If this becomes a creature but you haven\'t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won\'t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you are tied for most life and Preacher of the Schism attacks another player who is tied for most life, both its middle and its last ability will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Once Preacher of the Schism\'s middle ability triggers, it doesn\'t matter what happens to players\' life totals before the ability resolves. You\'ll create a Vampire token even if the player Preacher of the Schism attacked doesn\'t have the most life as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Preacher of the Schism\'s middle ability triggers only if it attacks a player. It won\'t trigger if Preacher of the Schism attacks a planeswalker or battle, no matter what its controller\'s life total is."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Similarly, once Preacher of the Schism\'s last ability triggers, it doesn\'t matter what happens to players\' life totals before the ability resolves. You\'ll draw a card and lose 1 life even if you don\'t have the most life as the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you control two Roaming Thrones with the same chosen creature type, triggered abilities of other creatures you control of the chosen type trigger three times. Three such Roaming Thrones result in four triggered abilities, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "Roaming Throne\'s last ability doesn\'t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger an additional time. Any choices made as you put the ability onto the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution, such as whether to put counters on a permanent, are also made individually."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Once you determine the cost to cast The Skullspore Nexus, you may activate abilities to pay that cost. If the greatest power among creatures you control changes while activating mana abilities, the cost to cast The Skullspore Nexus remains what you previously determined.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The first step of casting a spell is to move it to the stack. If this causes the greatest power among creatures you control to change (for example, if you control a creature with "This creature\\\'s power is equal to the number of cards in your hand"), that new power will be used to determine the cost reduction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': "To double a creature\'s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is that creature\'s power as The Skullspore Nexus\'s activated ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'Use the power of the nontoken creatures that died as they last existed on the battlefield to determine the base power and toughness of the token created by the middle ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'The source of the damage is the equipped creature, not Sunfire Torch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for the triggered ability granted by Sunfire Torch at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you sacrifice Sunfire Torch this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-11-10', 'text': 'While resolving In the Presence of Ages, you could put no cards, a creature card, a land card, or a creature card and a land card into your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Glorifier of Suffering\\\'s ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you sacrifice another creature or artifact this way. You choose targets for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Inti, Seneschal of the Sun\\\'s first ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you discard a card this way. You choose targets for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played due to the last ability. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Thousand Moons Crackshot\\\'s triggered ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you pay {2}{W} this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-11-10\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose targets for Itzquinth, Firstborn of Gishath\\\'s triggered ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you pay {2} this way. You choose targets for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Ableger der Mycotyrannin\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}{G}: Lege sieben +1/+1-Marken auf ein Nichtkreatur-Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Pilzwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Mykoid trägt die Grundlagen einer ganzen Kolonie in sich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637255&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4350136-68c9-498a-93dc-1d7d579b1556\', \'multiverseId\': 637255}, \'multiverseid\': 637255}, {\'name\': \'Zarcillo del micotirano\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}{G}: Pon siete contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra que no sea criatura objetivo que controlas. Se convierte en una criatura Hongo 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero hongo\', \'flavor\': \'Cada micoide lleva dentro de sí el potencial de toda una colonia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d323d42f-e364-4d5c-9cea-adf73bdc913d\', \'multiverseId\': 637576}, \'multiverseid\': 637576}, {\'name\': \'Vrille du Mycotyran\', \'text\': "{5}{G}{G} : Mettez sept marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain non-créature ciblé que vous contrôlez. Il devient une créature 0/0 Fongus avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Créature — fongus et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Chaque mycoïde porte en lui le potentiel d\'une colonie entière.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637897&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d75b59-b499-4b45-8d8f-7a701edf9a02\', \'multiverseId\': 637897}, \'multiverseid\': 637897}, {\'name\': \'Viticci del Micotiranno\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}{G}: Metti sette segnalini +1/+1 su una terra non creatura bersaglio che controlli. Diventa una creatura Fungus 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Fungus\', \'flavor\': "Ogni micoide porta al suo interno la potenzialità di un\'intera colonia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66afa9fd-6135-4b1c-b29c-45a5fffa64aa\', \'multiverseId\': 638218}, \'multiverseid\': 638218}, {\'name\': \'帝王マイコイドの触手\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}：あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでない土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター７個を置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のファンガス・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'それぞれのマイコイドの中には、巣を形成するために必要なものが全て詰まっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec3f0dfd-b756-4068-ba2d-e1536e8df114\', \'multiverseId\': 638539}, \'multiverseid\': 638539}, {\'name\': \'Gavinha do Micotirano\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}{G}: Coloque sete marcadores +1/+1 no terreno não criatura alvo que você controla. Ele se torna uma criatura Fungo 0/0 com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fungo Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Cada micoide leva em si as marcas de toda uma colônia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e2cd2f6-6e1c-4c38-aada-9ff721809566\', \'multiverseId\': 638860}, \'multiverseid\': 638860}, {\'name\': \'智蕈暴君的菌须\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}{G}：在目标由你操控的非生物地上放置七个+1/+1指示物。它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的真菌生物。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 真菌／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'每个智蕈内里都能能力创造整个群落。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff8001cc-b07e-4ded-9a37-9f7d1d24af38\', \'multiverseId\': 639181}, \'multiverseid\': 639181}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abuelo, Echo der Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Abwehr {2}\\n{1}{W}{U}: Schicke eine andere Kreatur oder ein anderes Artefakt deiner Wahl, die bzw. das du kontrollierst ins Exil. Bringe sie bzw. es zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres bzw. seines Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Kommt, Freunde. Schauen wir, ob diese Welt sich an uns erinnert."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637260&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b0cafb-3074-47d4-93d2-3d8a578a68ca\', \'multiverseId\': 637260}, \'multiverseid\': 637260}, {\'name\': \'Abuelo, eco ancestral\', \'text\': \'Vuela, rebatir {2}.\\n{1}{W}{U}: Exilia otro artefacto o criatura objetivo que controlas. Regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Vengan, amigos. Veamos si este mundo nos recuerda".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebd8237e-8904-4868-b547-74cc0f4303e3\', \'multiverseId\': 637581}, \'multiverseid\': 637581}, {\'name\': \'Abuelo, Écho ancestral\', \'text\': \'Vol, parade {2}\\n{1}{W}{U} : Exilez une autre cible, créature ou artefact, que vous contrôlez. Renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Venez, amis. Voyons si ce monde se souvient de nous. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637902&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22d535d8-6fbb-4e6c-8a0d-25eac3fd1017\', \'multiverseId\': 637902}, \'multiverseid\': 637902}, {\'name\': \'Abuelo, Eco Ancestrale\', \'text\': "Volare, egida {2}\\n{1}{W}{U}: Esilia un\'altra creatura o artefatto bersaglio che controlli. Rimetti quel permanente sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Avanti, amici. Vediamo se questo mondo si ricorda ancora di noi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'879a42b1-9c8b-4742-a52f-14b654049cf1\', \'multiverseId\': 638223}, \'multiverseid\': 638223}, {\'name\': \'祖先の残響、アブエロ\', \'text\': \'飛行、護法{2}\\n{1}{W}{U}：クリーチャーやアーティファクトでありあなたがコントロールしていてこれでない１つを対象とする。それを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「来い、友よ。世界が我らを覚えているか確かめてみようじゃないか。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a18414d0-4f3d-4e4a-96e5-3a247bdb3c89\', \'multiverseId\': 638544}, \'multiverseid\': 638544}, {\'name\': \'Abuelo, Eco Ancestral\', \'text\': \'Voar, salvaguarda {2}\\n{1}{W}{U}: Exile outra criatura ou outro artefato alvo que você controla. Devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos, amigos. Vamos ver se esse mundo se lembra de nós."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eee70b16-17cf-4f4f-aa0d-9fc91e2a9266\', \'multiverseId\': 638865}, \'multiverseid\': 638865}, {\'name\': \'念世先父阿布罗\', \'text\': \'飞行，守护{2}\\n{1}{W}{U}：放逐另一个目标由你操控的生物或神器。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「来吧，朋友们，看看这个世界是否还记得我们。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dbaa12c-80c3-40ea-8a09-8244460ac8bc\', \'multiverseId\': 639186}, \'multiverseid\': 639186}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abuelo, Echo der Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Abwehr {2}\\n{1}{W}{U}: Schicke eine andere Kreatur oder ein anderes Artefakt deiner Wahl, die bzw. das du kontrollierst ins Exil. Bringe sie bzw. es zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres bzw. seines Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e4ce1dd-bf55-4064-a8e8-77926571c84d\', \'multiverseId\': 636529}, \'multiverseid\': 636529}, {\'name\': \'Abuelo, eco ancestral\', \'text\': \'Vuela, rebatir {2}.\\n{1}{W}{U}: Exilia otro artefacto o criatura objetivo que controlas. Regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c60c742e-4152-42f8-a67c-5d5e80a2d979\', \'multiverseId\': 636553}, \'multiverseid\': 636553}, {\'name\': \'Abuelo, Écho ancestral\', \'text\': \'Vol, parade {2}\\n{1}{W}{U} : Exilez une autre cible, créature ou artefact, que vous contrôlez. Renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636577&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f98a2fe2-6821-4ab3-bf22-626383eb7794\', \'multiverseId\': 636577}, \'multiverseid\': 636577}, {\'name\': \'Abuelo, Eco Ancestrale\', \'text\': "Volare, egida {2}\\n{1}{W}{U}: Esilia un\'altra creatura o artefatto bersaglio che controlli. Rimetti quel permanente sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b60964f-0a5c-4704-b3fb-ac1c6e43a0bc\', \'multiverseId\': 636601}, \'multiverseid\': 636601}, {\'name\': \'祖先の残響、アブエロ\', \'text\': \'飛行、護法{2}\\n{1}{W}{U}：クリーチャーやアーティファクトでありあなたがコントロールしていてこれでない１つを対象とする。それを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'528d9454-2e1c-47df-ae02-c7067c75276d\', \'multiverseId\': 636625}, \'multiverseid\': 636625}, {\'name\': \'Abuelo, Eco Ancestral\', \'text\': \'Voar, salvaguarda {2}\\n{1}{W}{U}: Exile outra criatura ou outro artefato alvo que você controla. Devolva-o ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f2efd35-978a-41d0-a7a2-d0df4b579283\', \'multiverseId\': 636649}, \'multiverseid\': 636649}, {\'name\': \'念世先父阿布罗\', \'text\': \'飞行，守护{2}\\n{1}{W}{U}：放逐另一个目标由你操控的生物或神器。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 精怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'817e8807-a68e-45fd-aecd-be994eb74e26\', \'multiverseId\': 636673}, \'multiverseid\': 636673}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abuelos Erwachen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Artefaktkarte oder eine Nicht-Aura-Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof mit X zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel zurück. Sie ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen eine 1/1 Geist-Kreatur mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Quintorius berührte den alten Poncho, den er gefunden hatte. Ein Schwall Magie verdichtete sich zu einem Echo und der weise Abuelo stand vor ihm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52dffdcd-3485-4c22-bf4c-09283319b45b\', \'multiverseId\': 637012}, \'multiverseid\': 637012}, {\'name\': \'Despertar de Abuelo\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de artefacto o de encantamiento objetivo que no sea Aura de tu cementerio al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 adicionales sobre ella. Es una criatura Espíritu 1/1 con la habilidad de volar además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Quintorius tocó el vetusto poncho que había encontrado. Una ráfaga de magia se condensó para formar un eco, y el sabio Abuelo dio un paso adelante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7164d29-afa4-475e-8a0f-a9d831ff50ce\', \'multiverseId\': 637333}, \'multiverseid\': 637333}, {\'name\': "Éveil d\'Abuelo", \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact ou d\'enchantement non-Aura ciblée depuis votre cimetière avec X marqueurs +1/+1 supplémentaires sur elle. C\'est une créature 1/1 Esprit avec le vol en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Quintorius toucha le vieux poncho qu\'il venait de trouver. Une vague de magie se condensa en un Écho, et Abuelo le sage fit son apparition.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637654&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e35681-2b77-4159-a24a-6435d4d3f167\', \'multiverseId\': 637654}, \'multiverseid\': 637654}, {\'name\': \'Risveglio di Abuelo\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta artefatto o incantesimo non Aura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero con X segnalini +1/+1 addizionali. È una creatura Spirito 1/1 con volare in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Quintorius toccò il vecchio poncho che aveva trovato. Un flusso di magia si condensò in un Eco e il saggio Abuelo fece la sua apparizione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1748b6e0-819d-4624-ab35-698b5e07887a\', \'multiverseId\': 637975}, \'multiverseid\': 637975}, {\'name\': \'アブエロの覚醒\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト、またはオーラでないエンチャントでありあなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。それは、飛行を持ち、他のタイプに加えてスピリット・クリーチャーであり、１/１である。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'クイントリウスは見つけた古いポンチョに触れた。流れ出た魔法は残響となり、賢きアブエロが歩み出た。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'847d5346-f7d0-4b0f-83fe-1d5b9f2ef8f7\', \'multiverseId\': 638296}, \'multiverseid\': 638296}, {\'name\': \'Despertar de Abuelo\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card de artefato ou encantamento não Aura de seu cemitério ao campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1 adicionais. Ele é uma criatura Espírito 1/1 com voar além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Quintorius tocou o velho poncho. Um turbilhão mágico se condensou num Eco, e o sábio Abuelo apresentou-se.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5b97f54-b90a-47bc-b8d8-1f401584b213\', \'multiverseId\': 638617}, \'multiverseid\': 638617}, {\'name\': \'先父觉醒\', \'text\': \'将目标神器或非灵气结界牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，且上面额外有X个+1/+1指示物。它是具飞行异能的1/1精怪生物，且仍具有原本类别。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'昆托力轻轻碰了一下他刚发现的旧斗篷。未料其间魔力涌现，汇聚成念世灵之形，先父阿布罗就此现身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6740473e-64f8-431c-aff3-05149ebd1862\', \'multiverseId\': 638938}, \'multiverseid\': 638938}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abuelos Erwachen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Artefaktkarte oder eine Nicht-Aura-Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof mit X zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel zurück. Sie ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen eine 1/1 Geist-Kreatur mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Quintorius berührte den alten Poncho, den er gefunden hatte. Ein Schwall Magie verdichtete sich zu einem Echo und der weise Abuelo stand vor ihm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639801&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'189cb533-cc32-42cc-a292-fbc2bd130865\', \'multiverseId\': 639801}, \'multiverseid\': 639801}, {\'name\': "Éveil d\'Abuelo", \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact ou d\'enchantement non-Aura ciblée depuis votre cimetière avec X marqueurs +1/+1 supplémentaires sur elle. C\'est une créature 1/1 Esprit avec le vol en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Quintorius toucha le vieux poncho qu\'il venait de trouver. Une vague de magie se condensa en un Écho, et Abuelo le sage fit son apparition.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c488960c-1fa2-43a0-9a16-969f3d6099c0\', \'multiverseId\': 639852}, \'multiverseid\': 639852}, {\'name\': \'アブエロの覚醒\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト、またはオーラでないエンチャントであり、あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。それは、飛行を持ち、他のタイプに加えてスピリット・クリーチャーであり、１/１である。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'クイントリウスは見つけた古いポンチョに触れた。流れ出た魔法は残響となり、賢きアブエロが歩み出た。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddc9582-3127-4c23-be5f-0434f5966e7f\', \'multiverseId\': 639903}, \'multiverseid\': 639903}, {\'name\': \'先父觉醒\', \'text\': \'将目标神器或非灵气结界牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，且上面额外有X个+1/+1指示物。它是1/1，具飞行异能的精怪生物，且仍具有原本类别。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'昆托力轻轻碰了一下他刚发现的旧斗篷，未料其间魔力涌现，汇聚成念世灵之形，先父阿布罗就此现身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df3bbc0-cf90-4935-a6bd-12cf4fc8f301\', \'multiverseId\': 639954}, \'multiverseid\': 639954}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abwärts in die Schlucht\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erkundet und erkundet dann erneut. (Decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls die Karte ein Land ist, nimm sie auf deine Hand. Lege sonst eine +1/+1-Marke auf jene Kreatur und lege dann die Karte zurück oder auf deinen Friedhof. Wiederhole dann diesen Vorgang.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637245&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e38e4dbd-5356-401a-b981-11443d008d97\', \'multiverseId\': 637245}, \'multiverseid\': 637245}, {\'name\': \'Hacia el abismo\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\\n• La criatura objetivo que controlas explora, luego explora de nuevo. (Muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Pon esa carta en tu mano si es una tierra. De lo contrario, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esa criatura y luego devuelve la carta a su sitio o ponla en tu cementerio. Luego, repite este proceso.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4a3ba1c-7d21-424b-a13f-c4eb3d1928df\', \'multiverseId\': 637566}, \'multiverseid\': 637566}, {\'name\': \'Au fond du gouffre\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement.\\n• Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez explore, puis elle explore à nouveau. (Révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez cette carte dans votre main si c\'est un terrain. Sinon, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature, puis remettez la carte au-dessus de votre bibliothèque ou mettez-la dans votre cimetière. Puis répétez ce processus.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62ef418c-fd65-4fc1-aafd-30aafc027390\', \'multiverseId\': 637887}, \'multiverseid\': 637887}, {\'name\': "Sull\'Orlo del Baratro", \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio che controlli esplora, poi esplora di nuovo. (Rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una terra, aggiungila alla tua mano. Altrimenti, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla creatura, poi rimetti la carta al suo posto o mettila nel tuo cimitero. Poi ripeti questo procedimento.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94ee7e20-d9f4-4e8e-a53c-f83dded5f879\', \'multiverseId\': 638208}, \'multiverseid\': 638208}, {\'name\': \'崖からの転落\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・アーティファクトやエンチャントである１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n・あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それは探検を行う。その後、それはもう１回探検を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それが土地なら、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。そうでないなら、そのクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、その後、そのカードを戻すかあなたの墓地に置く。その後、この手順を繰り返す。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f0d2682-f37f-4234-9a3c-52e21176789f\', \'multiverseId\': 638529}, \'multiverseid\': 638529}, {\'name\': \'Além da Beira\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\\n• A criatura alvo que você controla explora e depois explora novamente. (Revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Coloque aquele card em sua mão se ele for um terreno. Caso contrário, coloque um marcador +1/+1 naquela criatura e, em seguida, devolva o card ao grimório ou coloque-o em seu cemitério. Em seguida, repita o processo.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9b5c4e2-ed4c-4a14-afcf-80b258cd0744\', \'multiverseId\': 638850}, \'multiverseid\': 638850}, {\'name\': \'边缘失手\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•消灭目标神器或结界。\\n•令目标由你操控的生物勘察，然后再勘察。（展示你的牌库顶牌。如果该牌是地，则置于你手上。若否，则在该生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后将所展示的牌放回原位或置入你的坟墓场。然后重复此流程。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c6c1c6-486b-4304-b4c7-0965b1bd4d26\', \'multiverseId\': 639171}, \'multiverseid\': 639171}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aclazotz, Tiefster Verrat // Tempel der Toten\', \'text\': \'(Transformierter Aclazotz, Tiefster Verrat.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Transformiere den Tempel der Toten. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls ein Spieler eine oder weniger Karten auf der Hand hat, und nur wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Tempel der Toten\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637112&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1cff323-0997-4492-9092-317fd7e087bb\', \'multiverseId\': 637112}, \'multiverseid\': 637112}, {\'name\': \'Aclazotz, Traición Primigenia // Templo de los muertos\', \'text\': \'(Se transforma de Aclazotz, Traición Primigenia.)\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Transforma el Templo de los muertos. Activa esto solo si un jugador tiene una o menos cartas en la mano y solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Templo de los muertos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64583b1a-e216-4cb2-8697-76e957e4ceca\', \'multiverseId\': 637433}, \'multiverseid\': 637433}, {\'name\': \'Aclazotz, Trahison des profondeurs // Temple des morts\', \'text\': "(Transformation d\'Aclazotz, Trahison des profondeurs.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T} : Transformez le Temple des morts. N\'activez que si un joueur à une carte ou moins en main et que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Temple des morts\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637754&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fa0da68-f448-4c3f-a471-912a6cc1c5a2\', \'multiverseId\': 637754}, \'multiverseid\': 637754}, {\'name\': \'Aclazotz, Tradimento Profondo // Tempio dei Morti\', \'text\': \'(Si trasforma da Aclazotz, Tradimento Profondo.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Trasforma il Tempio dei Morti. Attiva solo se un giocatore ha una o meno carte in mano e solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Tempio dei Morti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2ed03d7-f822-49b6-ad52-0b8132b9c644\', \'multiverseId\': 638075}, \'multiverseid\': 638075}, {\'name\': \'最深の裏切り、アクロゾズ // 死者の神殿\', \'text\': \'（最深の裏切り、アクロゾズから変身する。）\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\\n{2}{B}, {T}：死者の神殿を変身させる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行い、手札が１枚以下であるプレイヤーがいなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'死者の神殿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c558ad23-cb3e-4b93-b403-67136b928342\', \'multiverseId\': 638396}, \'multiverseid\': 638396}, {\'name\': \'Aclazotz, Traição Profunda // Templo dos Mortos\', \'text\': \'(Transformação de Aclazotz, Traição Profunda.)\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Transforme Templo dos Mortos. Ative somente se um jogador tiver um ou menos cards na mão e somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Templo dos Mortos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1b536d-205e-4779-910f-74eb6e8099fe\', \'multiverseId\': 638717}, \'multiverseid\': 638717}, {\'name\': \'深邃叛神阿洛佐兹 // 亡者殿堂\', \'text\': \'（由深邃叛神阿洛佐兹转化。）\\n{T}：加{B}。\\n{2}{B}，{T}：转化亡者殿堂。只能于某牌手的手牌为一张或更少时起动，且仅限法术时机。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'亡者殿堂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d80e4de-a7aa-4df1-8c2f-efbbf7520fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 639038}, \'multiverseid\': 639038}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aclazotz, Tiefster Verrat // Tempel der Toten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn Aclazotz angreift, wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte ab. Du ziehst für jeden Gegner, der dies nicht kann, eine Karte.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner eine Länderkarte abwirft, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Fledermaus-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nWenn Aclazotz stirbt, bringe ihn getappt und transformiert unter der Kontrolle seines Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Fledermaus, Gott\', \'flavor\': \'Chimil schenkte den Oltec Ruhe nach dem Tod. Aclazotz entriss sie ihnen.\', \'faceName\': \'Aclazotz, Tiefster Verrat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637112&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1cff323-0997-4492-9092-317fd7e087bb\', \'multiverseId\': 637112}, \'multiverseid\': 637112}, {\'name\': \'Aclazotz, Traición Primigenia // Templo de los muertos\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que Aclazotz ataque, cada oponente descarta una carta. Por cada oponente que no pueda hacerlo, robas una carta.\\nSiempre que un oponente descarte una carta de tierra, crea una ficha de criatura Murciélago negra 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nCuando Aclazotz muera, regrésalo al campo de batalla girado y transformado bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Deidad murciélago\', \'flavor\': \'Chimil les dio la paz en la muerte a los oltec y Aclazotz se la arrebató.\', \'faceName\': \'Aclazotz, Traición Primigenia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64583b1a-e216-4cb2-8697-76e957e4ceca\', \'multiverseId\': 637433}, \'multiverseid\': 637433}, {\'name\': \'Aclazotz, Trahison des profondeurs // Temple des morts\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Aclazotz attaque, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte. Pour chaque adversaire qui ne peut pas le faire, vous piochez une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire se défausse d\'une carte de terrain, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Chauve-souris avec le vol.\\nQuand Aclazotz meurt, renvoyez-le sur le champ de bataille, engagé et transformé, sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — chauve-souris et dieu\', \'flavor\': \'Chimil a donné aux Oltèques la paix de la mort. Aclazotz la leur a arrachée.\', \'faceName\': \'Aclazotz, Trahison des profondeurs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637754&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fa0da68-f448-4c3f-a471-912a6cc1c5a2\', \'multiverseId\': 637754}, \'multiverseid\': 637754}, {\'name\': \'Aclazotz, Tradimento Profondo // Tempio dei Morti\', \'text\': \'Volare, legame vitale\\nOgniqualvolta Aclazotz attacca, ogni avversario scarta una carta. Per ogni avversario che non può farlo, tu peschi una carta.\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario scarta una carta terra, crea una pedina creatura Pipistrello 1/1 nera con volare.\\nQuando Aclazotz muore, rimettilo sul campo di battaglia TAPpato e trasformato sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Pipistrello Dio\', \'flavor\': \'Chimil donò agli Oltec la pace nella morte. Aclazotz gliela sottrasse.\', \'faceName\': \'Aclazotz, Tradimento Profondo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2ed03d7-f822-49b6-ad52-0b8132b9c644\', \'multiverseId\': 638075}, \'multiverseid\': 638075}, {\'name\': \'最深の裏切り、アクロゾズ // 死者の神殿\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\nこれが攻撃するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。あなたは、そうできなかった対戦相手１人につき１枚のカードを引く。\\n対戦相手が土地・カード１枚を捨てるたび、あなたは飛行を持つ黒の１/１のコウモリ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nこれが死亡したとき、これをオーナーのコントロール下でタップ状態かつ変身させた状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — コウモリ・神\', \'flavor\': \'チミルはオルテカに死の安らぎを与えた。アクロゾズはそれを奪い取った。\', \'faceName\': \'最深の裏切り、アクロゾズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c558ad23-cb3e-4b93-b403-67136b928342\', \'multiverseId\': 638396}, \'multiverseid\': 638396}, {\'name\': \'Aclazotz, Traição Profunda // Templo dos Mortos\', \'text\': \'Voar, vínculo com a vida\\nToda vez que Aclazotz ataca, cada oponente descarta um card. Para cada oponente que não puder fazê-lo, você compra um card.\\nToda vez que um oponente descartar um card de terreno, crie uma ficha de criatura Morcego preta 1/1 com voar.\\nQuando Aclazotz morrer, devolva-o ao campo de batalha virado e transformado sob o controle de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Morcego Deus\', \'flavor\': \'Chimil deu aos oltecas a paz na morte. Aclazotz a arrancou deles.\', \'faceName\': \'Aclazotz, Traição Profunda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1b536d-205e-4779-910f-74eb6e8099fe\', \'multiverseId\': 638717}, \'multiverseid\': 638717}, {\'name\': \'深邃叛神阿洛佐兹 // 亡者殿堂\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n每当阿洛佐兹攻击时，每位对手各弃一张牌。每有一位无法如此作的对手，你便抓一张牌。\\n每当任一对手弃一张地牌时，你派出一个1/1黑色，具飞行异能的蝙蝠衍生生物。\\n当阿洛佐兹死去时，将它在其拥有者的操控下横置移回战场且已转化。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 蝙蝠／神\', \'flavor\': \'奇密理赋欧尔提克逝后安眠。阿洛佐兹将这一切剥夺殆尽。\', \'faceName\': \'深邃叛神阿洛佐兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d80e4de-a7aa-4df1-8c2f-efbbf7520fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 639038}, \'multiverseid\': 639038}]', '[{\'name\': \'Acolyte of Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\', \'type\': \'Creature — Vampire Cleric\', \'flavor\': \'"Great Aclazotz, receive this offering. Wrought with skill. Captured with strength. Anointed with the blood of your enemies."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637114&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ba4a14b-e31f-4c2d-b2cb-333334afd898\', \'multiverseId\': 637114}, \'multiverseid\': 637114}, {\'name\': \'Acolyte of Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\', \'type\': \'Creature — Vampire Cleric\', \'flavor\': \'"Great Aclazotz, receive this offering. Wrought with skill. Captured with strength. Anointed with the blood of your enemies."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70ff7fae-a202-4ae4-a4d6-f2c48deb66cb\', \'multiverseId\': 637435}, \'multiverseid\': 637435}, {\'name\': \'Acolyte of Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\', \'type\': \'Creature — Vampire Cleric\', \'flavor\': \'"Great Aclazotz, receive this offering. Wrought with skill. Captured with strength. Anointed with the blood of your enemies."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637756&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dac7f860-3928-477f-ad4c-6361b3e051b8\', \'multiverseId\': 637756}, \'multiverseid\': 637756}, {\'name\': \'Acolyte of Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\', \'type\': \'Creature — Vampire Cleric\', \'flavor\': \'"Great Aclazotz, receive this offering. Wrought with skill. Captured with strength. Anointed with the blood of your enemies."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'810f2af5-ee96-4019-9c0d-4ea7eb82b0f1\', \'multiverseId\': 638077}, \'multiverseid\': 638077}, {\'name\': \'Acolyte of Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\', \'type\': \'Creature — Vampire Cleric\', \'flavor\': \'"Great Aclazotz, receive this offering. Wrought with skill. Captured with strength. Anointed with the blood of your enemies."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69de0d09-e0e2-4545-9e8a-345f57879a9d\', \'multiverseId\': 638398}, \'multiverseid\': 638398}, {\'name\': \'Acolyte of Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\', \'type\': \'Creature — Vampire Cleric\', \'flavor\': \'"Great Aclazotz, receive this offering. Wrought with skill. Captured with strength. Anointed with the blood of your enemies."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a519ec1e-6702-47e1-949d-4b126ff33cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 638719}, \'multiverseid\': 638719}, {\'name\': \'Acolyte of Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\', \'type\': \'Creature — Vampire Cleric\', \'flavor\': \'"Great Aclazotz, receive this offering. Wrought with skill. Captured with strength. Anointed with the blood of your enemies."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00b073fe-dfc6-44b5-9e3d-836c6b795ebe\', \'multiverseId\': 639040}, \'multiverseid\': 639040}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adaptiver Gemmengardist\', \'text\': \'Tappe zwei ungetappte Artefakte und/oder Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Adaptiven Gemmengardisten. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gnom\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn man sie sich selbst überlässt, rüsten Gnome ihre eigenen Gerätschaften um.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d648fb7-2b92-4344-b3d0-2bacb325eb83\', \'multiverseId\': 637014}, \'multiverseid\': 637014}, {\'name\': \'Gemaguarda adaptativo\', \'text\': \'Girar dos criaturas y/o artefactos enderezados que controlas: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Gemaguarda adaptativo. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gnomo\', \'flavor\': \'Una vez desatendidos, los gnomos centran su atención en modificar sus propios mecanismos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe187e0-7a6b-4769-8abc-7f8fe1e48adb\', \'multiverseId\': 637335}, \'multiverseid\': 637335}, {\'name\': \'Garde-gemme évolutif\', \'text\': "Engagez deux artefacts et/ou créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Garde-gemme évolutif. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — gnome\', \'flavor\': \'Laissés à eux-mêmes, les gnomes repensèrent leurs défenses eux-mêmes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637656&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08667c4d-f58c-427a-b329-273b8670ef7a\', \'multiverseId\': 637656}, \'multiverseid\': 637656}, {\'name\': \'Gemmaguardia Adattiva\', \'text\': \'TAPpa due artefatti e/o creature STAPpati che controlli: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Gemmaguardia Adattiva. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Gnomo\', \'flavor\': \'Abbandonati a se stessi, gli gnomi sanno reinventare se stessi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98dfebba-2ebc-493e-b27a-88692d62b55a\', \'multiverseId\': 637977}, \'multiverseid\': 637977}, {\'name\': \'順応する宝石護り\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャーでありあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である２つをタップする：順応する宝石護りの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ノーム\', \'flavor\': \'装置を任されたノームは、自らの設計ですら再設計する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd8fc58f-f270-4438-b577-52bb9fd25568\', \'multiverseId\': 638298}, \'multiverseid\': 638298}, {\'name\': \'Guarda de Gemas Adaptativo\', \'text\': \'Vire dois artefatos e/ou criaturas desvirados que você controla: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Guarda de Gemas Adaptativo . Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Gnomo\', \'flavor\': \'Se deixados à própria mercê, os gnomos se superam no autoaperfeiçoamento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4469732-6d4e-477e-99fa-fcfcd6a0a02e\', \'multiverseId\': 638619}, \'multiverseid\': 638619}, {\'name\': \'适境卫石械\', \'text\': \'横置两个由你操控且未横置的神器和／或生物：在适境卫石械上放置一个+1/+1指示物。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 — 地侏\', \'flavor\': \'遭放任自流后，侏械便开始将自己的机械重作他用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40ac56f2-4813-4560-9928-9ca6f250beba\', \'multiverseId\': 638940}, \'multiverseid\': 638940}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akal Pakal, Erste unter Ebenbürtigen\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Endsegments jedes Spielers und falls in diesem Zug ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege die andere auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese verlorenen Kinder von Aclazotz wurde in die Irre geleitet, aber vielleicht können wir unsere Ideale auch ohne einen Krieg in Einklang bringen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637061&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'059c6750-d343-46a9-8baf-63aa7957fbec\', \'multiverseId\': 637061}, \'multiverseid\': 637061}, {\'name\': \'Akal Pakal, Primera entre Iguales\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del paso final de cada jugador, si un artefacto entró al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y la otra en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los hijos perdidos de Aclazotz se equivocan, pero quizá podamos reconciliar nuestros ideales sin precisar de una guerra".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a83622c9-904c-4d46-b04c-d183602546c2\', \'multiverseId\': 637382}, \'multiverseid\': 637382}, {\'name\': \'Akal Pakal, première parmi les égaux\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'étape de fin de chaque joueur, si un artefact est arrivé sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': "« Ces enfants perdus d\'Aclazotz sont certes malavisés, mais peut-être une réconciliation de nos idéaux sans guerre reste possible. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637703&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e54cc9db-2b84-488b-b28a-38fb7fdad087\', \'multiverseId\': 637703}, \'multiverseid\': 637703}, {\'name\': \'Akal Pakal, Prima Tra gli Eguali\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della sottofase finale di ogni giocatore, se un artefatto è entrato nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questi figli perduti di Aclazotz sono fuorviati, ma forse è possibile riconciliare i nostri ideali senza una guerra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9958a6cf-b1d9-4e4c-befa-d7b8dc0857c2\', \'multiverseId\': 638024}, \'multiverseid\': 638024}, {\'name\': \'最初の平等者、アカル・パカル\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーの終了ステップの開始時に、このターン、アーティファクト１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出た場合、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に、もう１枚をあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「アクロゾズの迷い子達は道を誤ったが、争いを避け、理想的な形で和解することはできるかもしれない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63bd39d4-031e-4f4a-8f7b-0f0a846eed72\', \'multiverseId\': 638345}, \'multiverseid\': 638345}, {\'name\': \'Akal Pakal, Primeira Entre Iguais\', \'text\': \'No início da etapa final de cada jogador, se um artefato tiver entrado no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno, olhe os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles na sua mão e o outro em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esses filhos perdidos de Aclazotz se desencaminharam, mas talvez possa haver, sem guerra, uma reconciliação entre nossos ideais."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd5dec9d-7fd3-4149-8a88-fc12e19bb6bf\', \'multiverseId\': 638666}, \'multiverseid\': 638666}, {\'name\': \'芸生班首阿卡帕卡\', \'text\': \'在每位牌手的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中有神器在你操控下进战场，则检视你牌库顶的两张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，另一张则置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「这些遭阿洛佐兹蒙蔽的孩子已走上歧途，但仍有一丝不必诉诸战争便能和解的机会。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10864be5-8cb0-41fe-a4cc-0ab474e2830c\', \'multiverseId\': 638987}, \'multiverseid\': 638987}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akal Pakal, Erste unter Ebenbürtigen\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Endsegments jedes Spielers und falls in diesem Zug ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege die andere auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636523&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd86a0ba-5eb3-4df4-a87e-28e7a7257472\', \'multiverseId\': 636523}, \'multiverseid\': 636523}, {\'name\': \'Akal Pakal, Primera entre Iguales\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del paso final de cada jugador, si un artefacto entró al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y la otra en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60bc50dc-91be-4455-931d-1a22ea71e6b1\', \'multiverseId\': 636547}, \'multiverseid\': 636547}, {\'name\': \'Akal Pakal, première parmi les égaux\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'étape de fin de chaque joueur, si un artefact est arrivé sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636571&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a868f21-276b-4a3d-8d11-85bd9d434075\', \'multiverseId\': 636571}, \'multiverseid\': 636571}, {\'name\': \'Akal Pakal, Prima Tra gli Eguali\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della sottofase finale di ogni giocatore, se un artefatto è entrato nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50dd8a72-ba5f-4eef-8e4f-e4059b8f4bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 636595}, \'multiverseid\': 636595}, {\'name\': \'最初の平等者、アカル・パカル\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにアーティファクトがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出た場合、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e4e541-fdf7-4af9-bc6c-f2ca83281633\', \'multiverseId\': 636619}, \'multiverseid\': 636619}, {\'name\': \'Akal Pakal, Primeira Entre Iguais\', \'text\': \'No início da etapa final de cada jogador, se um artefato tiver entrado no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno, olhe os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles na sua mão e o outro em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ed50133-698f-4003-8be6-2b2e79b78f02\', \'multiverseId\': 636643}, \'multiverseid\': 636643}, {\'name\': \'芸生班首阿卡帕卡\', \'text\': \'在每位牌手的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中有神器在你操控下进战场，则检视你牌库顶的两张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，另一张则置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d44e75-9e7c-47db-b693-c254f3607902\', \'multiverseId\': 636667}, \'multiverseid\': 636667}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akawalli, der wallende Turm\', \'text\': \'Abstieg 4 — Solange dein Friedhof vier oder mehr Permanent-Karten enthält, erhält Akawalli, der wallende Turm, +2/+2 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nAbstieg 8 — Solange dein Friedhof acht oder mehr Permanent-Karten enthält, erhält Akawalli zusätzlich +2/+2 und kann nicht von mehr als einer Kreatur geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'329048f5-d673-4c84-b599-851cf675a215\', \'multiverseId\': 636530}, \'multiverseid\': 636530}, {\'name\': \'Akawalli, la Torre Inquieta\', \'text\': \'Descender 4 — Mientras haya cuatro o más cartas de permanente en tu cementerio, Akawalli, la Torre Inquieta obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\\nDescender 8 — Mientras haya ocho o más cartas de permanente en tu cementerio, Akawalli obtiene un +2/+2 adicional y no puede ser bloqueada por más de una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hongo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a8aec31-2842-490e-a177-0660dbe44233\', \'multiverseId\': 636554}, \'multiverseid\': 636554}, {\'name\': \'Akawalli, la tour bouillonnante\', \'text\': "Descente 4 — Tant qu\'il y a au moins quatre cartes de permanent dans votre cimetière, Akawalli, la tour bouillonnante gagne +2/+2 et a le piétinement.\\nDescente 8 — Tant qu\'il y a au moins huit cartes de permanent dans votre cimetière, Akawalli gagne un +2/+2 supplémentaire et ne peut pas être bloqué par plus d\'une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — fongus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636578&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98b44230-b4db-4308-839f-d381d9a621e1\', \'multiverseId\': 636578}, \'multiverseid\': 636578}, {\'name\': \'Akawalli, il Furore Torreggiante\', \'text\': \'Discesa 4 — Fintanto che ci sono quattro o più carte permanente nel tuo cimitero, Akawalli, il Furore Torreggiante prende +2/+2 e ha travolgere.\\nDiscesa 8 — Fintanto che ci sono otto o più carte permanente nel tuo cimitero, Akawalli prende un +2/+2 addizionale e non può essere bloccato da più di una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Fungus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e11351-b006-4ce2-9dde-4601ec2c82cd\', \'multiverseId\': 636602}, \'multiverseid\': 636602}, {\'name\': \'煮えたぎる塔、アカワリ\', \'text\': \'落魄４ ― あなたの墓地に４枚以上のパーマネント・カードがあるかぎり、煮えたぎる塔、アカワリは＋２/＋２の修整を受けトランプルを持つ。\\n落魄８ ― あなたの墓地に８枚以上のパーマネント・カードがあるかぎり、これは追加で＋２/＋２の修整を受け、２体以上のクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50011f67-85b2-48b0-971f-7bb71c9cdc8e\', \'multiverseId\': 636626}, \'multiverseid\': 636626}, {\'name\': \'Akawalli, a Torre Fervente\', \'text\': \'Descer 4 — Enquanto houver quatro ou mais cards de permanente em seu cemitério, Akawalli, a Torre Fervente, receberá +2/+2 e terá atropelar.\\nDescer 8 — Enquanto houver oito ou mais cards de permanente em seu cemitério, Akawalli receberá +2/+2 e não poderá ser bloqueada por mais de uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Fungo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a390a5-bfb6-49d4-ad32-161340b78cd7\', \'multiverseId\': 636650}, \'multiverseid\': 636650}, {\'name\': \'火热伟菇阿卡瓦利\', \'text\': \'落坟4～只要你坟墓场中有四张或更多永久物牌，火热伟菇阿卡瓦利便得+2/+2且具有践踏异能。\\n落坟8～只要你坟墓场中有八张或更多永久物牌，火热伟菇阿卡瓦利便再得+2/+2且不能被多于一个生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 真菌\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83da2ca0-f4d9-4391-90e6-1e3e04272082\', \'multiverseId\': 636674}, \'multiverseid\': 636674}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akawalli, der wallende Turm\', \'text\': \'Abstieg 4 — Solange dein Friedhof vier oder mehr Permanent-Karten enthält, erhält Akawalli, der wallende Turm, +2/+2 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nAbstieg 8 — Solange dein Friedhof acht oder mehr Permanent-Karten enthält, erhält Akawalli zusätzlich +2/+2 und kann nicht von mehr als einer Kreatur geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637261&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a59a6a2-19f9-43b6-818b-d73ab0e9f005\', \'multiverseId\': 637261}, \'multiverseid\': 637261}, {\'name\': \'Akawalli, la Torre Inquieta\', \'text\': \'Descender 4 — Mientras haya cuatro o más cartas de permanente en tu cementerio, Akawalli, la Torre Inquieta obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\\nDescender 8 — Mientras haya ocho o más cartas de permanente en tu cementerio, Akawalli obtiene un +2/+2 adicional y no puede ser bloqueada por más de una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hongo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a107fcdf-da6b-4e11-9efc-dcf9b7b4d0c3\', \'multiverseId\': 637582}, \'multiverseid\': 637582}, {\'name\': \'Akawalli, la tour bouillonnante\', \'text\': "Descente 4 — Tant qu\'il y a au moins quatre cartes de permanent dans votre cimetière, Akawalli, la tour bouillonnante gagne +2/+2 et a le piétinement.\\nDescente 8 — Tant qu\'il y a au moins huit cartes de permanent dans votre cimetière, Akawalli gagne un +2/+2 supplémentaire et ne peut pas être bloqué par plus d\'une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — fongus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637903&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37457aea-8cb7-4b2d-8d2c-b78c618c652c\', \'multiverseId\': 637903}, \'multiverseid\': 637903}, {\'name\': \'Akawalli, il Furore Torreggiante\', \'text\': \'Discesa 4 — Fintanto che ci sono quattro o più carte permanente nel tuo cimitero, Akawalli, il Furore Torreggiante prende +2/+2 e ha travolgere.\\nDiscesa 8 — Fintanto che ci sono otto o più carte permanente nel tuo cimitero, Akawalli prende un +2/+2 addizionale e non può essere bloccato da più di una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Fungus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ea3c1b-5cdd-4668-b05b-b1fe9eb12544\', \'multiverseId\': 638224}, \'multiverseid\': 638224}, {\'name\': \'煮えたぎる塔、アカワリ\', \'text\': \'落魄４ ― あなたの墓地に４枚以上のパーマネント・カードがあるかぎり、煮えたぎる塔、アカワリは＋２/＋２の修整を受けトランプルを持つ。\\n落魄８ ― あなたの墓地に８枚以上のパーマネント・カードがあるかぎり、これは追加で＋２/＋２の修整を受け、２体以上のクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84cf8174-a8e6-4bfa-8e18-21d7b51fb75c\', \'multiverseId\': 638545}, \'multiverseid\': 638545}, {\'name\': \'Akawalli, a Torre Fervente\', \'text\': \'Descer 4 — Enquanto houver quatro ou mais cards de permanente em seu cemitério, Akawalli, a Torre Fervente, receberá +2/+2 e terá atropelar.\\nDescer 8 — Enquanto houver oito ou mais cards de permanente em seu cemitério, Akawalli receberá +2/+2 e não poderá ser bloqueada por mais de uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Fungo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3f49e6a-ef0f-4d15-b59e-1a345dee73bc\', \'multiverseId\': 638866}, \'multiverseid\': 638866}, {\'name\': \'火热伟菇阿卡瓦利\', \'text\': \'落坟4～只要你坟墓场中有四张或更多永久物牌，火热伟菇阿卡瓦利便得+2/+2且具有践踏异能。\\n落坟8～只要你坟墓场中有八张或更多永久物牌，火热伟菇阿卡瓦利便再得+2/+2且不能被多于一个生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 真菌\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93fd621-f22d-4183-9eee-05bcb4e34c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 639187}, \'multiverseid\': 639187}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akrobatischer Sprung\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+3 und Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Enttappe sie.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Klippe wegzubrechen begann, tanzte Wayta furchtlos über das taumelnde Geröll, im Wissen, dass Ajij sie niemals stürzen lassen würde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78de68fa-8b0a-4cc8-bfa0-68622055da79\', \'multiverseId\': 637013}, \'multiverseid\': 637013}, {\'name\': \'Salto acrobático\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+3 y gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno. Enderézala.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando el peñasco empezó a derrumbarse, Wayta bailó sin miedo entre las piedras que se precipitaban, a sabiendas de que Ajij no permitiría que cayese.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f42ab31f-1d38-4da9-b73a-4d594683cb64\', \'multiverseId\': 637334}, \'multiverseid\': 637334}, {\'name\': \'Bond acrobatique\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +1/+3 et acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez-la.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Tandis que la falaise cédait sous elle, Wayta dansa d\'une pierre à l\'autre, sans peur, sachant qu\'Ajij ne la laisserait pas tomber.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637655&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c2056bb-ce5d-4415-b422-babe5b62d1bd\', \'multiverseId\': 637655}, \'multiverseid\': 637655}, {\'name\': \'Balzo Acrobatico\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+3 e ha volare fino alla fine del turno. STAPpala.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Mentre la scarpata iniziava a sgretolarsi, Wayta danzava impavida tra le rocce distrutte, conscia del fatto che Ajij non l\'avrebbe mai lasciata cadere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'534f9fcc-fec0-49c8-984c-1625049885d1\', \'multiverseId\': 637976}, \'multiverseid\': 637976}, {\'name\': \'軽業の跳躍\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋３の修整を受け飛行を得る。それをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'崖が崩れ始め、崩れ落ちる岩の上をウェイタは舞うように駆けた。アジジなら自分を決して落としたりしないと信じていたからである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'520e0f6c-da25-49e8-8dfb-a684ab549dc0\', \'multiverseId\': 638297}, \'multiverseid\': 638297}, {\'name\': \'Salto Acrobático\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +1/+3 e ganha voar até o final do turno. Desvire-a.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quando o penhasco começou a desmoronar, Wayta dançava destemida pelas pedras que rolavam, sabendo que Ajij jamais a deixaria cair.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acf3f8e5-aa25-473b-b94d-beb911535dcb\', \'multiverseId\': 638618}, \'multiverseid\': 638618}, {\'name\': \'巧躯飞跃\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+3且获得飞行异能。将它重置。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'眼见崖壁崩落，薇塔仍在滚石间轻盈跳动，脸上却毫无畏惧神色～因为她深知阿吉不会让她掉下去。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5c5d78d-8f10-43fd-bf21-f6455430aef1\', \'multiverseId\': 638939}, \'multiverseid\': 638939}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amalia Benavides Aguirre\', \'text\': \'Abwehr — 3 Lebenspunkte bezahlen.\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erkundet Amalia Benavides Aguirre. Zerstöre dann alle anderen Kreaturen, falls ihre Stärke genau 20 ist. (Um diese Kreatur erkunden zu lassen, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls die Karte ein Land ist, nimm sie auf deine Hand. Lege sonst eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur und lege dann die Karte zurück oder auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637262&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3469ba86-a09c-40d9-a48c-9ced94f20eb6\', \'multiverseId\': 637262}, \'multiverseid\': 637262}, {\'name\': \'Amalia Benavides Aguirre\', \'text\': \'Rebatir—Pagar 3 vidas.\\nSiempre que ganes vidas, Amalia Benavides Aguirre explora. Luego, destruye todas las otras criaturas si la fuerza de Amalia es de 20 exactamente. (Para que esta criatura explore, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Pon esa carta en tu mano si es una tierra. De lo contrario, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura y luego devuelve la carta a su sitio o ponla en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Explorador vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0747445e-5c22-479d-84d8-798f676ccc8f\', \'multiverseId\': 637583}, \'multiverseid\': 637583}, {\'name\': \'Amalia Benavides Aguirre\', \'text\': "Parade — Payez 3 points de vie.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, Amalia Benavides Aguirre explore. Puis détruisez toutes les autres créatures si sa force est exactement 20. (Pour faire explorer cette créature, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez cette carte dans votre main si c\'est un terrain. Sinon, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature, puis remettez la carte au-dessus de votre bibliothèque ou mettez-la dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — vampire et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8a82bb3-21f1-4212-b9e1-4d87d0d3bad9\', \'multiverseId\': 637904}, \'multiverseid\': 637904}, {\'name\': \'Amalia Benavides Aguirre\', \'text\': \'Egida—Paga 3 punti vita.\\nOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, Amalia Benavides Aguirre esplora. Poi distruggi tutte le altre creature se la sua forza è esattamente 20. (Per far esplorare questa creatura, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una terra, aggiungila alla tua mano. Altrimenti, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura, poi rimetti quella carta al suo posto o mettila nel tuo cimitero.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Esploratore Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8544ef5b-7aff-4920-98b1-cd80206cb70b\', \'multiverseId\': 638225}, \'multiverseid\': 638225}, {\'name\': \'アマリア・べナヴィデス・アギーレ\', \'text\': \'護法―３点のライフを支払う。\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、アマリア・べナヴィデス・アギーレは探検を行う。その後、これのパワーがちょうど20であるなら、これでないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。（このクリーチャーが探検を行うとは、「あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それが土地なら、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。そうでないなら、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。その後、そのカードを戻すかあなたの墓地に置く。」ということである。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61f91508-1c47-4135-915f-c10db251a154\', \'multiverseId\': 638546}, \'multiverseid\': 638546}, {\'name\': \'Amalia Benavides Aguirre\', \'text\': \'Salvaguarda — Pague 3 pontos de vida.\\nToda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, Amalia Benavides Aguirre explora. Depois, destrua todas as outras criaturas se o poder dela for exatamente 20. (Para fazer esta criatura explorar, revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Coloque aquele card em sua mão se ele for um terreno. Caso contrário, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura e, em seguida, devolva o card ao grimório ou coloque-o em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Batedor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f921597a-21ea-4bd5-8dab-86672419760f\', \'multiverseId\': 638867}, \'multiverseid\': 638867}, {\'name\': \'阿玛利亚贝纳维德阿格雷\', \'text\': \'守护～支付3点生命。\\n每当你获得生命时，令阿玛利亚贝纳维德阿格雷勘察。然后如果其力量为正好20，则消灭所有其他生物。（令此生物勘察的流程是展示你的牌库顶牌。如果该牌是地，则置于你手上。若否，则在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后将所展示的牌放回原位或置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 吸血鬼／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7435410c-33e7-4c81-92c8-d95ec7ec02af\', \'multiverseId\': 639188}, \'multiverseid\': 639188}]', "[{'name': 'Amalia Benavides Aguirre', 'text': 'Abwehr — 3 Lebenspunkte bezahlen.\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erkundet Amalia Benavides Aguirre. Zerstöre dann alle anderen Kreaturen, falls ihre Stärke genau 20 ist.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Späher', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636531&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b896009e-0f8a-4881-adc6-da32b29cdc49', 'multiverseId': 636531}, 'multiverseid': 636531}, {'name': 'Amalia Benavides Aguirre', 'text': 'Rebatir—Pagar 3 vidas.\\nSiempre que ganes vidas, Amalia Benavides Aguirre explora. Luego, destruye todas las otras criaturas si la fuerza de Amalia es de 20 exactamente.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Explorador vampiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636555&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3277abc-a101-4628-bd7f-1b05a550dddd', 'multiverseId': 636555}, 'multiverseid': 636555}, {'name': 'Amalia Benavides Aguirre', 'text': 'Parade — Payez 3 points de vie.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, Amalia Benavides Aguirre explore. Puis détruisez toutes les autres créatures si sa force est exactement 20.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire — vampire et éclaireur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636579&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6df8a024-6f21-4233-8100-e290ef0a4c04', 'multiverseId': 636579}, 'multiverseid': 636579}, {'name': 'Amalia Benavides Aguirre', 'text': 'Egida—Paga 3 punti vita.\\nOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, Amalia Benavides Aguirre esplora. Poi distruggi tutte le altre creature se la sua forza è esattamente 20.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Esploratore Vampiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636603&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7b0189e-e28c-4a52-8e0c-5717a3c35db7', 'multiverseId': 636603}, 'multiverseid': 636603}, {'name': 'アマリア・べナヴィデス・アギーレ', 'text': '護法―３点のライフを支払う。\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、アマリア・べナヴィデス・アギーレは探検を行う。その後、これのパワーがちょうど20であるなら、これでないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・スカウト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636627&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87cf3251-1506-452b-8156-b3330ae2c6a0', 'multiverseId': 636627}, 'multiverseid': 636627}, {'name': 'Amalia Benavides Aguirre', 'text': 'Salvaguarda — Pague 3 pontos de vida.\\nToda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, Amalia Benavides Aguirre explora. Depois, destrua todas as outras criaturas se o poder dela for exatamente 20.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Batedor', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636651&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '263c8bc5-1125-459f-b697-8285fb44e819', 'multiverseId': 636651}, 'multiverseid': 636651}, {'name': '阿玛利亚贝纳维德阿格雷', 'text': '守护～支付3点生命。\\n每当你获得生命时，令阿玛利亚贝纳维德阿格雷勘察。然后如果其力量为正好20，则消灭所有其他生物。', 'type': '传奇生物 — 吸血鬼／斥候', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636675&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35cbf6fa-91c6-46ca-a72a-c2cce994e9c6', 'multiverseId': 636675}, 'multiverseid': 636675}]", '[{\'name\': \'Anblick des Weltenkerns\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Standardlandkarte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\\n• Bringe eine Höhle-Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Was für ein Anblick! Zum Glück haben wir eine Poetin dabei."\\n—Wayta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637221&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0f37582-5a18-436a-bda9-4bb31a01b888\', \'multiverseId\': 637221}, \'multiverseid\': 637221}, {\'name\': \'Vislumbrar el núcleo\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque básica, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\\n• Regresa la carta de Cueva objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girada.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Vaya... Suerte que trajimos a una poetisa".\\n—Wayta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9a565ef-e37f-4a25-bd4a-1b267c281dfa\', \'multiverseId\': 637542}, \'multiverseid\': 637542}, {\'name\': \'Aperçu du Noyau\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\\n• Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de caverne ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Waouh ! Heureusement qu\'on a un poète avec nous. »\\n—Wayta", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637863&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d76ce46a-bcc9-49db-8c1d-093aa5b9663f\', \'multiverseId\': 637863}, \'multiverseid\': 637863}, {\'name\': \'Scrutare il Nucleo\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\\n• Rimetti sul campo di battaglia TAPpata una carta Caverna bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Sbalorditivo. Per fortuna abbiamo un poeta con noi."\\n—Wayta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'267ec646-0c4b-42f8-a8cb-bd87bea8ac10\', \'multiverseId\': 638184}, \'multiverseid\': 638184}, {\'name\': \'中心核の瞥見\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたのライブラリーから基本森・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\\n・あなたの墓地にある洞窟・カード１枚を対象とする。それをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「わあ。詩人を連れてきてよかった。」\\n――ウェイタ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c13677cc-d21a-4311-80fe-fd23b62fe6b3\', \'multiverseId\': 638505}, \'multiverseid\': 638505}, {\'name\': \'Vislumbrar o Núcleo\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Procure um card de Floresta básico em seu grimório, coloque aquele card no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\\n• Devolva o card de Caverna alvo do seu cemitério ao campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Uau. Que bom que trouxemos um poeta."\\n— Wayta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5832517-1586-4fea-b390-4c2aa977b13c\', \'multiverseId\': 638826}, \'multiverseid\': 638826}, {\'name\': \'瞥视核心\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•从你牌库中搜寻一张基本的树林牌，将该牌横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\\n•将目标洞窟牌从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「哇。幸好我们带着诗人一起来。」\\n～乌艾塔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84e79e15-4e48-48db-a544-0bbbf5c4b9c8\', \'multiverseId\': 639147}, \'multiverseid\': 639147}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriffslustiger Jährling\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn ein anderer Dinosaurier unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du die Basis-Stärke des Angriffslustigen Jährlings bis zum Ende des Zuges zur Stärke jener Kreatur werden lassen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Eines Tages wird er so furchteinflößend sein, wie er sich vorkommt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637162&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1597aa4b-e20c-4dd4-af43-1ecd551e4208\', \'multiverseId\': 637162}, \'multiverseid\': 637162}, {\'name\': \'Cría beligerante\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que otro Dinosaurio entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes hacer que la fuerza base de la Cría beligerante se convierta en la fuerza de esa criatura hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': \'Un día llegará a ser tan aterrador como cree que es.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fff05b2-038e-4d46-bf89-86aac54a165c\', \'multiverseId\': 637483}, \'multiverseid\': 637483}, {\'name\': \'Progéniture agressive\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre dinosaure arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez faire que la force de base de la Progéniture agressive devienne égale à la force de cette créature jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — dinosaure\', \'flavor\': "Un jour, il sera aussi terrifiant qu\'il pense déjà l\'être.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637804&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2b1b19e-57cf-4ee7-b1a9-197172295598\', \'multiverseId\': 637804}, \'multiverseid\': 637804}, {\'name\': \'Cucciolo Bellicoso\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta un altro Dinosauro entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi far diventare la forza base del Cucciolo Bellicoso pari alla forza di quella creatura fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'Un giorno sarà terrificante quanto pensa di essere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ac29af-9076-4993-851c-51337dad7704\', \'multiverseId\': 638125}, \'multiverseid\': 638125}, {\'name\': \'好戦的な一年仔\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nこれでない恐竜１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、「ターン終了時まで、好戦的な一年仔の基本のパワーは、そのクリーチャーのパワーに等しくなる。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'いずれこの仔も、想像するとおりの恐ろしい存在になるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a89033a-4545-45fe-b874-49ac2d9e2772\', \'multiverseId\': 638446}, \'multiverseid\': 638446}, {\'name\': \'Filhote Beligerante\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que outro Dinossauro entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode fazer com que o poder e a resistência básicos de Filhote Beligerante se tornem iguais ao poder daquela criatura até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinossauro\', \'flavor\': \'Um dia ele será tão aterrorizante quanto já acha que é.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3e2c1c-968b-410c-99ab-2cc874c06365\', \'multiverseId\': 638767}, \'multiverseid\': 638767}, {\'name\': \'好斗幼龙\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当另一个恐龙在你操控下进战场时，你可以使好斗幼龙的基础力量成为等同于该生物的力量直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 恐龙\', \'flavor\': \'总有一天它会像它想象的那样可怕。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64282009-4dcb-4220-a030-0b94287b26ae\', \'multiverseId\': 639088}, \'multiverseid\': 639088}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriffslustiger Jährling\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn ein anderer Dinosaurier unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du die Basis-Stärke des Angriffslustigen Jährlings bis zum Ende des Zuges zur Stärke jener Kreatur werden lassen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639579&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3621eb5b-b1ae-41be-9e61-843ce9ba0a5e\', \'multiverseId\': 639579}, \'multiverseid\': 639579}, {\'name\': \'Cría beligerante\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que otro Dinosaurio entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes hacer que la fuerza base de la Cría beligerante se convierta en la fuerza de esa criatura hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1483b9-3356-4e38-ac8e-7c98670fb1df\', \'multiverseId\': 639592}, \'multiverseid\': 639592}, {\'name\': \'Progéniture agressive\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre dinosaure arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez faire que la force de base de la Progéniture agressive devienne égale à la force de cette créature jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — dinosaure\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639605&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00d37596-ccaf-4c7d-bd19-37bf8f111926\', \'multiverseId\': 639605}, \'multiverseid\': 639605}, {\'name\': \'Cucciolo Bellicoso\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta un altro Dinosauro entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi far diventare la forza base del Cucciolo Bellicoso pari alla forza di quella creatura fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d03841e-5e57-4536-a3d6-729d39d5e579\', \'multiverseId\': 639618}, \'multiverseid\': 639618}, {\'name\': \'好戦的な一年仔\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nこれでない恐竜１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、「ターン終了時まで、好戦的な一年仔の基本のパワーは、そのクリーチャーのパワーに等しくなる。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e334be-bd24-4bcd-b547-7da9f5b1afbd\', \'multiverseId\': 639631}, \'multiverseid\': 639631}, {\'name\': \'Filhote Beligerante\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que outro Dinossauro entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode fazer com que o poder básico de Filhote Beligerante se torne igual ao poder daquela criatura até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinossauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb175f40-8002-4194-8f48-00f40671a3a3\', \'multiverseId\': 639644}, \'multiverseid\': 639644}, {\'name\': \'好斗幼龙\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当另一个恐龙在你操控下进战场时，你可以使好斗幼龙的基础力量成为等同于该生物的力量直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 恐龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d35753a-6ec7-4879-af34-66a1dbe52bc2\', \'multiverseId\': 639657}, \'multiverseid\': 639657}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anim Pakal, der Tausendste Mond\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du mit einer oder mehreren Nicht-Gnom-Kreaturen angreifst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Anim Pakal und erzeuge dann X getappte und angreifende 1/1 farblose Gnom-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken auf Anim Pakal ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn wir diese Welt beschützen möchten, können wir uns nicht einfach weiter in ihren Tiefen verstecken!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637264&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51119d5a-06fd-4938-b38f-690c2b3e031f\', \'multiverseId\': 637264}, \'multiverseid\': 637264}, {\'name\': \'Anim Pakal, la Milésima Luna\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ataques con una o más criaturas que no sean Gnomo, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Anim Pakal, luego crea X fichas de criatura artefacto Gnomo incoloras 1/1 que están giradas y atacando, donde X es la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre Anim Pakal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Si vamos a proteger este mundo, ya no podemos ocultarnos en su interior!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7aa3c58-39f2-4580-baae-75f1ac9f3b7e\', \'multiverseId\': 637585}, \'multiverseid\': 637585}, {\'name\': \'Anim Pakal, la Millième lune\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous attaquez avec au moins une créature non-Gnome, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Anim Pakal, puis créez X jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 Gnome, engagés et attaquants, X étant le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur Anim Pakal.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour protéger ce monde, nous ne pouvons plus nous cacher dans son cœur ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637906&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5ec5ae-837d-4d49-8d5e-c41c2f6b7c46\', \'multiverseId\': 637906}, \'multiverseid\': 637906}, {\'name\': \'Anim Pakal, Millesima Luna\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta attacchi con una o più creature non Gnomo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Anim Pakal, poi crea X pedine creatura artefatto Gnomo 1/1 incolori TAPpate e attaccanti, dove X è il numero di segnalini +1/+1 su Anim Pakal.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se intendiamo proteggere questo mondo, non possiamo più nasconderci al suo interno!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fae2abd5-f3f3-4127-8f8b-4f0865301514\', \'multiverseId\': 638227}, \'multiverseid\': 638227}, {\'name\': \'千番目の月、アニム・パカル\', \'text\': \'あなたがノームでない１体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。その後、無色の１/１のノーム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体をタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。Ｘはこれの上にある＋１/＋１カウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「この世界を守るならば、もはやその中に隠れてはいられないのだ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d114d3c-1249-49d3-b081-f0921292bee1\', \'multiverseId\': 638548}, \'multiverseid\': 638548}, {\'name\': \'Anim Pakal, Milésima Lua\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você atacar com uma ou mais criaturas não Gnomo, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Anim Pakal e depois crie X fichas de criatura artefato Gnomo incolor 1/1 viradas e atacando, sendo X o número de marcadores +1/+1 em Anim Pakal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Se vamos proteger o mundo, não podemos mais nos esconder dentro dele!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9665804-aa4d-482b-a287-9b90008ac36e\', \'multiverseId\': 638869}, \'multiverseid\': 638869}, {\'name\': \'千月统帅阿妮帕卡\', \'text\': \'每当你以一个或数个非地侏生物攻击时，在阿妮帕卡上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后派出X个1/1无色地侏衍生神器生物，其为横置且正进行攻击，X为阿妮帕卡上的+1/+1指示物数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我们若要保护这个世界，就绝不能藏身其后！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89f8bb8f-e7e3-40ae-8019-cd666261fafe\', \'multiverseId\': 639190}, \'multiverseid\': 639190}]', "[{'name': 'Anim Pakal, der Tausendste Mond', 'text': 'Immer wenn du mit einer oder mehreren Nicht-Gnom-Kreaturen angreifst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Anim Pakal und erzeuge dann X getappte und angreifende 1/1 farblose Gnom-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken auf Anim Pakal ist.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636532&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b5c354b-8089-4d23-8f53-ceb46c16c2fb', 'multiverseId': 636532}, 'multiverseid': 636532}, {'name': 'Anim Pakal, la Milésima Luna', 'text': 'Siempre que ataques con una o más criaturas que no sean Gnomo, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Anim Pakal, luego crea X fichas de criatura artefacto Gnomo incoloras 1/1 que están giradas y atacando, donde X es la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre Anim Pakal.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636556&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73a807fb-b4b4-4f43-9354-5c84c50edeaf', 'multiverseId': 636556}, 'multiverseid': 636556}, {'name': 'Anim Pakal, la Millième lune', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous attaquez avec au moins une créature non-Gnome, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Anim Pakal, puis créez X jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 Gnome, engagés et attaquants, X étant le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur Anim Pakal.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire — humain et soldat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636580&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70000e3e-e97e-472f-90b0-3362a123433f', 'multiverseId': 636580}, 'multiverseid': 636580}, {'name': 'Anim Pakal, Millesima Luna', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta attacchi con una o più creature non Gnomo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Anim Pakal, poi crea X pedine creatura artefatto Gnomo 1/1 incolori TAPpate e attaccanti, dove X è il numero di segnalini +1/+1 su Anim Pakal.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636604&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84476708-9da9-4ae8-b990-0bf44bbd0fc5', 'multiverseId': 636604}, 'multiverseid': 636604}, {'name': '千番目の月、アニム・パカル', 'text': 'あなたがノームでない１体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。その後、無色の１/１のノーム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体をタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。Ｘはこれの上にある＋１/＋１カウンターの個数に等しい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636628&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03654d43-f6a0-418a-9eaa-99472176c629', 'multiverseId': 636628}, 'multiverseid': 636628}, {'name': 'Anim Pakal, Milésima Lua', 'text': 'Toda vez que você atacar com uma ou mais criaturas não Gnomo, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Anim Pakal e depois crie X fichas de criatura artefato Gnomo incolor 1/1 viradas e atacando, sendo X o número de marcadores +1/+1 em Anim Pakal.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636652&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7646f427-2454-46c4-80a7-2f1061fa961b', 'multiverseId': 636652}, 'multiverseid': 636652}, {'name': '千月统帅阿妮帕卡', 'text': '每当你以一个或数个非地侏生物攻击时，在阿妮帕卡上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后派出X个1/1无色地侏衍生神器生物，其为横置且正进行攻击，X为阿妮帕卡上的+1/+1指示物数量。', 'type': '传奇生物 — 人类／士兵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636676&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ccafda6-d4a3-4d7e-a09a-a37a5bedc701', 'multiverseId': 636676}, 'multiverseid': 636676}]", '[{\'name\': \'Antlitz des Grauens // Osseosaurus des Grauens\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nImmer wenn der Osseosaurus des Grauens ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, kannst du zwei Karten millen. (Du kannst die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier, Skelett, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Osseosaurus des Grauens\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637157&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52af6026-9e8a-4526-9a64-d21752a8dbbe\', \'multiverseId\': 637157}, \'multiverseid\': 637157}, {\'name\': \'Rostro del pavor // Oseosaurio pavoroso\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nSiempre que el Oseosaurio pavoroso entre al campo de batalla o ataque, puedes moler dos cartas. (Puedes poner las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror esqueleto dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Oseosaurio pavoroso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be8bdb7b-8e0f-4db5-b2c9-487bbb806da6\', \'multiverseId\': 637478}, \'multiverseid\': 637478}, {\'name\': "Visage d\'effroi // Osséosaure d\'effroi", \'text\': "Menace\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Osséosaure d\'effroi arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, vous pouvez meuler deux cartes. (Vous pouvez mettre les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature — dinosaure et squelette et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': "Osséosaure d\'effroi", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ef4e910-5a38-4192-941a-b63a1658503d\', \'multiverseId\': 637799}, \'multiverseid\': 637799}, {\'name\': \'Volto di Terrore // Osseosauro Terrificante\', \'text\': "Minacciare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Osseosauro Terrificante entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, puoi macinare due carte. (Puoi mettere nel tuo cimitero le prime due carte del tuo grimorio.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Scheletro Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Osseosauro Terrificante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8aa87a8-6508-4d48-a13a-75be5f27b6d1\', \'multiverseId\': 638120}, \'multiverseid\': 638120}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の容貌 // 戦慄のオセオザウルス\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n戦慄のオセオザウルスが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、カード２枚を切削してもよい。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚をあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜・スケルトン・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'戦慄のオセオザウルス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dab86eea-9882-45bf-b58f-7d765bc2c1d1\', \'multiverseId\': 638441}, \'multiverseid\': 638441}, {\'name\': \'Face do Pavor // Osseossauro do Pavor\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nToda vez que Osseossauro do Pavor entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, você pode triturar dois cards. (Você pode colocar os dois cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinossauro Esqueleto Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Osseossauro do Pavor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1076c30-5900-4723-bca4-41e0042dfa79\', \'multiverseId\': 638762}, \'multiverseid\': 638762}, {\'name\': \'可怖龙颅骨 // 可怖骸骨龙\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n每当可怖骸骨龙进战场或攻击时，你可以磨两张牌。（你可以将你牌库顶的两张牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 恐龙／骷髅妖／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'可怖骸骨龙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df130235-6d17-4850-806a-a504eab6390a\', \'multiverseId\': 639083}, \'multiverseid\': 639083}]', '[{\'name\': \'Antlitz des Grauens // Osseosaurus des Grauens\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Antlitz des Grauens ins Spiel kommt, zeigt ein Gegner deiner Wahl seine Hand offen vor. Du bestimmst davon eine Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte. Der Spieler wirft die bestimmte Karte ab.\\nAnfertigung mit zwei Kreaturen {5}{B} ({5}{B}, schicke dieses Artefakt ins Exil, schicke die zwei weiteren Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, und/oder Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Bringe diese Karte transformiert unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück. Spiele Anfertigung wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist nicht meine Schuld! Die Glyphen für ‚gesegnet\\\' und ‚verflucht\\\' sehen einander nun einmal sehr ähnlich!"\\n—Diego, Übersetzer der Tollkühnen Koalition\', \'faceName\': \'Antlitz des Grauens\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637157&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52af6026-9e8a-4526-9a64-d21752a8dbbe\', \'multiverseId\': 637157}, \'multiverseid\': 637157}, {\'name\': \'Rostro del pavor // Oseosaurio pavoroso\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Rostro del pavor entre al campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo muestra su mano. Tú eliges de ahí una carta de artefacto o de criatura. Ese jugador descarta esa carta.\\nElaborar con dos criaturas {5}{B}. ({5}{B}, exiliar este artefacto, exiliar las dos criaturas de entre las criaturas que controlas y/o cartas de tu cementerio: Regresa esta carta transformada bajo el control de su propietario. Activa la habilidad de elaborar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¡No es mi culpa! ¡Los glifos de \\\'bendito\\\' y \\\'maldito\\\' son muy parecidos!".\\n—Diego, traductor de la Coalición Azófar\', \'faceName\': \'Rostro del pavor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be8bdb7b-8e0f-4db5-b2c9-487bbb806da6\', \'multiverseId\': 637478}, \'multiverseid\': 637478}, {\'name\': "Visage d\'effroi // Osséosaure d\'effroi", \'text\': "Quand le Visage d\'effroi arrive sur le champ de bataille, un adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Vous y choisissez une carte d\'artefact ou de créature. Ce joueur se défausse de cette carte.\\nFaçonnez avec deux créatures {5}{B} ({5}{B}, exilez cet artefact, exilez les deux parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez et/ou les cartes de créature de votre cimetière : Renvoyez cette carte transformée sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Ne façonnez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce n\\\'est pas ma faute ! Les glyphes signifiant "béni" et "maudit" sont très similaires ! »\\n—Diego, traducteur de la Coalition des hardis\', \'faceName\': "Visage d\'effroi", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ef4e910-5a38-4192-941a-b63a1658503d\', \'multiverseId\': 637799}, \'multiverseid\': 637799}, {\'name\': \'Volto di Terrore // Osseosauro Terrificante\', \'text\': \'Quando il Volto di Terrore entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio rivela la sua mano. Scegli una carta artefatto o creatura da quella mano. Quel giocatore scarta quella carta.\\nCostruisci con due creature {5}{B} ({5}{B}, Esilia questo artefatto, Esilia i due oggetti scelti tra le creature che controlli e/o le carte nel tuo cimitero: Rimetti questa carta trasformata sotto il controllo del suo proprietario. Costruisci solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Non è colpa mia! I glifi per "benedetto" e "maledetto" sono molto simili!"\\n— Diego, traduttore dell\\\'Alleanza di Bronzo\', \'faceName\': \'Volto di Terrore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8aa87a8-6508-4d48-a13a-75be5f27b6d1\', \'multiverseId\': 638120}, \'multiverseid\': 638120}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の容貌 // 戦慄のオセオザウルス\', \'text\': \'戦慄の容貌が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中からアーティファクトやクリーチャーであるカード１枚を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーはそのカードを捨てる。\\nクリーチャー２つで作製 {5}{B} （{5}{B}, このアーティファクトを追放する, あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーやあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードである２つを追放する：このカードをオーナーのコントロール下で変身させた状態で出す。作製はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「俺のせいじゃない！祝福と呪いの象形の見分けがつきにくいんだ！」\\n――鉄面連合の翻訳家、ディエゴ\', \'faceName\': \'戦慄の容貌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dab86eea-9882-45bf-b58f-7d765bc2c1d1\', \'multiverseId\': 638441}, \'multiverseid\': 638441}, {\'name\': \'Face do Pavor // Osseossauro do Pavor\', \'text\': \'Quando Face do Pavor entra no campo de batalha, o oponente alvo revela a própria mão. Você escolhe um card de artefato ou criatura dela. Aquele jogador descarta aquele card.\\nConstruir com duas criaturas {5}{B} ({5}{B}, exile este artefato, exile duas criaturas que você controla e/ou cards de criatura em seu cemitério: Devolva este card ao campo de batalha transformado sob o controle de seu dono. Construa somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Não é minha culpa! Os glifos de \\\'abençoado\\\' e \\\'amaldiçoado\\\' são muito parecidos!"\\n— Diego, tradutor da Coalizão Brônzea\', \'faceName\': \'Face do Pavor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1076c30-5900-4723-bca4-41e0042dfa79\', \'multiverseId\': 638762}, \'multiverseid\': 638762}, {\'name\': \'可怖龙颅骨 // 可怖骸骨龙\', \'text\': \'当可怖龙颅骨进战场时，目标对手展示其手牌。你选择其中一张神器或生物牌。该牌手弃掉该牌。\\n以两个生物化炼{5}{B}（{5}{B}，放逐此神器，从由你操控的生物和／或你坟墓场中的生物牌中放逐前述物件达两个：将此牌在其拥有者的操控下移回且已转化。只能于法术时机化炼。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「这不是我的错！表示『祝福』和『诅咒』的雕符长得就差不多！」\\n～莽霸联盟翻译迭戈\', \'faceName\': \'可怖龙颅骨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df130235-6d17-4850-806a-a504eab6390a\', \'multiverseId\': 639083}, \'multiverseid\': 639083}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf Gold stoßen\', \'text\': \'Entdeckung 10. Falls der Manabetrag der entdeckten Karte weniger als 10 ist, erzeuge so viele getappte Schatz-Spielsteine, wie die Differenz beträgt. (Um Entdeckung 10 anzuwenden, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte mit Manabetrag 10 oder weniger ins Exil schickst. Wirke sie, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen, oder nimm sie auf deine Hand. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter die Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637185&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6435995a-edd5-4b90-9cbd-da591497c20a\', \'multiverseId\': 637185}, \'multiverseid\': 637185}, {\'name\': \'Conseguir el premio gordo\', \'text\': \'Descubre 10. Si el valor de maná de la carta descubierta es menor que 10, crea una cantidad de fichas de Tesoro giradas igual a la diferencia. (Para descubrir 10, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra con valor de maná de 10 o menos. Lánzala sin pagar su coste de maná o ponla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28db2e2c-43e7-4908-b5ce-d2ad3a51463b\', \'multiverseId\': 637506}, \'multiverseid\': 637506}, {\'name\': \'Trouver le filon\', \'text\': "Découvrez 10. Si la valeur de mana de la carte découverte est inférieure à 10, créez un nombre de jetons Trésor engagés égal à la différence. (Pour découvrir 10, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 10. Lancez-la sans payer son coût de mana ou mettez-la dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637827&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a32de123-da97-4046-86b1-da5afd642a99\', \'multiverseId\': 637827}, \'multiverseid\': 637827}, {\'name\': "Trovare una Miniera d\'Oro", \'text\': \'Scopri 10. Se il valore di mana della carta scoperta è inferiore a 10, crea un numero di pedine Tesoro TAPpate pari alla differenza. (Per scoprire 10, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 10. Lanciala senza pagare il suo costo di mana o aggiungila alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13a20e54-ed07-4a45-b2c3-f3f04ca54bbe\', \'multiverseId\': 638148}, \'multiverseid\': 638148}, {\'name\': \'金脈発見\', \'text\': \'発見10を行う。発見したカードのマナ総量が10よりも小さいなら、その差に等しい数の宝物・トークンをタップ状態で生成する。（発見10を行うとは、「マナ総量が10以下であり土地でないカード１枚が公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。それをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えるか、あなたの手札に加える。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。」ということである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ea0399b-b79a-432b-9ca4-c3a3440f2459\', \'multiverseId\': 638469}, \'multiverseid\': 638469}, {\'name\': \'Achar a Mina de Ouro\', \'text\': \'Descubra 10. Se o valor de mana do card descoberto for inferior a 10, crie um número de fichas de Tesouro viradas igual à diferença. (Para descobrir 10, exile cards do topo do seu grimório até exilar um card não de terreno com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 10. Conjure sem pagar o custo de mana ou coloque-o na sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo do grimório em ordem aleatória.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06234ac2-16a7-4f19-aebc-555cdc2aef3c\', \'multiverseId\': 638790}, \'multiverseid\': 638790}, {\'name\': \'寻得母脉\', \'text\': \'倾探10。如果所倾探之牌的法术力值小于10，则派出等同于该差距数量之已横置的珍宝衍生物。（倾探10的流程是从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张法术力值等于或小于10的非地牌为止。施放之且不需支付其法术力费用，或将之置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba02b777-844a-404c-8a14-90d0a3659cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 639111}, \'multiverseid\': 639111}]', "[{'name': 'Auf Gold stoßen', 'text': 'Entdeckung 10. Falls der Manabetrag der entdeckten Karte weniger als 10 ist, erzeuge so viele getappte Schatz-Spielsteine, wie die Differenz beträgt.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639428&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1c84edb-b5f5-4f8e-8956-de7e657765ac', 'multiverseId': 639428}, 'multiverseid': 639428}, {'name': 'Trouver le filon', 'text': 'Découvrez 10. Si la valeur de mana de la carte découverte est inférieure à 10, créez un nombre de jetons Trésor engagés égal à la différence.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639429&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '255101f9-d1af-4186-853c-8047a042d1b1', 'multiverseId': 639429}, 'multiverseid': 639429}]", "[{'name': 'Auf Gold stoßen', 'text': 'Entdeckung 10. Falls der Manabetrag der entdeckten Karte weniger als 10 ist, erzeuge so viele getappte Schatz-Spielsteine, wie die Differenz beträgt.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639831&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca187d3b-c611-4ad4-b9da-b259be4ee18f', 'multiverseId': 639831}, 'multiverseid': 639831}, {'name': 'Trouver le filon', 'text': 'Découvrez 10. Si la valeur de mana de la carte découverte est inférieure à 10, créez un nombre de jetons Trésor engagés égal à la différence.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639882&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf6c09bb-b6f3-4d0b-a0a5-73b0e2d1f660', 'multiverseId': 639882}, 'multiverseid': 639882}, {'name': '金脈発見', 'text': '発見10を行う。発見したカードのマナ総量が10よりも小さいなら、その差に等しい数の宝物・トークンをタップ状態で生成する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639933&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd85113aa-1f99-4129-8a5e-3bdb5dd54a17', 'multiverseId': 639933}, 'multiverseid': 639933}, {'name': '寻得母脉', 'text': '倾探10。如果所倾探之牌的法术力值小于10，则派出等同于该差距数量之已横置的珍宝衍生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639984&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '611b7d1b-035c-4c3d-b0a4-d40804ffc711', 'multiverseId': 639984}, 'multiverseid': 639984}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aufgeschreckter Altisaurus\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\n{T}: Der Aufgeschreckte Altisaurus fügt jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Erste Expeditionen des Imperiums der Sonne mussten auf die harte Tour lernen, dass manche Dinosaurier der Oberfläche besonders schlecht für die beengten Umgebungen der Höhlen geeignet waren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637193&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73f9c210-97a9-4bb3-b7f6-df03242a2c10\', \'multiverseId\': 637193}, \'multiverseid\': 637193}, {\'name\': \'Altisaurio aterrado\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\n{T}: El Altisaurio aterrado hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': \'Durante sus primeras expediciones, el Imperio del Sol descubrió por las malas que algunos dinosaurios de la superficie no estaban hechos para los ambientes cerrados de las cavernas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf120a2d-eecc-4da8-94a0-ad2737f0d239\', \'multiverseId\': 637514}, \'multiverseid\': 637514}, {\'name\': \'Altisaure paniqué\', \'text\': "Portée\\n{T} : L\'Altisaure paniqué inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature — dinosaure\', \'flavor\': "Les premières expéditions de l\'Empire du Soleil apprirent à leurs dépens que certains dinosaures de la surface étaient particulièrement mal adaptés aux environnements fermés des cavernes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637835&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0afbb8f5-d6ba-4548-9dde-94ee76fceec2\', \'multiverseId\': 637835}, \'multiverseid\': 637835}, {\'name\': \'Altisauro in Preda al Panico\', \'text\': "Raggiungere\\n{T}: L\'Altisauro in Preda al Panico infligge 2 danni a ogni avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': "Le prime spedizioni dell\'Impero del Sole impararono a proprie spese che alcuni dinosauri di superficie erano decisamente inadatti agli ambienti angusti delle caverne.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74785627-587b-4caf-b46c-641c6f80516e\', \'multiverseId\': 638156}, \'multiverseid\': 638156}, {\'name\': \'動揺するアルティサウルス\', \'text\': \'到達\\n{T}：動揺するアルティサウルスは各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'太陽帝国による初期遠征において、地上に住む一部の恐竜は洞窟のような取り囲まれた環境に適さないことを身をもって知ることとなった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b001f5d-f5f7-49fc-a503-54c930d9e3ac\', \'multiverseId\': 638477}, \'multiverseid\': 638477}, {\'name\': \'Altissauro em Pânico\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\n{T}: Altissauro em Pânico causa 2 pontos de dano a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinossauro\', \'flavor\': \'As primeiras expedições do Império do Sol aprenderam do pior jeito que alguns dinossauros da superfície se não se prestavam muito aos ambientes fechados das cavernas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86311d19-150e-4c63-ad97-ad39ebd58b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 638798}, \'multiverseid\': 638798}, {\'name\': \'惊慌硕伟龙\', \'text\': \'延势\\n{T}：惊慌硕伟龙向每位对手各造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 恐龙\', \'flavor\': \'最初一批深入地底的烈阳帝国探险队在付出惨痛教训后，才知道有些地表恐龙并不适应洞窟这样的幽闭环境。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1d7e693-793b-4c44-9fe8-0b0ce39347d1\', \'multiverseId\': 639119}, \'multiverseid\': 639119}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufscheuern\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Aufscheuern fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Was soll das heißen — eine Uhr mit Beinen hat alle unsere Kanonen zerstört?!"\\n—Kapitänin Lannery Storm\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637160&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeaa6410-b269-4b4e-8143-3993cc63774e\', \'multiverseId\': 637160}, \'multiverseid\': 637160}, {\'name\': \'Erosionar\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Erosionar hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡¿Qué significa que un reloj andante destruyó todos nuestros cañones?!".\\n—Capitana Lannery Tempestad\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35760ec5-0c0d-45d7-a60b-d0e2d0377a40\', \'multiverseId\': 637481}, \'multiverseid\': 637481}, {\'name\': \'Fissuration\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• La Fissuration inflige 3 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Comment ça, une horloge marchante a détruit tous nos canons ?! »\\n—Capitaine Lanneray Tempeste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19d58995-1c5a-4d5f-9f27-3053bddcba6d\', \'multiverseId\': 637802}, \'multiverseid\': 637802}, {\'name\': \'Abrasione\', \'text\': "Scegli uno —\\n• L\'Abrasione infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Stai dicendo che un orologio con le gambe ha distrutto tutti i nostri cannoni?!"\\n—Capitana Lannery Fendiburrasca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f035deb5-6fd0-49d4-b027-398848326310\', \'multiverseId\': 638123}, \'multiverseid\': 638123}, {\'name\': \'削剥\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。削剥はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n・アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「歩く時計が大砲を全て破壊しただって！？ どうなってんだい！？」\\n――風雲船長ラネリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de922fe5-11dc-4a68-a954-1aae2c85efb1\', \'multiverseId\': 638444}, \'multiverseid\': 638444}, {\'name\': \'Abrasão\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Abrasão causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Como assim um relógio ambulante destruiu todos os nossos canhões?"\\n— Capitã Lannery Tormenta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28b937c2-f26b-4bd2-abe7-11be2d21f025\', \'multiverseId\': 638765}, \'multiverseid\': 638765}, {\'name\': \'风化侵蚀\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•风化侵蚀对目标生物造成3点伤害。\\n•消灭目标神器。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你说一个会走路的钟把我们的大炮全毁了是什么意思？！」\\n～兰娜莉速腾船长\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'728d60cb-4c1f-406f-8dee-11e44f6972df\', \'multiverseId\': 639086}, \'multiverseid\': 639086}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgehungertes Gespenst\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Ausgehungerte Gespenst ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 2 an. Dann ziehst du für jede Karte, die du oben auf deine Bibliothek legst, eine Karte und verlierst 3 Lebenspunkte.\\nAbstieg 8 — Immer wenn du eine Karte ziehst und falls dein Friedhof acht oder mehr Permanent-Karten enthält, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637149&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07e8becc-2311-4d00-9922-0fafc6e0363f\', \'multiverseId\': 637149}, \'multiverseid\': 637149}, {\'name\': \'Aparecido famélico\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Aparecido famélico entre al campo de batalla, escruta 2. Luego, por cada carta que pongas en la parte superior de tu biblioteca, robas una carta y pierdes 3 vidas.\\nDescender 8 — Siempre que robes una carta, si hay ocho o más cartas de permanente en tu cementerio, el oponente objetivo pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38b061a9-43a9-4b97-a88f-4f471572d0f9\', \'multiverseId\': 637470}, \'multiverseid\': 637470}, {\'name\': \'Revenant affamé\', \'text\': "Quand le Revenant affamé arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 2. Puis, pour chaque carte que vous mettez au-dessus de votre bibliothèque, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 3 points de vie.\\nDescente 8 — À chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, s\'il y a au moins huit cartes de permanent dans votre cimetière, un adversaire ciblé perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — esprit et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637791&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e06facf-3b47-48cd-baa6-7ae34c23387b\', \'multiverseId\': 637791}, \'multiverseid\': 637791}, {\'name\': \'Redivivo Affamato\', \'text\': \'Quando il Redivivo Affamato entra nel campo di battaglia, sorveglia 2. Poi per ogni carta che hai messo in cima al tuo grimorio, peschi una carta e perdi 3 punti vita.\\nDiscesa 8 — Ogniqualvolta peschi una carta, se ci sono otto o più carte permanente nel tuo cimitero, un avversario bersaglio perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41edb7bb-fd10-46ed-be5e-08c9dbc74e3e\', \'multiverseId\': 638112}, \'multiverseid\': 638112}, {\'name\': \'飢えた亡霊\', \'text\': \'飢えた亡霊が戦場に出たとき、諜報２を行う。その後、あなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いた各カードにつきそれぞれ、カード１枚を引き３点のライフを失う。\\n落魄８ ― あなたがカード１枚を引くたび、あなたの墓地に８枚以上のパーマネント・カードがある場合、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'821bc622-48c2-45d6-a018-3ac51919cc6c\', \'multiverseId\': 638433}, \'multiverseid\': 638433}, {\'name\': \'Ressurgido Famélico\', \'text\': \'Quando Ressurgido Famélico entrar no campo de batalha, use vigiar 2. Depois, para cada card que você coloca no topo de seu grimório, você compra um card e perde 3 pontos de vida.\\nDescer 8 — Toda vez que você compra um card, se houver oito ou mais cards de permanente em seu cemitério, o oponente alvo perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59353368-4234-4cd2-92de-15f65ed84b07\', \'multiverseId\': 638754}, \'multiverseid\': 638754}, {\'name\': \'饥饿复灵\', \'text\': \'当饥饿复灵进战场时，刺探2。然后你每将一张牌置于你的牌库顶，便抓一张牌且失去3点生命。\\n落坟8～每当你抓一张牌时，若你坟墓场中有八张或更多永久物牌，则目标对手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 精怪／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55b85eb9-daeb-4ad1-ad70-6da325796d73\', \'multiverseId\': 639075}, \'multiverseid\': 639075}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgehungertes Gespenst\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Ausgehungerte Gespenst ins Spiel kommt, wende Überwachen 2 an. Dann ziehst du für jede Karte, die du oben auf deine Bibliothek legst, eine Karte und verlierst 3 Lebenspunkte.\\nAbstieg 8 — Immer wenn du eine Karte ziehst und falls dein Friedhof acht oder mehr Permanent-Karten enthält, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639284&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'026d29f7-36db-4490-9225-892b0d5b27c5\', \'multiverseId\': 639284}, \'multiverseid\': 639284}, {\'name\': \'Aparecido famélico\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Aparecido famélico entre al campo de batalla, escruta 2. Luego, por cada carta que pongas en la parte superior de tu biblioteca, robas una carta y pierdes 3 vidas.\\nDescender 8 — Siempre que robes una carta, si hay ocho o más cartas de permanente en tu cementerio, el oponente objetivo pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec249bdd-7665-4c88-afd7-2d3a5c155d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 639304}, \'multiverseid\': 639304}, {\'name\': \'Revenant affamé\', \'text\': "Quand le Revenant affamé arrive sur le champ de bataille, surveillez 2. Puis, pour chaque carte que vous mettez au-dessus de votre bibliothèque, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 3 points de vie.\\nDescente 8 — À chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, s\'il y a au moins huit cartes de permanent dans votre cimetière, un adversaire ciblé perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — esprit et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639324&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ccfa0a-8f95-4411-9769-3e113e2c8314\', \'multiverseId\': 639324}, \'multiverseid\': 639324}, {\'name\': \'Redivivo Affamato\', \'text\': \'Quando il Redivivo Affamato entra nel campo di battaglia, sorveglia 2. Poi per ogni carta che hai messo in cima al tuo grimorio, peschi una carta e perdi 3 punti vita.\\nDiscesa 8 — Ogniqualvolta peschi una carta, se ci sono otto o più carte permanente nel tuo cimitero, un avversario bersaglio perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d8a1070-e016-4e2f-8af7-e4ea3a938704\', \'multiverseId\': 639344}, \'multiverseid\': 639344}, {\'name\': \'飢えた亡霊\', \'text\': \'飢えた亡霊が戦場に出たとき、諜報２を行う。その後、あなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いた各カードにつきそれぞれ、カード１枚を引き３点のライフを失う。\\n落魄８ ― あなたがカード１枚を引くたび、あなたの墓地に８枚以上のパーマネント・カードがある場合、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a86c95-e833-4ab2-8031-89a9c8a0dbc4\', \'multiverseId\': 639364}, \'multiverseid\': 639364}, {\'name\': \'Ressurgido Famélico\', \'text\': \'Quando Ressurgido Famélico entrar no campo de batalha, use vigiar 2. Depois, para cada card que você coloca no topo de seu grimório, você compra um card e perde 3 pontos de vida.\\nDescer 8 — Toda vez que você compra um card, se houver oito ou mais cards de permanente em seu cemitério, o oponente alvo perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a5e9b22-919d-4c1d-ab85-4c1a71c3c51b\', \'multiverseId\': 639384}, \'multiverseid\': 639384}, {\'name\': \'饥饿复灵\', \'text\': \'当饥饿复灵进战场时，刺探2。然后你每将一张牌置于你的牌库顶，便抓一张牌且失去3点生命。\\n落坟8～每当你抓一张牌时，若你坟墓场中有八张或更多永久物牌，则目标对手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 精怪／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da3d614e-c76a-46d3-bdb9-d6dc2a458133\', \'multiverseId\': 639404}, \'multiverseid\': 639404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Außer Atem\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger, falls er einen Kreaturenzauber als Ziel hat.\\nNeutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Weltenkern ist mehr als nur eine Schatzkammer, die Eindringlingen von der Oberfläche zum Plündern offensteht. Ich werde jene in ihre Schranken weisen, die ihm keinen Respekt zollen."\\n—Akal Pakal, Erste Vögtin von Oteclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'623b071f-6276-4958-9884-00e759d00974\', \'multiverseId\': 637092}, \'multiverseid\': 637092}, {\'name\': \'Sin aire\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar este hechizo si hace objetivo a un hechizo de criatura.\\nContrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El núcleo no es un vulgar tesoro que los intrusos de la superficie puedan saquear. Rechazará a aquellos que no le muestren respeto".\\n—Akal Pakal, primera regidora de Oteclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11bae03d-46ce-4d4d-8074-5808dea31132\', \'multiverseId\': 637413}, \'multiverseid\': 637413}, {\'name\': "À court d\'air", \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer s\'il cible un sort de créature.\\nContrecarrez un sort ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Le Noyau n\'est pas un simple trésor qui attend d\'être pillé par des intrus venus de la surface. Il rejettera quiconque ne lui accorde pas de respect. »\\n—Akal Pakal, première intendante d\'Oteclan", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637734&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5da4d3e-d8f9-412f-a15d-53654fd50afc\', \'multiverseId\': 637734}, \'multiverseid\': 637734}, {\'name\': "A Corto d\'Aria", \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata se bersaglia una magia creatura.\\nNeutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il Nucleo non è un tesoro che gli intrusi dalla superficie possono semplicemente saccheggiare. Rifiuterà quanti non gli prestano il dovuto rispetto."\\n— Akal Pakal, Prima Attendente di Oteclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bd72bd8-6e9d-4fdb-b4a3-91c8fe0e2bd4\', \'multiverseId\': 638055}, \'multiverseid\': 638055}, {\'name\': \'酸欠\', \'text\': \'この呪文がクリーチャー・呪文を対象とするなら、これを唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\n呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「中心核は地上の侵入者が容易く略奪できるほど、生ぬるい場所ではない。敬意を払わぬものは、拒絶される。」\\n――オテクランの第一執政、アカル・パカル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad8a900b-e756-4580-af95-9cc5cda9c798\', \'multiverseId\': 638376}, \'multiverseid\': 638376}, {\'name\': \'Sem Ar\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {2} a menos para ser conjurada se tiver como alvo uma mágica de criatura.\\nAnule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O Núcleo não é um simples repositório para ser saqueado por intrusos da superfície. Ele rejeitará todos que não lhe deem o devido respeito."\\n— Akal Pakal, Primeira Regente de Oteclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21eae4d1-d3e0-475d-bfe5-b1320964f89a\', \'multiverseId\': 638697}, \'multiverseid\': 638697}, {\'name\': \'气息不足\', \'text\': \'如果此咒语以生物咒语为目标，则它减少{2}来施放。\\n反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「世界核心并非是放任地上入侵者劫掠的普通宝库。任何未示敬意者都会被拒之门外。」\\n～欧特克兰首席宰相阿卡帕卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b72d57ea-4dd1-400e-83d7-44f666cba001\', \'multiverseId\': 639018}, \'multiverseid\': 639018}]', '[{\'name\': \'Badendes Wasserschwein\', \'text\': \'Abstieg 4 — Das Badende Wasserschwein erhält +3/+0, solange dein Friedhof vier oder mehr Permanent-Karten enthält.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wasserschwein\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst unsere gelehrtesten Philosophen können lediglich hoffen, dass sie eines Tages die innere Ruhe des bescheidenen Wasserschweins erlangen."\\n—Nelli, Oltec-Didaktikerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637210&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a80e22-747e-4e09-bbc3-416d4bd036c7\', \'multiverseId\': 637210}, \'multiverseid\': 637210}, {\'name\': \'Capibara apacible\', \'text\': \'Descender 4 — El Capibara apacible obtiene +3/+0 mientras haya cuatro o más cartas de permanente en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Capibara\', \'flavor\': \'"Incluso nuestros filósofos más eruditos no pueden más que desear alcanzar la serenidad interna del humilde capibara".\\n—Nelli, docente oltec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32591065-ca18-4c8a-83d2-20568190aedf\', \'multiverseId\': 637531}, \'multiverseid\': 637531}, {\'name\': \'Capybara indolent\', \'text\': "Descente 4 — Le Capybara indolent gagne +3/+0 tant qu\'il y a au moins quatre cartes de permanent dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature — capybara\', \'flavor\': "« Même nos philosophes les plus accomplis ne peuvent qu\'espérer approcher un jour de la sérénité intérieure du simple capybara. »\\n—Nelli, didacte oltèque", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7f5ddcd-0828-4e21-afe9-8b7d2b2babd5\', \'multiverseId\': 637852}, \'multiverseid\': 637852}, {\'name\': \'Capibara Crogiolante\', \'text\': \'Discesa 4 — Il Capibara Crogiolante prende +3/+0 fintanto che ci sono quattro o più carte permanente nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Capibara\', \'flavor\': \'"Neanche i nostri filosofi più colti possono eguagliare la serenità interiore dell\\\'umile capibara."\\n—Nelli, didatta Oltec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2b83e6b-6844-4d69-bcaa-9f4e74ed8c92\', \'multiverseId\': 638173}, \'multiverseid\': 638173}, {\'name\': \'日を浴びるカピバラ\', \'text\': \'落魄４ ― あなたの墓地に４枚以上のパーマネント・カードがあるかぎり、日を浴びるカピバラは＋３/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — カピバラ\', \'flavor\': \'「最も賢き哲学者ですら、カピバラの内なる平穏に到達することはできないだろう。」\\n――オルテカの説教者、ネーリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e449b6e-39cc-4a29-9dce-637e8e8f23cb\', \'multiverseId\': 638494}, \'multiverseid\': 638494}, {\'name\': \'Capivara Relaxando\', \'text\': \'Descer 4 — Capivara Relaxando recebe +3/+0 enquanto houver quatro ou mais cards de permanente em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Capivara\', \'flavor\': \'"Mesmo nossos filósofos mais instruídos só podem esperar um dia chegar perto da serenidade interior da humilde capivara."\\n— Nelli, didata olteca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifie