'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'066a0a3e-c496-404a-94ca-7b94726ce65a\', \'multiverseId\': 637704}, \'multiverseid\': 637704}, {\'name\': \'Reminiscenza Ancestrale\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La tipica conversazione con un Eco è tre parti saggezza e una parte pettegolezzo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef663f59-e709-4494-a7a0-e012c8ddb333\', \'multiverseId\': 638025}, \'multiverseid\': 638025}, {\'name\': \'祖先の追憶\', \'text\': \'カード３枚を引く。その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'知恵の話題がほとんどを占め、噂話も少々混じるのが、残響との会話ではお決まりである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceb4a8a4-c373-4e93-9a71-b65ada643d53\', \'multiverseId\': 638346}, \'multiverseid\': 638346}, {\'name\': \'Reminiscência Ancestral\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Uma conversa típica com Ecos é três partes sabedoria e uma parte fofoca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8c24256-3b38-4a2a-bbba-6c6a3b2b9d3a\', \'multiverseId\': 638667}, \'multiverseid\': 638667}, {\'name\': \'追忆先祖\', \'text\': \'抓三张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'当与念世灵对话时，往往是七分求知智慧，三分闲话家常。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24f0eb3e-ac7a-4cc1-a4a0-740f8ce6eeb7\', \'multiverseId\': 638988}, \'multiverseid\': 638988}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bitterer Triumph\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab oder bezahle 3 Lebenspunkte.\\nZerstöre eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Obgleich er wegen Intis Tod schluchzte, blieb Caparoctis Auge scharf und sein Speer durchbohrte sauber Clavileños schwarzes Herz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637116&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3dc023a-5bce-48d9-b1e0-90fa1b76971e\', \'multiverseId\': 637116}, \'multiverseid\': 637116}, {\'name\': \'Triunfo amargo\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta o paga 3 vidas.\\nDestruye la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'A pesar de sus lágrimas por la muerte de Inti, Caparocti mantuvo la mirada atenta y atravesó el corazón corrompido de Clavileño con su lanza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23e7c4df-11cf-4877-a773-2096ba37eabe\', \'multiverseId\': 637437}, \'multiverseid\': 637437}, {\'name\': \'Triomphe amer\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte ou payez 3 points de vie.\\nDétruisez une cible, créature ou planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Bien qu\'il pleurât la mort d\'Inti, les yeux de Caparocti criaient vengeance, et sa lance traversa le cœur corrompu de Clavileño.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637758&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'629f2239-54ec-4e58-ae38-95ba576bd1cb\', \'multiverseId\': 637758}, \'multiverseid\': 637758}, {\'name\': \'Trionfo Amaro\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, scarta una carta o paga 3 punti vita.\\nDistruggi una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Nonostante le lacrime per la morte di Inti, gli occhi di Caparocti erano attenti e la sua lancia trafisse senza problemi il cuore corrotto di Clavileño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2865df9a-f766-47c8-873d-b67651ec0194\', \'multiverseId\': 638079}, \'multiverseid\': 638079}, {\'name\': \'苦々しい勝利\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てるか３点のライフを支払う。\\nクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーである１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'インティの死に涙する一方、カパロクティの眼は鋭く光り、その槍はクラヴィレーニョの悪しき心臓を貫いていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8b91f5-e944-407d-b399-7d3bf14a2ac6\', \'multiverseId\': 638400}, \'multiverseid\': 638400}, {\'name\': \'Amargo Triunfo\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, descarte um card ou pague 3 pontos de vida.\\nDestrua a criatura ou o planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Embora chorasse com a morte de Inti, os olhos de Caparocti estavam atentos, e sua lança trespassou certeira o coração maculado de Clavileño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f336c5f-8c91-4090-a16d-73e01e69c3a1\', \'multiverseId\': 638721}, \'multiverseid\': 638721}, {\'name\': \'惨痛胜利\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌或支付3点生命，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n消灭目标生物或鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'虽然卡帕罗提内心仍由于因缇战殁而悲伤不已，但是其仍眼疾手快抓住机会，一枪刺穿了克莱维诺那颗堕落之心。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d05c4bbe-5b7e-4ef0-b455-2ef223cd1609\', \'multiverseId\': 639042}, \'multiverseid\': 639042}]', "[{'name': 'Bloodletter of Aclazotz', 'text': 'Flying\\nIf an opponent would lose life during your turn, they lose twice that much life instead. (Damage causes loss of life.)', 'type': 'Creature — Vampire Demon', 'flavor': 'Its very presence rips old wounds open to bleed anew.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637117&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27c65617-b85c-4a99-aecc-181ef63a59d5', 'multiverseId': 637117}, 'multiverseid': 637117}, {'name': 'Bloodletter of Aclazotz', 'text': 'Flying\\nIf an opponent would lose life during your turn, they lose twice that much life instead. (Damage causes loss of life.)', 'type': 'Creature — Vampire Demon', 'flavor': 'Its very presence rips old wounds open to bleed anew.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637438&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11db8561-786b-4674-9d52-a9faa7952efc', 'multiverseId': 637438}, 'multiverseid': 637438}, {'name': 'Bloodletter of Aclazotz', 'text': 'Flying\\nIf an opponent would lose life during your turn, they lose twice that much life instead. (Damage causes loss of life.)', 'type': 'Creature — Vampire Demon', 'flavor': 'Its very presence rips old wounds open to bleed anew.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637759&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74d86b40-caf3-45fc-b7bb-cfedc144af41', 'multiverseId': 637759}, 'multiverseid': 637759}, {'name': 'Bloodletter of Aclazotz', 'text': 'Flying\\nIf an opponent would lose life during your turn, they lose twice that much life instead. (Damage causes loss of life.)', 'type': 'Creature — Vampire Demon', 'flavor': 'Its very presence rips old wounds open to bleed anew.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638080&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e834eb3-df99-4d5d-935f-8896053365a8', 'multiverseId': 638080}, 'multiverseid': 638080}, {'name': 'Bloodletter of Aclazotz', 'text': 'Flying\\nIf an opponent would lose life during your turn, they lose twice that much life instead. (Damage causes loss of life.)', 'type': 'Creature — Vampire Demon', 'flavor': 'Its very presence rips old wounds open to bleed anew.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638401&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da3604d5-3c21-4bd1-b661-077c817df0ba', 'multiverseId': 638401}, 'multiverseid': 638401}, {'name': 'Bloodletter of Aclazotz', 'text': 'Flying\\nIf an opponent would lose life during your turn, they lose twice that much life instead. (Damage causes loss of life.)', 'type': 'Creature — Vampire Demon', 'flavor': 'Its very presence rips old wounds open to bleed anew.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638722&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3be8ef09-79e3-46fa-a1ca-49553a98bca7', 'multiverseId': 638722}, 'multiverseid': 638722}, {'name': 'Bloodletter of Aclazotz', 'text': 'Flying\\nIf an opponent would lose life during your turn, they lose twice that much life instead. (Damage causes loss of life.)', 'type': 'Creature — Vampire Demon', 'flavor': 'Its very presence rips old wounds open to bleed anew.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639043&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d1a1f10-1e89-48fd-87a2-d7c57408f8bf', 'multiverseId': 639043}, 'multiverseid': 639043}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blutdorn-Flegel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+1.\\nAusrüsten — Bezahle {3} oder wirf eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Waffe verkörpert sowohl die Stärke als auch die Schwäche der Legion des Zwielichts. Sie erdulden jeden Schmerz, um ihr Ziel zu erreichen, doch sie leiden grundlos, nur um ihre Hingabe zu beweisen."\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637118&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2f4f42d-b98f-4147-9b98-f07c0bb199df\', \'multiverseId\': 637118}, \'multiverseid\': 637118}, {\'name\': \'Mangual de espinas sangrientas\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+1.\\nEquipar—Pagar {3} o descartar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta arma representa la fuerza y la debilidad de la Legión del Crepúsculo. Soportan cualquier dolor para conseguir sus objetivos, pero sufren sin motivo solo para demostrar su compromiso".\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e511b6fb-3cf3-4e88-86d7-d53292eb341f\', \'multiverseId\': 637439}, \'multiverseid\': 637439}, {\'name\': \'Fléau de ronces hématiques\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+1.\\nÉquipement—Payez {3} ou défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact — équipement\', \'flavor\': \'« Cette arme incarne à la fois la force et la faiblesse de la Légion du crépuscule. Ces créatures supportent la souffrance pour parvenir à leurs fins, mais elles souffrent inutilement rien que pour prouver leur dévotion. »\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637760&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aa73b5d-8224-436d-8aad-fffda08ede70\', \'multiverseId\': 637760}, \'multiverseid\': 637760}, {\'name\': \'Mazzafrusto Sanguinospino\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+1.\\nEquipaggiare—Paga {3} o scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Quest\\\'arma rappresenta al tempo stesso la forza e la debolezza della Legione del Vespro. Sopporterebbero qualsiasi dolore per raggiungere i loro scopi, ma soffrono inutilmente al solo fine di dimostrare la loro dedizione."\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5284c617-297f-43f5-8a1e-0d2624bd2869\', \'multiverseId\': 638081}, \'multiverseid\': 638081}, {\'name\': \'血茨のフレイル\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備―{3}を支払うか、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「この武器は薄暮の軍団の強さと脆さを体現しているわね。目的を遂げるためにはどんな痛みにも耐えるけれど、信念を示すためといって無意味に苦しむのだもの。」\\n――ファートリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eca0efff-1e16-4ce0-9adc-40e00d1a7c6c\', \'multiverseId\': 638402}, \'multiverseid\': 638402}, {\'name\': \'Mangual do Espinho Sanguinário\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+1.\\nEquipar — Pague {3} ou descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Essa arma personifica tanto a força quanto a fraqueza da Legião do Crepúsculo. Eles suportariam qualquer dor para alcançar seus objetivos, mas sofrem inutilmente só para provar a própria devoção."\\n— Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a99bea91-53b1-45fc-ab35-1a5af1d92e7d\', \'multiverseId\': 638723}, \'multiverseid\': 638723}, {\'name\': \'血棘连枷\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+1。\\n佩带～支付{3}或弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器 — 武具\', \'flavor\': \'「这件武器优缺点分明，正如暮影军团本身。他们为达目的甘愿忍受一切苦痛，但却只是为自证虔诚而无端遭难。」\\n～华特莉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b5ae09-dfb6-408e-b2d7-0ff4c6c44366\', \'multiverseId\': 639044}, \'multiverseid\': 639044}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutrünstige Evangelistin\', \'text\': \'Schlachtruf (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erhält jede andere angreifende Kreatur +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\nWenn die Blutrünstige Evangelistin ins Spiel kommt oder stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Fledermaus-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Brüder der Fangzähne, lasst uns gemeinsam schmausen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637048&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4185fef-f753-4857-a43f-a897d3c8a3c4\', \'multiverseId\': 637048}, \'multiverseid\': 637048}, {\'name\': \'Evangelista sanguina\', \'text\': \'Grito de batalla. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, cada otra criatura atacante obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.)\\nCuando la Evangelista sanguina entre al campo de batalla o muera, crea una ficha de criatura Murciélago negra 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hermanos acolmillados, alimentémonos juntos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70032863-f264-4eb8-9c17-e37a6f5645dc\', \'multiverseId\': 637369}, \'multiverseid\': 637369}, {\'name\': \'Évangéliste sanguine\', \'text\': "Cri de guerre (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, chaque autre créature attaquante gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nQuand l\'Évangéliste sanguine arrive sur le champ de bataille ou meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Chauve-souris avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature — vampire et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Frères de crocs, nourrissons-nous ensemble. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637690&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b01217ed-dfc6-4646-9c0d-1a642942f995\', \'multiverseId\': 637690}, \'multiverseid\': 637690}, {\'name\': \'Evangelista Sanguigna\', \'text\': "Grido di guerra (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, ogni altra creatura attaccante prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.)\\nQuando l\'Evangelista Sanguigna entra nel campo di battaglia o muore, crea una pedina creatura Pipistrello 1/1 nera con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Fratelli di zanna, nutriamoci insieme."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccd0c955-7775-4b3e-9ebc-cfad86b6b68b\', \'multiverseId\': 638011}, \'multiverseid\': 638011}, {\'name\': \'血滾りの福音者\', \'text\': \'喊声（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これでないすべての攻撃クリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。）\\n血滾りの福音者が戦場に出たか死亡したとき、飛行を持つ黒の１/１のコウモリ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「牙の兄弟よ、共に喰らおう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d5f9568-517c-4338-b606-d2fbd02208d4\', \'multiverseId\': 638332}, \'multiverseid\': 638332}, {\'name\': \'Evangelista Sanguínea\', \'text\': \'Grito de guerra (Toda vez que esta criatura ataca, cada outra criatura atacante recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.)\\nQuando Evangelista Sanguínea entrar no campo de batalha ou morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Morcego preta 1/1 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Irmãos de presas, juntos nos alimentamos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2fe94fd-1c02-44da-a93d-97b5d390cc1e\', \'multiverseId\': 638653}, \'multiverseid\': 638653}, {\'name\': \'血色福音师\', \'text\': \'战嚎（每当此生物攻击时，每个进行攻击的其他生物各得+1/+0直到回合结束。）\\n当血色福音师进战场或死去时，派出一个1/1黑色，具飞行异能的蝙蝠衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 吸血鬼／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「尖牙同胞们，我们同饮共食。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce8ca682-92d5-4540-bfc5-91e072052352\', \'multiverseId\': 638974}, \'multiverseid\': 638974}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutrünstige Evangelistin\', \'text\': \'Schlachtruf\\nWenn die Blutrünstige Evangelistin ins Spiel kommt oder stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Fledermaus-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Brüder der Fangzähne, lasst uns gemeinsam schmausen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639804&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'320f016b-2462-48a0-bea9-e1f0e6c03df4\', \'multiverseId\': 639804}, \'multiverseid\': 639804}, {\'name\': \'Évangéliste sanguine\', \'text\': "Cri de guerre\\nQuand l\'Évangéliste sanguine arrive sur le champ de bataille ou meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Chauve-souris avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature — vampire et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Frères de crocs, nourrissons-nous ensemble. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1995fd34-9e55-45f1-bbbb-a59a129032f4\', \'multiverseId\': 639855}, \'multiverseid\': 639855}, {\'name\': \'血滾りの福音者\', \'text\': \'喊声\\n血滾りの福音者が戦場に出たか死亡したとき、飛行を持つ黒の１/１のコウモリ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「牙の兄弟よ、共に喰らおう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef8a160-7ca0-494e-90d0-d568494871db\', \'multiverseId\': 639906}, \'multiverseid\': 639906}, {\'name\': \'血色福音师\', \'text\': \'战嚎\\n当血色福音师进战场或死去时，派出一个1/1黑色，具飞行异能的蝙蝠衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 吸血鬼／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「尖牙同胞们，我们同饮共食。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd99465f-b02c-47ad-b046-450dff45d91a\', \'multiverseId\': 639957}, \'multiverseid\': 639957}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutsaugerin des Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nFalls ein Gegner während deines Zuges Lebenspunkte verlieren würde, verliert er stattdessen doppelt so viele Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639282&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41e0bf1e-5471-4cd7-9d53-4228b23b45ef\', \'multiverseId\': 639282}, \'multiverseid\': 639282}, {\'name\': \'Derramasangre de Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSi un oponente fuera a perder vidas durante tu turno, en vez de eso, pierde el doble de esa cantidad de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71e80cb7-7c4c-44f3-9387-d0bf3810be6d\', \'multiverseId\': 639302}, \'multiverseid\': 639302}, {\'name\': "Gravesang d\'Aclazotz", \'text\': \'Vol\\nSi un adversaire devait perdre des points de vie pendant votre tour, il perd deux fois ce nombre de points de vie à la place.\', \'type\': \'Créature — vampire et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639322&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a411b8bf-eca5-4c67-9dd1-e708cb3f0b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 639322}, \'multiverseid\': 639322}, {\'name\': \'Dissanguatore di Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nSe un avversario sta per perdere punti vita durante il tuo turno, ne perde invece il doppio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'353cf100-faaa-4c3a-b212-af7524f4b2b0\', \'multiverseId\': 639342}, \'multiverseid\': 639342}, {\'name\': \'アクロゾズの放血者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのターンの間に対戦相手１人がライフを失うなら、代わりにそのプレイヤーはその２倍の点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69f78d95-144a-4898-833e-55e4baaf87c3\', \'multiverseId\': 639362}, \'multiverseid\': 639362}, {\'name\': \'Flebotomista de Aclazotz\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nSe um oponente perderia pontos de vida durante o seu turno, em vez disso, ele perde o dobro daqueles pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ab924b3-04a6-4100-8143-3be2058dbc58\', \'multiverseId\': 639382}, \'multiverseid\': 639382}, {\'name\': \'阿洛佐兹放血魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n如果某对手将于你的回合中失去生命，则改为其失去两倍于该数量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 吸血鬼／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e28f7036-5ac3-48a6-b15b-1005d743f3a9\', \'multiverseId\': 639402}, \'multiverseid\': 639402}]', '[{\'name\': \'Breeches, eifriger Plünderer\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn ein Pirat, den du kontrollierst, angreift, bestimme eines, das in diesem Zug noch nicht bestimmt wurde —\\n• Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\\n• Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636525&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f88a83a0-bb6c-4d7f-88a3-b6abcc290cc0\', \'multiverseId\': 636525}, \'multiverseid\': 636525}, {\'name\': \'Calzón, saqueador ansioso\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que un Pirata que controlas ataque, elige uno que no haya sido elegido este turno:\\n• Crea una ficha de Tesoro.\\n• La criatura objetivo no puede bloquear este turno.\\n• Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugarla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pirata trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eb8c352-da07-4f4f-883c-3828a0c2c6df\', \'multiverseId\': 636549}, \'multiverseid\': 636549}, {\'name\': \'Braies, pillard impatient\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un pirate que vous contrôlez attaque, choisissez l\'un qui n\'a pas été choisi ce tour-ci —\\n• Créez un jeton Trésor.\\n• Une créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.\\n• Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la jouer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — gobelin et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636573&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b28ef2-cd2c-4a43-a385-73fd4be55051\', \'multiverseId\': 636573}, \'multiverseid\': 636573}, {\'name\': \'Braghe, Predone Bramoso\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta un Pirata che controlli attacca, scegli uno che non è stato scelto in questo turno —\\n• Crea una pedina Tesoro.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare in questo turno.\\n• Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocarla in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Pirata Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42712d13-62ec-4098-8ef6-50bb20985488\', \'multiverseId\': 636597}, \'multiverseid\': 636597}, {\'name\': \'熱心な略奪者、ブリーチェス\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nあなたがコントロールしている海賊１体が攻撃するたび、以下からこのターン中にまだ選ばれていない１つを選ぶ。\\n・宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、それをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'633cbf3e-84c2-4325-82fd-dbf5243ee3b4\', \'multiverseId\': 636621}, \'multiverseid\': 636621}, {\'name\': \'Bermuda, Saqueador Ávido\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nToda vez que um Pirata que você controla atacar, escolha um que ainda não tenha sido escolhido neste turno —\\n• Crie uma ficha de Tesouro.\\n• A criatura alvo não pode bloquear neste turno.\\n• Exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogá-lo neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Goblin Pirata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5830a64f-b967-4c83-8718-91591a857752\', \'multiverseId\': 636645}, \'multiverseid\': 636645}, {\'name\': \'热切劫贼布里奇\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每当一个由你操控的海盗攻击时，选择一项，且不得是本回合中此前选过的～\\n•派出一个珍宝衍生物。\\n•目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\\n•放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 鬼怪／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a771309-31c8-4a38-91e2-964b7f65f2d1\', \'multiverseId\': 636669}, \'multiverseid\': 636669}]', '[{\'name\': \'Breeches, eifriger Plünderer\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn ein Pirat, den du kontrollierst, angreift, bestimme eines, das in diesem Zug noch nicht bestimmt wurde —\\n• Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\\n• Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637167&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87e9f153-2294-4267-9aeb-5f2011fd3fda\', \'multiverseId\': 637167}, \'multiverseid\': 637167}, {\'name\': \'Calzón, saqueador ansioso\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que un Pirata que controlas ataque, elige uno que no haya sido elegido este turno:\\n• Crea una ficha de Tesoro.\\n• La criatura objetivo no puede bloquear este turno.\\n• Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugarla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pirata trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8281beca-d1e9-47d0-a5b5-11d4c5ad13a1\', \'multiverseId\': 637488}, \'multiverseid\': 637488}, {\'name\': \'Braies, pillard impatient\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un pirate que vous contrôlez attaque, choisissez l\'un qui n\'a pas été choisi ce tour-ci —\\n• Créez un jeton Trésor.\\n• Une créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.\\n• Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la jouer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — gobelin et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637809&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf9ba32-61af-4aa7-9538-ca06b83cb6b6\', \'multiverseId\': 637809}, \'multiverseid\': 637809}, {\'name\': \'Braghe, Predone Bramoso\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta un Pirata che controlli attacca, scegli uno che non è stato scelto in questo turno —\\n• Crea una pedina Tesoro.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare in questo turno.\\n• Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocarla in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Pirata Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e560f31-a9f1-4df1-b5cf-ddbf983edebc\', \'multiverseId\': 638130}, \'multiverseid\': 638130}, {\'name\': \'熱心な略奪者、ブリーチェス\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nあなたがコントロールしている海賊１体が攻撃するたび、以下からこのターン中にまだ選ばれていない１つを選ぶ。\\n・宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。\\n・あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、それをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d98f65d4-a0da-4c59-bab3-0f9e91041bd9\', \'multiverseId\': 638451}, \'multiverseid\': 638451}, {\'name\': \'Bermuda, Pilhador Ávido\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nToda vez que um Pirata que você controla atacar, escolha um que ainda não tenha sido escolhido neste turno —\\n• Crie uma ficha de Tesouro.\\n• A criatura alvo não pode bloquear neste turno.\\n• Exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogá-lo neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Goblin Pirata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6aeccac-9bcf-47ff-8268-4a4f8569027a\', \'multiverseId\': 638772}, \'multiverseid\': 638772}, {\'name\': \'热切劫贼布里奇\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每当一个由你操控的海盗攻击时，选择一项，且不得是本回合中此前选过的～\\n•派出一个珍宝衍生物。\\n•目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\\n•放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 鬼怪／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a5efb8d-9a90-4112-89f1-d17a99740e31\', \'multiverseId\': 639093}, \'multiverseid\': 639093}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bringer der letzten Gabe\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Bringer der letzten Gabe ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, opfert jeder Spieler alle anderen Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert. Dann bringt jeder Spieler alle Kreaturenkarten aus seinem Friedhof, die nicht auf diese Weise dorthin gelegt wurden, ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637119&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'236b1fed-ead1-4e9a-8cfc-165189c25afb\', \'multiverseId\': 637119}, \'multiverseid\': 637119}, {\'name\': \'Portadora del último obsequio\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Portadora del último obsequio entre al campo de batalla, si la lanzaste, cada jugador sacrifica todas las otras criaturas que controla. Luego, cada jugador regresa al campo de batalla todas las cartas de criatura de su cementerio que no fueron allí de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41784b0d-beae-4e92-b658-a0cc1fc00e18\', \'multiverseId\': 637440}, \'multiverseid\': 637440}, {\'name\': \'Annonciateur de la dernière offrande\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Annonciateur de la dernière offrande arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, chaque joueur sacrifie toutes les autres créatures qu\'il contrôle. Puis chaque joueur renvoie sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes de créature de son cimetière qui n\'y ont pas été mises de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature — vampire et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637761&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6c351f3-70d2-4ef4-9ffa-15a62cce5adb\', \'multiverseId\': 637761}, \'multiverseid\': 637761}, {\'name\': "Portatore dell\'Ultimo Dono", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Portatore dell\'Ultimo Dono entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciato, ogni giocatore sacrifica tutte le altre creature che controlla. Poi ogni giocatore rimette sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte creatura dal proprio cimitero che non vi erano state messe in questo modo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bf5c78b-9026-47c6-bed6-71bac8a99a3a\', \'multiverseId\': 638082}, \'multiverseid\': 638082}, {\'name\': \'最後の贈り物の運び手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n最後の贈り物の運び手が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分がコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。その後、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の墓地にありこれによりそこに置かれたものでないすべてのクリーチャー・カードを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4690fa47-d298-4a74-86d0-bbebc48646d4\', \'multiverseId\': 638403}, \'multiverseid\': 638403}, {\'name\': \'Portador da Última Dádiva\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Portador da Última Dádiva entra no campo de batalha, se você o conjurou, cada jogador sacrifica todas as outras criaturas que ele controla. Depois, cada jogador devolve ao campo de batalha todos os cards de criatura do próprio cemitério que não tenham sido colocados lá dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd6dced9-d867-45c4-b1d4-4a6c5a287385\', \'multiverseId\': 638724}, \'multiverseid\': 638724}, {\'name\': \'终礼使者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当终礼使者进战场时，若它经你施放，则每位牌手各牺牲所有由其操控的其他生物。然后每位牌手各从其坟墓场中将所有并非以此法进入该处的生物牌移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 吸血鬼／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf5d4f61-927f-49da-b5bf-1c756ec75f72\', \'multiverseId\': 639045}, \'multiverseid\': 639045}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bringer der letzten Gabe\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Bringer der letzten Gabe ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, opfert jeder Spieler alle anderen Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert. Dann bringt jeder Spieler alle Kreaturenkarten aus seinem Friedhof, die nicht auf diese Weise dorthin gelegt wurden, ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639283&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdc879c7-2ce3-4ce6-9a39-83291bb1322a\', \'multiverseId\': 639283}, \'multiverseid\': 639283}, {\'name\': \'Portadora del último obsequio\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Portadora del último obsequio entre al campo de batalla, si la lanzaste, cada jugador sacrifica todas las otras criaturas que controla. Luego, cada jugador regresa al campo de batalla todas las cartas de criatura de su cementerio que no fueron allí de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49ba5458-b97f-44c7-a3ec-a20fedb09e34\', \'multiverseId\': 639303}, \'multiverseid\': 639303}, {\'name\': \'Annonciateur de la dernière offrande\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Annonciateur de la dernière offrande arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, chaque joueur sacrifie toutes les autres créatures qu\'il contrôle. Puis chaque joueur renvoie sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes de créature de son cimetière qui n\'y ont pas été mises de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature — vampire et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639323&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf81080-f391-41c0-9f39-68bd69692c38\', \'multiverseId\': 639323}, \'multiverseid\': 639323}, {\'name\': "Portatore dell\'Ultimo Dono", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Portatore dell\'Ultimo Dono entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciato, ogni giocatore sacrifica tutte le altre creature che controlla. Poi ogni giocatore rimette sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte creatura dal proprio cimitero che non vi erano state messe in questo modo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'996b3611-5cf6-463e-b4d2-5240e83646a7\', \'multiverseId\': 639343}, \'multiverseid\': 639343}, {\'name\': \'最後の贈り物の運び手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n最後の贈り物の運び手が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分がコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。その後、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の墓地にありこれによりそこに置かれたものでないすべてのクリーチャー・カードを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89bc15ea-b77b-40ab-b6f3-1ef973db5710\', \'multiverseId\': 639363}, \'multiverseid\': 639363}, {\'name\': \'Portador da Última Dádiva\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Portador da Última Dádiva entra no campo de batalha, se você o conjurou, cada jogador sacrifica todas as outras criaturas que ele controla. Depois, cada jogador devolve ao campo de batalha todos os cards de criatura do próprio cemitério que não tenham sido colocados lá dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'463fd12a-7afa-4b17-ae5d-a35aee3d71fe\', \'multiverseId\': 639383}, \'multiverseid\': 639383}, {\'name\': \'终礼使者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当终礼使者进战场时，若它经你施放，则每位牌手各牺牲所有由其操控的其他生物。然后每位牌手各从其坟墓场中将所有并非以此法进入该处的生物牌移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 吸血鬼／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab611f33-a66f-4747-b19e-17a6451e51ed\', \'multiverseId\': 639403}, \'multiverseid\': 639403}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutzorn-Mykoid\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug abgestiegen bist, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Pilzwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken." (Du bist abgestiegen, falls eine Permanent-Karte von irgendwoher auf deinen Friedhof gelegt wurde.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn sich die gewaltigen, als Zorntitanen bekannten Mykoiden in die Schlacht stürzen, folgt ihnen ein Schwarm kleinerer, um verbleibende Überlebende zu verschlingen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637120&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9eacf37-26c8-46f2-bc51-9aae63132e7c\', \'multiverseId\': 637120}, \'multiverseid\': 637120}, {\'name\': \'Micoide prolefuria\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si descendiste este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Hongo negra 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear". (Descendiste si una carta de permanente fue a tu cementerio desde cualquier parte.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hongo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando los gigantescos micoides conocidos como furiatitanes se lanzan a la batalla, los más pequeños van tras ellos y engullen a los supervivientes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04b7cb9b-c98b-4768-85c4-8771075a1a6d\', \'multiverseId\': 637441}, \'multiverseid\': 637441}, {\'name\': \'Mycoïde de la couvée enragée\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous êtes descendu ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Fongus avec le « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. » (Vous êtes descendu si une carte de permanent a été mise dans votre cimetière depuis n\'importe où.)", \'type\': \'Créature — fongus\', \'flavor\': \'Tandis que les énormes mycoïdes appelés les titans de rage chargent au combat, les plus petits grouillent dans leur sillage, avalant les éventuels survivants.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99e88f68-9c3c-4064-aacf-dd28afe60694\', \'multiverseId\': 637762}, \'multiverseid\': 637762}, {\'name\': \'Micoide della Nidiata Furiosa\', \'text\': \'All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se sei sceso in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Fungus 1/1 nera con "Questa creatura non può bloccare". (Sei sceso se una carta permanente è stata messa nel tuo cimitero da qualsiasi zona.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Fungus\', \'flavor\': \'Quando gli imponenti micoidi noti come titani della furia caricano in battaglia, i loro simili più piccoli ne seguono le tracce, trangugiando gli eventuali sopravvissuti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29f47f9e-4fcc-4809-9b30-8c3bccbb6baa\', \'multiverseId\': 638083}, \'multiverseid\': 638083}, {\'name\': \'同族怒りのマイコイド\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが落魄していた場合、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のファンガス・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。（パーマネント・カードがいずこかからあなたの墓地に置かれたなら、あなたは落魄する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': \'怒れる巨人として知られる巨大なマイコイドは戦場に突き進み、その後に続いた小さなマイコイドの群れが生き残りに喰らいついた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c39c704-3002-420b-b966-d0cfd5f78572\', \'multiverseId\': 638404}, \'multiverseid\': 638404}, {\'name\': \'Micoide da Prole Furiosa\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se você tiver descido neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Fungo preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear". (Você desceu se um card de permanente foi colocado em seu cemitério vindo de qualquer lugar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fungo\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto os enormes micoides conhecidos como titãs da fúria avançam na batalha, outros menores os seguem em bando, devorando quaisquer sobreviventes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57a3429f-e392-4527-990e-42bfe7f0db30\', \'multiverseId\': 638725}, \'multiverseid\': 638725}, {\'name\': \'巢怒智蕈\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中有落坟，则派出一个1/1黑色真菌衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」（如果有永久物牌从任何区域进入你的坟墓场，便算作你有落坟。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 真菌\', \'flavor\': \'名唤怒火泰坦的巨型智蕈率先冲入战场，之后体型较小的智蕈紧随其后，伺机吞噬侥幸存活者。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12120911-ef2e-4dde-ae4b-10dae60b4327\', \'multiverseId\': 639046}, \'multiverseid\': 639046}]', "[{'name': 'Brüllender Carnosaurus', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Brüllende Carnosaurus ins Spiel kommt, wende Entdeckung 5 an.\\n{2}{R}, wirf den Brüllenden Carnosaurus ab: Er fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dinosaurier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637206&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdcf00cb-1518-42a9-aa9d-a06a7a195ff6', 'multiverseId': 637206}, 'multiverseid': 637206}, {'name': 'Carnosaurio bramador', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Carnosaurio bramador entre al campo de batalla, descubre 5.\\n{2}{R}, descartar el Carnosaurio bramador: Hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dinosaurio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637527&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13e9429a-fe56-4d6f-8d97-fcb0539b4837', 'multiverseId': 637527}, 'multiverseid': 637527}, {'name': 'Carnosaure barrissant', 'text': 'Piétinement\\nQuand le Carnosaure barrissant arrive sur le champ de bataille, découvrez 5.\\n{2}{R}, défaussez-vous du Carnosaure barrissant : Il inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.', 'type': 'Créature — dinosaure', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637848&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b53065e-6891-4127-8d60-bab56e0ad4b4', 'multiverseId': 637848}, 'multiverseid': 637848}, {'name': 'Carnosauro Ruggente', 'text': 'Travolgere\\nQuando il Carnosauro Ruggente entra nel campo di battaglia, scopri 5.\\n{2}{R}, Scarta il Carnosauro Ruggente: Infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Dinosauro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638169&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '050d586c-72a1-40be-86cd-a251594452e0', 'multiverseId': 638169}, 'multiverseid': 638169}, {'name': '嘶くカルノサウルス', 'text': 'トランプル\\n嘶くカルノサウルスが戦場に出たとき、発見５を行う。\\n{2}{R}, 嘶くカルノサウルスを捨てる：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーである１体を対象とする。これはそれに３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 恐竜', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638490&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6082285a-4ab3-484a-9715-d8b317e3460e', 'multiverseId': 638490}, 'multiverseid': 638490}, {'name': 'Carnossauro Trompetista', 'text': 'Atropelar\\nQuando Carnossauro Trompetista entrar no campo de batalha, descubra 5.\\n{2}{R}, descarte Carnossauro Trompetista: Ele causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dinossauro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638811&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '192bd066-ac02-4b75-8904-045b80119adc', 'multiverseId': 638811}, 'multiverseid': 638811}, {'name': '长吼食肉龙', 'text': '践踏\\n当长吼食肉龙进战场时，倾探5。\\n{2}{R}，弃掉长吼食肉龙：它对目标生物或鹏洛客造成3点伤害。', 'type': '生物 — 恐龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639132&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '410cc2c5-eb02-43a2-9fda-e093e8ad5957', 'multiverseId': 639132}, 'multiverseid': 639132}]", "[{'name': 'Brüllender Carnosaurus', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Brüllende Carnosaurus ins Spiel kommt, wende Entdeckung 5 an.\\n{2}{R}, wirf den Brüllenden Carnosaurus ab: Er fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dinosaurier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639583&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12a456b7-05b2-4b4b-aa10-a8a7089197ef', 'multiverseId': 639583}, 'multiverseid': 639583}, {'name': 'Carnosaurio bramador', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Carnosaurio bramador entre al campo de batalla, descubre 5.\\n{2}{R}, descartar el Carnosaurio bramador: Hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dinosaurio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639596&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8aaacb2-d06d-4a48-84e1-8ef53476ca12', 'multiverseId': 639596}, 'multiverseid': 639596}, {'name': 'Carnosaure barrissant', 'text': 'Piétinement\\nQuand le Carnosaure barrissant arrive sur le champ de bataille, découvrez 5.\\n{2}{R}, défaussez-vous du Carnosaure barrissant : Il inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.', 'type': 'Créature — dinosaure', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639609&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c93199f2-f548-45c8-bc3e-846970dc43ef', 'multiverseId': 639609}, 'multiverseid': 639609}, {'name': 'Carnosauro Ruggente', 'text': 'Travolgere\\nQuando il Carnosauro Ruggente entra nel campo di battaglia, scopri 5.\\n{2}{R}, Scarta il Carnosauro Ruggente: Infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Dinosauro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639622&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f945b0ac-f545-4d5a-b3fd-5589be637fd3', 'multiverseId': 639622}, 'multiverseid': 639622}, {'name': '嘶くカルノサウルス', 'text': 'トランプル\\n嘶くカルノサウルスが戦場に出たとき、発見５を行う。\\n{2}{R}, 嘶くカルノサウルスを捨てる：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーである１体を対象とする。これはそれに３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 恐竜', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639635&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cf856ae-faee-4116-b57b-3baaf16d0264', 'multiverseId': 639635}, 'multiverseid': 639635}, {'name': 'Carnossauro Rugidor', 'text': 'Atropelar\\nQuando Carnossauro Rugidor entrar no campo de batalha, descubra 5.\\n{2}{R}, descarte Carnossauro Rugidor: Ele causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dinossauro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639648&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9275956-b714-44d8-880a-cfab1bb3f8d0', 'multiverseId': 639648}, 'multiverseid': 639648}, {'name': '长吼食肉龙', 'text': '践踏\\n当长吼食肉龙进战场时，倾探5。\\n{2}{R}，弃掉长吼食肉龙：它对目标生物或鹏洛客造成3点伤害。', 'type': '生物 — 恐龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639661&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b56190f-cf63-407b-af13-d2494348c0b4', 'multiverseId': 639661}, 'multiverseid': 639661}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bösartige Sonnenfinsternis\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen erhalten -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Aclazotz lachte, als die dunklen Splitter sich um Chimil schlossen und den Weltenkern in unnatürliche Dunkelheit hüllten. Endlich würde seine blutige Herrschaft beginnen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637137&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80166fb0-9a07-4fa4-9094-4e7a532d2bcf\', \'multiverseId\': 637137}, \'multiverseid\': 637137}, {\'name\': \'Eclipse malicioso\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno. Si una criatura que controla un oponente fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Aclazotz carcajeó cuando los fragmentos de sombras rodearon a Chimil, lo que sumió el núcleo en una oscuridad antinatural. Al fin comenzaba su reino sangriento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca61bd87-32a3-45b2-a2d0-615f7afd0b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 637458}, \'multiverseid\': 637458}, {\'name\': \'Éclipse malicieuse\', \'text\': "Toutes les créatures gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Aclazotz éclata de rire tandis que les fragments noirs enveloppaient Chimil, plongeant le Noyau dans une obscurité surnaturelle. Enfin, son règne sanglant allait commencer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637779&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0572cd7c-0518-40f0-9ff4-e695fb9aa934\', \'multiverseId\': 637779}, \'multiverseid\': 637779}, {\'name\': \'Eclissi Malefica\', \'text\': \'Tutte le creature prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno. Se una creatura controllata da un avversario sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Aclazotz rideva mentre i frammenti oscuri avviluppavano Chimil, facendo sprofondare il Nucleo in un\'oscurità innaturale. Finalmente il suo regno di sangue avrebbe avuto inizio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cecdcc2a-ba4d-41d1-8ee3-f0e413daf924\', \'multiverseId\': 638100}, \'multiverseid\': 638100}, {\'name\': \'悪意ある覆い隠し\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。このターン、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'暗き破片がチミルを取り囲み、中心核は不自然な闇に覆われた。その様を見て、アクロゾズは笑い声を上げた。遂に、彼の血濡れた支配の時が来たのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6893b60-8f61-4b4a-91cf-f887c489d2f6\', \'multiverseId\': 638421}, \'multiverseid\': 638421}, {\'name\': \'Eclipse Malicioso\', \'text\': \'Todas as criaturas recebem -2/-2 até o final do turno. Se uma criatura que o oponente controla morreria neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Aclazotz gargalhou enquanto fragmentos tenebrosos se fechavam em torno de Chimil, fazendo o Núcleo mergulhar numa escuridão sobrenatural. Finalmente seu reino de sangue começaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d61cfe10-4d0a-4ba9-a859-7ee22d4deb0f\', \'multiverseId\': 638742}, \'multiverseid\': 638742}, {\'name\': \'恶意蔽日\', \'text\': \'所有生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。如果本回合中由对手操控的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'随着黑暗碎片逐渐遮蔽奇密理，令世界核心陷入异状黑暗，阿洛佐兹不由畅怀大笑。历经艰辛，他的血腥统治终能揭开帷幕。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d949de3c-1c66-4f56-ad24-e0016200084a\', \'multiverseId\': 639063}, \'multiverseid\': 639063}]', '[{\'name\': \'Caparocti, Sohn der Sonne\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Caparocti, Sohn der Sonne, angreift, kannst du zwei ungetappte Artefakte und/oder Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Falls du dies tust, wende Entdeckung 3 an. (Schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger ins Exil schickst. Wirke sie, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen, oder nimm sie auf deine Hand. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter die Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637267&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d1437a-15c2-4fda-8ce9-befff1409034\', \'multiverseId\': 637267}, \'multiverseid\': 637267}, {\'name\': \'Caparocti, Nacido del Sol\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Caparocti, Nacido del Sol ataque, puedes girar dos criaturas y/o artefactos enderezados que controlas. Si lo haces, descubre 3. (Exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra con valor de maná de 3 o menos. Lánzala sin pagar su coste de maná o ponla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3366b9a7-4052-4b82-aee1-8431728141e1\', \'multiverseId\': 637588}, \'multiverseid\': 637588}, {\'name\': \'Caparocti, Fils du soleil\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Caparocti, Fils du soleil attaque, vous pouvez engager deux artefacts et/ou créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, découvrez 3. (Exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3. Lancez-la sans payer son coût de mana ou mettez-la dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c280351-bc61-41fd-8145-585cfa1ba8dc\', \'multiverseId\': 637909}, \'multiverseid\': 637909}, {\'name\': \'Caparocti Figlio del Sole\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Caparocti Figlio del Sole attacca, puoi TAPpare due artefatti e/o creature STAPpati che controlli. Se lo fai, scopri 3. (Esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3. Lanciala senza pagare il suo costo di mana o aggiungila alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bd526b5-2401-499f-ae1e-34534c5ae7bc\', \'multiverseId\': 638230}, \'multiverseid\': 638230}, {\'name\': \'カパロクティ・サンボーン\', \'text\': \'カパロクティ・サンボーンが攻撃するたび、アーティファクトやクリーチャーでありあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である２つをタップしてもよい。そうしたなら、発見３を行う。（マナ総量が３以下であり土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。それをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えるか、あなたの手札に加える。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'061ffdd9-a268-4dc4-a921-43151ab32a9b\', \'multiverseId\': 638551}, \'multiverseid\': 638551}, {\'name\': \'Caparocti, Filho do Sol\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Caparocti, Filho do Sol, ataca, você pode virar dois artefatos e/ou criaturas desvirados que você controla. Se fizer isso, descubra 3. (Exile cards do topo do seu grimório até exilar um card não de terreno com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3. Conjure sem pagar o custo de mana ou coloque-o na sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo do grimório em ordem aleatória.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a238c94-43d9-4276-aec3-eb5f4b03c31d\', \'multiverseId\': 638872}, \'multiverseid\': 638872}, {\'name\': \'炫日卡帕罗提\', \'text\': \'每当炫日卡帕罗提攻击时，你可以横置两个由你操控且未横置的神器和／或生物。若你如此作，则倾探3。（从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张法术力值等于或小于3的非地牌为止。施放之且不需支付其法术力费用，或将之置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bfbf2aa-b0ca-472b-841e-3f50ba0422e8\', \'multiverseId\': 639193}, \'multiverseid\': 639193}]', "[{'name': 'Caparocti, Sohn der Sonne', 'text': 'Immer wenn Caparocti, Sohn der Sonne, angreift, kannst du zwei ungetappte Artefakte und/oder Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Falls du dies tust, wende Entdeckung 3 an.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636534&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1dcea7a-d344-4540-ad47-1ed5e993c81f', 'multiverseId': 636534}, 'multiverseid': 636534}, {'name': 'Caparocti, Nacido del Sol', 'text': 'Siempre que Caparocti, Nacido del Sol ataque, puedes girar dos criaturas y/o artefactos enderezados que controlas. Si lo haces, descubre 3.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636558&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae4048ba-346a-46c8-afa4-f7b40cc96749', 'multiverseId': 636558}, 'multiverseid': 636558}, {'name': 'Caparocti, Fils du soleil', 'text': 'À chaque fois que Caparocti, Fils du soleil attaque, vous pouvez engager deux artefacts et/ou créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, découvrez 3.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire — humain et soldat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636582&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5eac67d-f02c-461b-8059-a332b85f3fe3', 'multiverseId': 636582}, 'multiverseid': 636582}, {'name': 'Caparocti Figlio del Sole', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta Caparocti Figlio del Sole attacca, puoi TAPpare due artefatti e/o creature STAPpati che controlli. Se lo fai, scopri 3.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636606&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bfb35ef-07ac-40b5-9ef2-f1275d13498b', 'multiverseId': 636606}, 'multiverseid': 636606}, {'name': 'カパロクティ・サンボーン', 'text': 'カパロクティ・サンボーンが攻撃するたび、アーティファクトやクリーチャーでありあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である２つをタップしてもよい。そうしたなら、発見３を行う。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636630&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3df2c363-c009-475f-bd34-e2b3bb49f1db', 'multiverseId': 636630}, 'multiverseid': 636630}, {'name': 'Caparocti, Filho do Sol', 'text': 'Toda vez que Caparocti, Filho do Sol, ataca, você pode virar dois artefatos e/ou criaturas desvirados que você controla. Se fizer isso, descubra 3.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636654&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '337f58ee-2d18-4485-9d4e-b8e06c3bc891', 'multiverseId': 636654}, 'multiverseid': 636654}, {'name': '炫日卡帕罗提', 'text': '每当炫日卡帕罗提攻击时，你可以横置两个由你操控且未横置的神器和／或生物。若你如此作，则倾探3。', 'type': '传奇生物 — 人类／士兵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636678&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56f9f204-8712-4a1f-a85e-69b83c97b188', 'multiverseId': 636678}, 'multiverseid': 636678}]", '[{\'name\': \'Cenotenspäherin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Cenotenspäherin ins Spiel kommt, erkundet sie. (Decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls die Karte ein Land ist, nimm sie auf deine Hand. Lege sonst eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur und lege dann die Karte zurück oder auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du Angst davor hast, ins Unbekannte abzutauchen, wie wirst du dann jemals etwas Neues finden?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637213&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe07e9e4-6c71-420f-8c47-9cfa19966ea5\', \'multiverseId\': 637213}, \'multiverseid\': 637213}, {\'name\': \'Exploradora del cenote\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Exploradora del cenote entre al campo de batalla, explora. (Muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Pon esa carta en tu mano si es una tierra. De lo contrario, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura y luego devuelve la carta a su sitio o ponla en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"Si tienes miedo de sumergirte en lo desconocido, ¿cómo pretendes descubrir algo nuevo?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df33aeeb-edc3-4fee-a837-efc36f32e5b5\', \'multiverseId\': 637534}, \'multiverseid\': 637534}, {\'name\': \'Éclaireuse de la cénote\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Éclaireuse de la cénote arrive sur le champ de bataille, elle explore. (Révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez cette carte dans votre main si c\'est un terrain. Sinon, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature, puis remettez la carte au-dessus de votre bibliothèque ou mettez-la dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature — ondin et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous avez peur de plonger dans l\'inconnu, comment trouverez-vous quelque chose de nouveau ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00834684-d44e-40db-aff7-d6f83cf6e53e\', \'multiverseId\': 637855}, \'multiverseid\': 637855}, {\'name\': \'Esploratrice di Cenote\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Esploratrice di Cenote entra nel campo di battaglia, esplora. (Rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una terra, aggiungila alla tua mano. Altrimenti, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura, poi rimetti quella carta al suo posto o mettila nel tuo cimitero.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Se hai paura di tuffarti nell\\\'ignoto, come potrai mai trovare qualcosa di nuovo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a471d3c-7fae-4e9b-8398-c1f696a391f8\', \'multiverseId\': 638176}, \'multiverseid\': 638176}, {\'name\': \'陥没穴の偵察\', \'text\': \'陥没穴の偵察が戦場に出たとき、これは探検を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それが土地なら、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。そうでないなら、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。その後、そのカードを戻すかあなたの墓地に置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「未知に飛び込むことを恐れるものが、どうやって新しい発見を出来ようか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c903768a-b02b-4b8a-af89-4b578d23c58e\', \'multiverseId\': 638497}, \'multiverseid\': 638497}, {\'name\': \'Batedora do Cenote\', \'text\': \'Quando Batedora do Cenote entra no campo de batalha, ela explora. (Revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Coloque aquele card em sua mão se ele for um terreno. Caso contrário, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura e, em seguida, devolva o card ao grimório ou coloque-o em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você tem medo de mergulhar rumo ao desconhecido, como você vai descobrir qualquer coisa nova?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de212597-e214-43c3-aae5-e9cc4d5f1daa\', \'multiverseId\': 638818}, \'multiverseid\': 638818}, {\'name\': \'岩洞井斥候\', \'text\': \'当岩洞井斥候进战场时，令它勘察。（展示你的牌库顶牌。如果该牌是地，则置于你手上。若否，则在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后将所展示的牌放回原位或置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人鱼／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「你若是害怕潜入未知之境，又岂能发现新鲜事物？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05d65fb4-5aaa-4ea5-ae26-0cc6ccdf0f14\', \'multiverseId\': 639139}, \'multiverseid\': 639139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cenotenspäherin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Cenotenspäherin ins Spiel kommt, erkundet sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636467&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10e9d84e-724d-4048-a025-fc3fce5297d5\', \'multiverseId\': 636467}, \'multiverseid\': 636467}, {\'name\': \'Exploradora del cenote\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Exploradora del cenote entre al campo de batalla, explora.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador tritón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfed53c6-da5f-42a6-8300-1cf43b2c72d3\', \'multiverseId\': 636472}, \'multiverseid\': 636472}, {\'name\': \'Éclaireuse de la cénote\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Éclaireuse de la cénote arrive sur le champ de bataille, elle explore.", \'type\': \'Créature — ondin et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a283d962-2bfd-4099-8ddd-af3fd16c7709\', \'multiverseId\': 636477}, \'multiverseid\': 636477}, {\'name\': \'Esploratrice di Cenote\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Esploratrice di Cenote entra nel campo di battaglia, esplora.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Tritone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c33c75e1-8552-4de3-b99a-952ae8fae8b6\', \'multiverseId\': 636482}, \'multiverseid\': 636482}, {\'name\': \'陥没穴の偵察\', \'text\': \'陥没穴の偵察が戦場に出たとき、これは探検を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e08fb5f0-a002-4c83-baea-112592d93a26\', \'multiverseId\': 636487}, \'multiverseid\': 636487}, {\'name\': \'Batedora do Cenote\', \'text\': \'Quando Batedora do Cenote entra no campo de batalha, ela explora.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Batedor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc8e0dbb-07bc-43da-b01e-c984d6aa504a\', \'multiverseId\': 636492}, \'multiverseid\': 636492}, {\'name\': \'岩洞井斥候\', \'text\': \'当岩洞井斥候进战场时，令它勘察。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人鱼／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=636497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1d219b8-c952-4901-9f94-a6487f9a47b3\', \'multiverseId\': 636497}, \'multiverseid\': 636497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chimil, the Inner Sun\', \'text\': "Spells you control can\'t be countered.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, discover 5. (Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value 5 or less. Cast it without paying its mana cost or put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)", \'type\': \'Legendary Artifact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637291&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3133be4f-ba62-468b-a42b-afb7e6b20954\', \'multiverseId\': 637291}, \'multiverseid\': 637291}, {\'name\': \'Chimil, the Inner Sun\', \'text\': "Spells you control can\'t be countered.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, discover 5. (Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value 5 or less. Cast it without paying its mana cost or put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)", \'type\': \'Legendary Artifact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ef9c9c-2a6e-476e-b5c4-cb9d3078fd64\', \'multiverseId\': 637612}, \'multiverseid\': 637612}, {\'name\': \'Chimil, the Inner Sun\', \'text\': "Spells you control can\'t be countered.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, discover 5. (Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value 5 or less. Cast it without paying its mana cost or put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)", \'type\': \'Legendary Artifact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637933&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cf9d209-b556-4812-a711-b8ad93843f0c\', \'multiverseId\': 637933}, \'multiverseid\': 637933}, {\'name\': \'Chimil, the Inner Sun\', \'text\': "Spells you control can\'t be countered.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, discover 5. (Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value 5 or less. Cast it without paying its mana cost or put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)", \'type\': \'Legendary Artifact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9ab013b-776b-4ee0-8e73-27773e2cadde\', \'multiverseId\': 638254}, \'multiverseid\': 638254}, {\'name\': \'Chimil, the Inner Sun\', \'text\': "Spells you control can\'t be countered.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, discover 5. (Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value 5 or less. Cast it without paying its mana cost or put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)", \'type\': \'Legendary Artifact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8568a06-fc22-4987-ab09-293e0401a141\', \'multiverseId\': 638575}, \'multiverseid\': 638575}, {\'name\': \'Chimil, the Inner Sun\', \'text\': "Spells you control can\'t be countered.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, discover 5. (Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value 5 or less. Cast it without paying its mana cost or put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)", \'type\': \'Legendary Artifact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'033f35ab-5362-4cdd-b770-d24d0a17492c\', \'multiverseId\': 638896}, \'multiverseid\': 638896}, {\'name\': \'Chimil, the Inner Sun\', \'text\': "Spells you control can\'t be countered.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, discover 5. (Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value 5 or less. Cast it without paying its mana cost or put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)", \'type\': \'Legendary Artifact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65e2e3fb-9c1d-43e3-8342-25539c420dda\', \'multiverseId\': 639217}, \'multiverseid\': 639217}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cosmium Confluence\', \'text\': "Choose three. You may choose the same mode more than once.\\n• Search your library for a Cave card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\n• Put three +1/+1 counters on a Cave you control. It becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It\'s still a land.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.", \'type\': \'Sorcery\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637216&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'256b2e19-4628-48f9-8404-fab0b5b29808\', \'multiverseId\': 637216}, \'multiverseid\': 637216}, {\'name\': \'Cosmium Confluence\', \'text\': "Choose three. You may choose the same mode more than once.\\n• Search your library for a Cave card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\n• Put three +1/+1 counters on a Cave you control. It becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It\'s still a land.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.", \'type\': \'Sorcery\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dfb6403-58e2-426c-aaac-0458fda9fe65\', \'multiverseId\': 637537}, \'multiverseid\': 637537}, {\'name\': \'Cosmium Confluence\', \'text\': "Choose three. You may choose the same mode more than once.\\n• Search your library for a Cave card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\n• Put three +1/+1 counters on a Cave you control. It becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It\'s still a land.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.", \'type\': \'Sorcery\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637858&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a2e4f3d-871e-43de-bf21-4df5335b9e78\', \'multiverseId\': 637858}, \'multiverseid\': 637858}, {\'name\': \'Cosmium Confluence\', \'text\': "Choose three. You may choose the same mode more than once.\\n• Search your library for a Cave card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\n• Put three +1/+1 counters on a Cave you control. It becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It\'s still a land.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.", \'type\': \'Sorcery\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac3e008d-11fd-4762-b56c-7f9fe2eab1df\', \'multiverseId\': 638179}, \'multiverseid\': 638179}, {\'name\': \'Cosmium Confluence\', \'text\': "Choose three. You may choose the same mode more than once.\\n• Search your library for a Cave card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\n• Put three +1/+1 counters on a Cave you control. It becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It\'s still a land.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.", \'type\': \'Sorcery\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da876450-9c10-4f32-8df6-976ba1417a5e\', \'multiverseId\': 638500}, \'multiverseid\': 638500}, {\'name\': \'Cosmium Confluence\', \'text\': "Choose three. You may choose the same mode more than once.\\n• Search your library for a Cave card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\n• Put three +1/+1 counters on a Cave you control. It becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It\'s still a land.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.", \'type\': \'Sorcery\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1bb1643-94d5-4e9f-becd-432197c34164\', \'multiverseId\': 638821}, \'multiverseid\': 638821}, {\'name\': \'Cosmium Confluence\', \'text\': "Choose three. You may choose the same mode more than once.\\n• Search your library for a Cave card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\n• Put three +1/+1 counters on a Cave you control. It becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It\'s still a land.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.", \'type\': \'Sorcery\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09faddf9-b3c7-4bcc-acd0-b0d4619a4c75\', \'multiverseId\': 639142}, \'multiverseid\': 639142}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Enigma-Juwel // Sammelpunkt der Erleuchtung\', \'text\': \'Das Enigma-Juwel kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Fähigkeiten zu aktivieren.\\nAnfertigung mit vier oder mehr Nichtländern mit aktivierten Fähigkeiten {8}{U} ({8}{U}, schicke dieses Artefakt ins Exil, schicke die vier weiteren Permanente, die du kontrollierst, und/oder Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Bringe diese Karte transformiert unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück. Spiele Anfertigung wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Das Enigma-Juwel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637073&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'252b922c-4b7b-48d5-bf9e-974946ac515b\', \'multiverseId\': 637073}, \'multiverseid\': 637073}, {\'name\': \'La joya enigmática // Epicentro de la iluminación\', \'text\': \'La joya enigmática entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}{C}. Usa este maná solo para activar habilidades.\\nElaborar con cuatro o más objetos que no sean tierra con habilidades activadas {8}{U}. ({8}{U}, exiliar este artefacto, exiliar los cuatro o más objetos de entre otros permanentes que controlas y/o cartas de tu cementerio: Regresa esta carta transformada bajo el control de su propietario. Activa la habilidad de elaborar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'La joya enigmática\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4010d5-856a-4ff4-b2e1-3099a9f60cea\', \'multiverseId\': 637394}, \'multiverseid\': 637394}, {\'name\': "Le Joyau énigme // Locus de l\'illumination", \'text\': \'Le Joyau énigme arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour activer des capacités.\\nFaçonnez avec au moins quatre non-terrains avec des capacités activées {8}{U} ({8}{U}, exilez cet artefact, exilez au moins les quatre parmi les autres permanents non-terrain avec des capacités activées que vous contrôlez et/ou les cartes de permanent non-terrain avec des capacités activées de votre cimetière : Renvoyez cette carte transformée sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Ne façonnez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Le Joyau énigme\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637715&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b33ac49-b388-433a-9b53-f4296b3bf201\', \'multiverseId\': 637715}, \'multiverseid\': 637715}, {\'name\': "Il Gioiello dell\'Enigma // Locus dell\'Illuminazione", \'text\': "Il Gioiello dell\'Enigma entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Spendi questo mana solo per attivare abilità.\\nCostruisci con quattro o più oggetti non terra con abilità attivate {8}{U} ({8}{U}, Esilia questo artefatto, Esilia i quattro oggetti scelti tra gli altri permanenti che controlli e/o le carte nel tuo cimitero: Rimetti questa carta trasformata sotto il controllo del suo proprietario. Costruisci solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': "Il Gioiello dell\'Enigma", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84c23de0-3865-4014-8fa6-237e32084fd2\', \'multiverseId\': 638036}, \'multiverseid\': 638036}, {\'name\': \'奇怪な宝石 // 啓蒙の神座\', \'text\': \'奇怪な宝石はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}{C}を加える。このマナは、能力を起動するためにしか支払えない。\\n起動型能力を持ち土地でない４つ以上で作製{8}{U} （{8}{U}, このアーティファクトを追放する, あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないパーマネントやあなたの墓地にあるカードであり該当する４つ以上を追放する：このカードをオーナーのコントロール下で変身させた状態で戻す。作製はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'奇怪な宝石\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63095370-0f84-41cf-976b-9aeacf0e6304\', \'multiverseId\': 638357}, \'multiverseid\': 638357}, {\'name\': \'A Joia do Enigma // Locus do Esclarecimento\', \'text\': \'A Joia do Enigma entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}{C}. Gaste este mana somente para ativar habilidades.\\nConstruir com quatro ou mais não terrenos com habilidades ativadas {8}{U} ({8}{U}, exile este artefato, exile quatro ou mais outras permanentes que você controla e/ou cards em seu cemitério: Devolva este card ao campo de batalha transformado sob o controle de seu dono. Construa somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'A Joia do Enigma\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'528e96a2-eaeb-40ec-bdb1-b78b61a19672\', \'multiverseId\': 638678}, \'multiverseid\': 638678}, {\'name\': \'谜奇珠宝 // 启蒙之核\', \'text\': \'谜奇珠宝须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{C}{C}。此法术力只能用来起动异能。\\n以四个或更多具起动式异能之非地物件化炼{8}{U}（{8}{U}，放逐此神器，从由你操控的其他永久物和／或你坟墓场的牌中放逐前述化炼物件达四个或更多：将此牌在其拥有者的操控下移回且已转化。只能于法术时机化炼。）\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'谜奇珠宝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36dbb988-91e6-40fa-8003-94a13154c2a2\', \'multiverseId\': 638999}, \'multiverseid\': 638999}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Enigma-Juwel // Sammelpunkt der Erleuchtung\', \'text\': \'Der Sammelpunkt der Erleuchtung hat alle aktivierten Fähigkeiten von Karten, die ins Exil geschickt wurden, um ihn anzufertigen. Du kannst jede der Fähigkeiten nur einmal pro Zug aktivieren.\\nImmer wenn du eine Fähigkeit aktivierst, die keine Manafähigkeit ist, kopiere sie. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Sammelpunkt der Erleuchtung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637073&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'252b922c-4b7b-48d5-bf9e-974946ac515b\', \'multiverseId\': 637073}, \'multiverseid\': 637073}, {\'name\': \'La joya enigmática // Epicentro de la iluminación\', \'text\': \'El Epicentro de la iluminación tiene cada habilidad activada de las cartas exiliadas usadas para elaborarlo. Puedes activar cada una de esas habilidades solo una vez cada turno.\\nSiempre que actives una habilidad que no sea una habilidad de maná, cópiala. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Epicentro de la iluminación\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4010d5-856a-4ff4-b2e1-3099a9f60cea\', \'multiverseId\': 637394}, \'multiverseid\': 637394}, {\'name\': "Le Joyau énigme // Locus de l\'illumination", \'text\': "Le Locus de l\'illumination a chaque capacité activée des cartes exilées utilisées pour le façonner. Vous ne pouvez activer chacune de ces capacités qu\'une seule fois par tour.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous activez une capacité qui n\'est pas une capacité de mana, copiez-la. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': "Locus de l\'illumination", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637715&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b33ac49-b388-433a-9b53-f4296b3bf201\', \'multiverseId\': 637715}, \'multiverseid\': 637715}, {\'name\': "Il Gioiello dell\'Enigma // Locus dell\'Illuminazione", \'text\': "Il Locus dell\'Illuminazione ha ogni abilità attivata delle carte esiliate usate per costruirlo. Puoi attivare ognuna di quelle abilità solo una volta per turno.\\nOgniqualvolta attivi un\'abilità che non è un\'abilità di mana, copiala. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': "Locus dell\'Illuminazione", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84c23de0-3865-4014-8fa6-237e32084fd2\', \'multiverseId\': 638036}, \'multiverseid\': 638036}, {\'name\': \'奇怪な宝石 // 啓蒙の神座\', \'text\': \'啓蒙の神座はこれを作製するために追放されているカードのすべての起動型能力を持つ。それらの各能力をそれぞれ、毎ターン１回のみ起動してもよい。\\nあなたがマナ能力でない能力を起動するたび、それをコピーする。そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'啓蒙の神座\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63095370-0f84-41cf-976b-9aeacf0e6304\', \'multiverseId\': 638357}, \'multiverseid\': 638357}, {\'name\': \'A Joia do Enigma // Locus do Esclarecimento\', \'text\': \'Locus do Esclarecimento tem cada habilidade ativada dos cards exilados usados para construí-lo. Você pode ativar cada uma dessas habilidades apenas uma vez a cada turno.\\nToda vez que você ativar uma habilidade que não seja uma habilidade de mana, copie-a. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Locus do Esclarecimento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'528e96a2-eaeb-40ec-bdb1-b78b61a19672\', \'multiverseId\': 638678}, \'multiverseid\': 638678}, {\'name\': \'谜奇珠宝 // 启蒙之核\', \'text\': \'启蒙之核具有所有用以化炼它所放逐之牌的所有起动式异能。每个此类异能每回合你都只能起动一次。\\n每当你起动不属法术力异能的异能时，将它复制。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'启蒙之核\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36dbb988-91e6-40fa-8003-94a13154c2a2\', \'multiverseId\': 638999}, \'multiverseid\': 638999}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Weite suchen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur, eine Verzauberung oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl. Ihr bzw. sein Beherrscher erzeugt zwei Lageplan-Spielsteine. (Sie sind Artefakte mit „{1}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erkundet. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.")\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637026&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4caf760-a0d1-41f9-8c64-77aa5147630b\', \'multiverseId\': 637026}, \'multiverseid\': 637026}, {\'name\': \'Mandar al diablo\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura, encantamiento o planeswalker objetivo. Su controlador crea dos fichas de Mapa. (Son artefactos con "{1}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: La criatura objetivo que controlas explora. Activa esto solo como un conjuro".)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e30469cf-2b33-404d-af1b-290e0144ac3f\', \'multiverseId\': 637347}, \'multiverseid\': 637347}, {\'name\': \'Sortie explosive\', \'text\': "Détruisez une cible, créature, enchantement ou planeswalker. Son contrôleur crée deux jetons Carte. (Ce sont des artefacts avec « {1}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez explore. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel. »)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637668&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf1c1ce4-c3f6-4d0e-8266-c15aaffe090e\', \'multiverseId\': 637668}, \'multiverseid\': 637668}, {\'name\': \'Perdersi\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura, un incantesimo o un planeswalker bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea due pedine Mappa. (Sono artefatti con "{1}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Una creatura bersaglio che controlli esplora. Attiva solo come una stregoneria".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6271743e-ad68-47b1-a711-87ce3c6dde3a\', \'multiverseId\': 637989}, \'multiverseid\': 637989}, {\'name\': \'失せろ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやエンチャントやプレインズウォーカーである１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは地図・トークン２つを生成する。（それは「{1}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それは探検を行う。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d27c325-6e8f-4ecc-982c-99697701d6cd\', \'multiverseId\': 638310}, \'multiverseid\': 638310}, {\'name\': \'Perder-se\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura, o encantamento ou o planeswalker alvo. O controlador dela cria duas fichas de Mapa. (Elas são artefatos com "{1}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: A criatura alvo que você controla explora. Ative somente como um feitiço".)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aad84de7-08d8-4b5c-85d2-b02f7c55a15f\', \'multiverseId\': 638631}, \'multiverseid\': 638631}, {\'name\': \'速速退离\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物，结界或鹏洛客。其操控者派出两个地图衍生物。（它们是具有「{1}，{T}，牺牲此神器：令目标由你操控的生物勘察。只能于法术时机起动」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=638952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3da40de4-317c-41dc-b26d-94e4448343a3\', \'multiverseId\': 638952}, \'multiverseid\': 638952}]', "[{'name': 'Das Weite suchen', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Kreatur, eine Verzauberung oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl. Ihr bzw. sein Beherrscher erzeugt zwei Lageplan-Spielsteine.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639279&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15e04ccd-c3ce-42d9-9aad-fc9d002d7916', 'multiverseId': 639279}, 'multiverseid': 639279}, {'name': 'Mandar al diablo', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura, encantamiento o planeswalker objetivo. Su controlador crea dos fichas de Mapa.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639299&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ccd0c97-f3a0-4618-ba17-553df77bba74', 'multiverseId': 639299}, 'multiverseid': 639299}, {'name': 'Sortie explosive', 'text': 'Détruisez une cible, créature, enchantement ou planeswalker. Son contrôleur crée deux jetons Carte.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639319&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5029a4b2-6f8f-45a4-a321-a3129880a474', 'multiverseId': 639319}, 'multiverseid': 639319}, {'name': 'Perdersi', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura, un incantesimo o un planeswalker bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea due pedine Mappa.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639339&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0bd5c26-1617-486c-a029-7410dab7c33b', 'multiverseId': 639339}, 'multiverseid': 639339}, {'name': '失せろ', 'text': 'クリーチャーやエンチャントやプレインズウォーカーである１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは地図・トークン２つを生成する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639359&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd2b7a98-c2f4-441d-aaf3-6077c3748cc9', 'multiverseId': 639359}, 'multiverseid': 639359}, {'name': 'Perder-se', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura, o encantamento ou o planeswalker alvo. O controlador dele cria duas fichas de Mapa.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639379&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ceb4c373-4bf5-4a18-b284-ae19eae33c48', 'multiverseId': 639379}, 'multiverseid': 639379}, {'name': '速速退离', 'text': '消灭目标生物，结界或鹏洛客。其操控者派出两个地图衍生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=639399&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cf3b928-3813-4e27-97b5-6a165f8656e0', 'multiverseId': 639399}, 'multiverseid': 639399}]", '[{\'name\': \'Deeproot Pilgrimage\', \'text\': \'Whenever one or more nontoken Merfolk you control become tapped, create a 1/1 blue Merfolk creature token with hexproof.\', \'type\': \'Enchantment\', \'flavor\': \'"These glyphs are more than trail markings! They tell a story as they go. But does it end in celebration or tragedy?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637070&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6bbc21-2469-4d6b-bdf1-eb986bb60c5c\', \'multiverseId\': 637070}, \'multiverseid\': 637070}, {\'name\': \'Deeproot Pilgrimage\', \'text\': \'Whenever one or more nontoken Merfolk you control become tapped, create a 1/1 blue Merfolk creature token with hexproof.\', \'type\': \'Enchantment\', \'flavor\': \'"These glyphs are more than trail markings! They tell a story as they go. But does it end in celebration or tragedy?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=637391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38e0cf0f-66ea-43d7-9750-9165228dbfa7\', \'multiverseId\': 637391}, \'multiverseid\': 637391}, {\'name\': \'Deeproot Pilgrimage\', \'text\': \'Whenever one or mor